#. type: Title ###
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`POST /api/v1/preview` { #post-preview }"
msgstr "`POST /api/v1/preview` { #post-preview }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid "The label filled in, as an image; nothing is printed."
msgstr "Label yang telah diisi, sebagai imej; tiada apa yang dicetak."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Type | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `label` | string | Name of a label file in the labels folder (see GET /labels), subfolders with '/'; '`.tavletta`' may be left out. Either label or label_content. |\n"
"| `label_content` | object | Or the label itself, as the JSON of a `.tavletta` file, checked like a file that is opened. Its data file is ignored (send data_rows instead), its counter never saved. |\n"
"| `printer` | string | With `printers.toml` on the server: the printer's name (default: the default printer the token may use, or the only one). Without it: a printer model id, if not the label's own (the label is fitted as in the app). |\n"
"| `set` | object | Element name or variable name -> value, as `--set` on the command line; variables in a value are filled in; 'date' sets the moment `{=date}` and `{=time}` start from (ISO 8601). At most 1000 entries. |\n"
"| `set_literal` | object | Like set, but braces in a value are text, not variables. |\n"
"| `counter_start` | integer | The `{=counter}` of the first label; it goes up by the label's step with every label, copy and row. 0 to 999999999999999 |\n"
"| `data_rows` | array of object | Serial labels: one label per row, column name -> value; the label's `{Column}` placeholders take the values. Numbers are taken as text, null as an empty cell. At most 100000 rows, 1000 columns, 2000000 cells, 100000 characters a value. |\n"
"| `data_file` | string | Or a CSV, TSV, ODS or XLSX file in the labels folder. Without data_rows and data_file, the label's own data file is used if it lies beside the label in the labels folder. |\n"
"| `sheet` | string | Sheet of the data file, the first by default. |\n"
"| `row` | integer | Data row to show, from 1. 1 to 100000; default `1` |\n"
"| `format` | `\"png\"` \\| `\"json\"` | 'json': width, height, warnings and the PNG in base64. default `\"png\"` |\n"
"| `view` | `\"preview\"` \\| `\"printer\"` | 'printer': the image as the printer gets it (turned, in its colours). default `\"preview\"` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Medan | Jenis | Maksud |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `label` | string | Nama fail label dalam folder label (lihat GET /labels), subfolder dengan '/'; '`.tavletta`' boleh ditinggalkan. Sama ada label atau label_content. |\n"
"| `label_content` | object | Atau label itu sendiri, sebagai JSON fail `.tavletta`, disemak seperti fail yang dibuka. Fail datanya diabaikan (hantar data_rows sebagai gantinya), pembilangnya tidak pernah disimpan. |\n"
"| `printer` | string | Dengan `printers.toml` pada pelayan: nama pencetak (lalai: pencetak lalai yang boleh digunakan token, atau satu-satunya). Tanpanya: id model pencetak, jika bukan milik label sendiri (label disesuaikan seperti dalam aplikasi). |\n"
"| `set` | object | Nama elemen atau nama pemboleh ubah -> nilai, seperti `--set` pada baris arahan; pemboleh ubah dalam nilai diisi; 'date' menetapkan saat `{=date}` dan `{=time}` bermula (ISO 8601). Paling banyak 1000 entri. |\n"
"| `set_literal` | object | Seperti set, tetapi pendakap dalam nilai ialah teks, bukan pemboleh ubah. |\n"
"| `counter_start` | integer | `{=counter}` label pertama; ia meningkat mengikut langkah label dengan setiap label, salinan dan baris. 0 hingga 999999999999999 |\n"
"| `data_rows` | array of object | Label bersiri: satu label bagi setiap baris, nama lajur -> nilai; pemegang tempat `{Column}` label mengambil nilainya. Nombor diambil sebagai teks, null sebagai sel kosong. Paling banyak 100000 baris, 1000 lajur, 2000000 sel, 100000 aksara bagi setiap nilai. |\n"
"| `data_file` | string | Atau fail CSV, TSV, ODS atau XLSX dalam folder label. Tanpa data_rows dan data_file, fail data milik label digunakan jika ia terletak di sebelah label dalam folder label. |\n"
"| `sheet` | string | Helaian fail data, yang pertama secara lalai. |\n"
"| `row` | integer | Baris data untuk dipaparkan, dari 1. 1 hingga 100000; lalai `1` |\n"
"| `format` | `\"png\"` \\| `\"json\"` | 'json': lebar, tinggi, amaran dan PNG dalam base64. lalai `\"png\"` |\n"
"| `view` | `\"preview\"` \\| `\"printer\"` | 'printer': imej seperti yang diterima pencetak (diputar, dalam warnanya). lalai `\"preview\"` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status | Answer | Codes |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | PNG, or JSON with format=json. Warning codes also in the header X-Tavletta-Warnings (comma-separated). |  |\n"
"| 400 | Invalid request | `bad_request`, `invalid_field`, `unknown_field`, `no_label`, `data_conflict`, `data_column`, `not_json`, `no_rows`, `no_data`, `no_printer`, `too_many_copies` |\n"
"| 404 | No such label, printer or data file | `label_not_found`, `printer_not_found`, `data_not_found` |\n"
"| 413 | Too large: body, data rows or the label to render | `too_large`, `label_too_large` |\n"
"| 422 | The label or its data cannot be used | `file_problem`, `label_not_label`, `label_newer`, `label_damaged`, `label_unprintable`, `data_outside`, `data_problem`, `prepare_failed` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status | Jawapan | Kod |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | PNG, atau JSON dengan format=json. Kod amaran juga dalam pengepala X-Tavletta-Warnings (dipisahkan koma). |  |\n"
"| 400 | Permintaan tidak sah | `bad_request`, `invalid_field`, `unknown_field`, `no_label`, `data_conflict`, `data_column`, `not_json`, `no_rows`, `no_data`, `no_printer`, `too_many_copies` |\n"
"| 404 | Tiada label, pencetak atau fail data sedemikian | `label_not_found`, `printer_not_found`, `data_not_found` |\n"
"| 413 | Terlalu besar: badan, baris data atau label untuk dirender | `too_large`, `label_too_large` |\n"
"| 422 | Label atau datanya tidak boleh digunakan | `file_problem`, `label_not_label`, `label_newer`, `label_damaged`, `label_unprintable`, `data_outside`, `data_problem`, `prepare_failed` |\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n"
"     -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}], \"format\": \"png\"}' \\\n"
"     -o preview.png \\\n"
"     \"$TAVLETTA/preview\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`POST /api/v1/print` { #post-print }"
msgstr "`POST /api/v1/print` { #post-print }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Print: the request is checked, then queued; each printer prints one job at a "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Cetak: permintaan disemak, kemudian diletakkan dalam baris gilir; setiap "
"pencetak mencetak satu kerja cetak pada satu masa."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api.md
msgid "Role: `print`"
msgstr "Peranan: `print`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Type | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `label` | string | Name of a label file in the labels folder (see GET /labels), subfolders with '/'; '`.tavletta`' may be left out. Either label or label_content. |\n"
"| `label_content` | object | Or the label itself, as the JSON of a `.tavletta` file, checked like a file that is opened. Its data file is ignored (send data_rows instead), its counter never saved. |\n"
"| `printer` | string | With `printers.toml` on the server: the printer's name (default: the default printer the token may use, or the only one). Without it: a printer model id, if not the label's own (the label is fitted as in the app). |\n"
"| `set` | object | Element name or variable name -> value, as `--set` on the command line; variables in a value are filled in; 'date' sets the moment `{=date}` and `{=time}` start from (ISO 8601). At most 1000 entries. |\n"
"| `set_literal` | object | Like set, but braces in a value are text, not variables. |\n"
"| `counter_start` | integer | The `{=counter}` of the first label; it goes up by the label's step with every label, copy and row. 0 to 999999999999999 |\n"
"| `data_rows` | array of object | Serial labels: one label per row, column name -> value; the label's `{Column}` placeholders take the values. Numbers are taken as text, null as an empty cell. At most 100000 rows, 1000 columns, 2000000 cells, 100000 characters a value. |\n"
"| `data_file` | string | Or a CSV, TSV, ODS or XLSX file in the labels folder. Without data_rows and data_file, the label's own data file is used if it lies beside the label in the labels folder. |\n"
"| `sheet` | string | Sheet of the data file, the first by default. |\n"
"| `host` | string | Printer address, only without `printers.toml` (default: the one set in the app, else with `--discover` the only printer found). Refused (host_given) with `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `copies` | integer | Copies of each label (each row); at most the printer's max_copies. Copies times rows: at most `--max-labels` (10000 by default), on label sheets at most 999. 1 to 9999; default `1` |\n"
"| `rows` | string | The data rows to print, from 1: '3-10', '5', '7-' (to the last) or '-4'. To print again from where a job stopped. |\n"
"| `no_save_counter` | boolean | Do not save the next `{=counter}` value into the label file. default `false` |\n"
"| `wait` | number | Seconds to wait for the job to finish before answering: 200 if it did, else 202. 0 to 300.0; default `0` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Medan | Jenis | Maksud |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `label` | string | Nama fail label dalam folder label (lihat GET /labels), subfolder dengan '/'; '`.tavletta`' boleh ditinggalkan. Sama ada label atau label_content. |\n"
"| `label_content` | object | Atau label itu sendiri, sebagai JSON fail `.tavletta`, disemak seperti fail yang dibuka. Fail datanya diabaikan (hantar data_rows sebagai gantinya), pembilangnya tidak pernah disimpan. |\n"
"| `printer` | string | Dengan `printers.toml` pada pelayan: nama pencetak (lalai: pencetak lalai yang boleh digunakan token, atau satu-satunya). Tanpanya: id model pencetak, jika bukan milik label sendiri (label disesuaikan seperti dalam aplikasi). |\n"
"| `set` | object | Nama elemen atau nama pemboleh ubah -> nilai, seperti `--set` pada baris arahan; pemboleh ubah dalam nilai diisi; 'date' menetapkan saat `{=date}` dan `{=time}` bermula (ISO 8601). Paling banyak 1000 entri. |\n"
"| `set_literal` | object | Seperti set, tetapi pendakap dalam nilai ialah teks, bukan pemboleh ubah. |\n"
"| `counter_start` | integer | `{=counter}` label pertama; ia meningkat mengikut langkah label dengan setiap label, salinan dan baris. 0 hingga 999999999999999 |\n"
"| `data_rows` | array of object | Label bersiri: satu label bagi setiap baris, nama lajur -> nilai; pemegang tempat `{Column}` label mengambil nilainya. Nombor diambil sebagai teks, null sebagai sel kosong. Paling banyak 100000 baris, 1000 lajur, 2000000 sel, 100000 aksara bagi setiap nilai. |\n"
"| `data_file` | string | Atau fail CSV, TSV, ODS atau XLSX dalam folder label. Tanpa data_rows dan data_file, fail data milik label digunakan jika ia terletak di sebelah label dalam folder label. |\n"
"| `sheet` | string | Helaian fail data, yang pertama secara lalai. |\n"
"| `host` | string | Alamat pencetak, hanya tanpa `printers.toml` (lalai: yang ditetapkan dalam aplikasi, jika tidak dengan `--discover` satu-satunya pencetak yang ditemui). Ditolak (host_given) dengan `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `copies` | integer | Salinan bagi setiap label (setiap baris); paling banyak max_copies pencetak. Salinan darab baris: paling banyak `--max-labels` (10000 secara lalai), pada helaian label paling banyak 999. 1 hingga 9999; lalai `1` |\n"
"| `rows` | string | Baris data untuk dicetak, dari 1: '3-10', '5', '7-' (hingga yang terakhir) atau '-4'. Untuk mencetak semula dari tempat kerja cetak berhenti. |\n"
"| `no_save_counter` | boolean | Jangan simpan nilai `{=counter}` seterusnya dalam fail label. lalai `false` |\n"
"| `wait` | number | Saat menunggu kerja cetak selesai sebelum menjawab: 200 jika selesai, jika tidak 202. 0 hingga 300.0; lalai `0` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status | Answer | Codes |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | The job finished within 'wait' |  |\n"
"| 202 | Queued or printing; follow it at Location |  |\n"
"| 400 | Invalid request | `bad_request`, `invalid_field`, `unknown_field`, `no_label`, `data_conflict`, `data_column`, `not_json`, `no_rows`, `no_data`, `no_printer`, `no_host`, `host_given`, `too_many_copies` |\n"
"| 404 | No such label, printer or data file, or a printer the token may not use | `label_not_found`, `printer_not_found`, `data_not_found` |\n"
"| 409 | The label file is not writable: the next counter value could not be saved, nothing was printed; or it was replaced while the request was checked (label_changed): send it again | `counter_not_saved`, `label_changed` |\n"
"| 413 | Too large: body, data rows, labels in one job or the label to render | `too_large`, `too_many_labels`, `label_too_large` |\n"
"| 422 | The label would print wrongly | `file_problem`, `label_not_label`, `label_newer`, `label_damaged`, `label_unprintable`, `data_outside`, `data_problem` |\n"
"| 429 | Too many wrong tokens, or too many jobs waiting (100 in all, 20 per named token) | `too_many_requests`, `queue_full` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status | Jawapan | Kod |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | Kerja cetak selesai dalam 'wait' |  |\n"
"| 202 | Menunggu atau mencetak; ikuti di Location |  |\n"
"| 400 | Permintaan tidak sah | `bad_request`, `invalid_field`, `unknown_field`, `no_label`, `data_conflict`, `data_column`, `not_json`, `no_rows`, `no_data`, `no_printer`, `no_host`, `host_given`, `too_many_copies` |\n"
"| 404 | Tiada label, pencetak atau fail data sedemikian, atau pencetak yang tidak boleh digunakan token | `label_not_found`, `printer_not_found`, `data_not_found` |\n"
"| 409 | Fail label tidak boleh ditulis: nilai pembilang seterusnya tidak dapat disimpan, tiada apa dicetak; atau ia diganti semasa permintaan disemak (label_changed): hantar semula | `counter_not_saved`, `label_changed` |\n"
"| 413 | Terlalu besar: badan, baris data, label dalam satu kerja cetak atau label untuk dirender | `too_large`, `too_many_labels`, `label_too_large` |\n"
"| 422 | Label akan dicetak dengan salah | `file_problem`, `label_not_label`, `label_newer`, `label_damaged`, `label_unprintable`, `data_outside`, `data_problem` |\n"
"| 429 | Terlalu banyak token salah, atau terlalu banyak kerja cetak menunggu (100 kesemuanya, 20 bagi setiap token bernama) | `too_many_requests`, `queue_full` |\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n"
"     -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}], \"wait\": 30}' \\\n"
"     \"$TAVLETTA/print\"\n"
msgstr ""

