#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job { #job }"
msgstr "Job { #job }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Type | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `id` | string | Random, 16 characters. |\n"
"| `state` | `\"queued\"` \\| `\"waiting\"` \\| `\"printing\"` \\| `\"done\"` \\| `\"failed\"` \\| `\"canceled\"` | waiting: its turn came, another job holds the label file (its counter). done, failed and canceled are final. |\n"
"| `printer` | string | Printer model id. |\n"
"| `printer_name` | string or null | Its name in `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `host` | string | The printer's address. |\n"
"| `owner` | string or null | Name of the token. |\n"
"| `label` | string or null | Name in the labels folder; null for label_content. |\n"
"| `printed` | integer | Labels printed so far, for certain; rises label by label while the job prints, as far as the printer tells. |\n"
"| `printed_max` | integer or null | After a failure whose outcome the printer could not tell (the connection was lost while it printed): up to this many labels may have printed. The counter goes on after them; rows_printed counts the rows printed for certain, so printing again from the next one may print labels twice. null otherwise. |\n"
"| `total` | integer | Labels to print: copies x rows. |\n"
"| `rows_printed` | integer | Data rows printed in full: after a failure, print again with rows set to the next one (rows_printed + first row). |\n"
"| `cancel_requested` | boolean | DELETE was sent. |\n"
"| `error` | null or Warning | Why it failed: `printer_<code>`, counter_not_saved, label_locked or prepare_failed. |\n"
"| `remark` | string or null | A note of the printer, for people. |\n"
"| `warnings` | array of Warning | Found when it was checked; it printed anyway. other_labels_loaded: the printer reports other labels loaded than the label's (their size, or the label distance it measured); for a printer of `printers.toml` as in a preview when the job is queued, and replaced by what the printer reports when the job prints, if it then tells of the loaded labels. |\n"
"| `created` | string | UTC. |\n"
"| `started` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `finished` | string or null |  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Medan | Jenis | Maksud |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `id` | string | Rawak, 16 aksara. |\n"
"| `state` | `\"queued\"` \\| `\"waiting\"` \\| `\"printing\"` \\| `\"done\"` \\| `\"failed\"` \\| `\"canceled\"` | waiting: gilirannya tiba, kerja cetak lain menahan fail label (pembilangnya). done, failed dan canceled adalah muktamad. |\n"
"| `printer` | string | Id model pencetak. |\n"
"| `printer_name` | string or null | Namanya dalam `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `host` | string | Alamat pencetak. |\n"
"| `owner` | string or null | Nama token. |\n"
"| `label` | string or null | Nama dalam folder label; null untuk label_content. |\n"
"| `printed` | integer | Label yang sudah dicetak setakat ini, dengan pasti; meningkat label demi label semasa kerja cetak berjalan, setakat yang dimaklumkan pencetak. |\n"
"| `printed_max` | integer or null | Selepas kegagalan yang keputusannya tidak dapat dimaklumkan pencetak (sambungan terputus semasa mencetak): sehingga sebanyak ini label mungkin telah dicetak. Pembilang diteruskan selepasnya; rows_printed mengira baris yang pasti dicetak, jadi mencetak semula dari baris berikutnya boleh mencetak label dua kali. null jika tidak. |\n"
"| `total` | integer | Label untuk dicetak: salinan x baris. |\n"
"| `rows_printed` | integer | Baris data yang dicetak sepenuhnya: selepas kegagalan, cetak semula dengan rows ditetapkan kepada yang seterusnya (rows_printed + baris pertama). |\n"
"| `cancel_requested` | boolean | DELETE telah dihantar. |\n"
"| `error` | null or Warning | Sebab kegagalan: `printer_<code>`, counter_not_saved, label_locked atau prepare_failed. |\n"
"| `remark` | string or null | Nota pencetak, untuk manusia. |\n"
"| `warnings` | array of Warning | Ditemui apabila disemak; ia tetap dicetak. other_labels_loaded: pencetak melaporkan label yang dimuatkan lain daripada label anda (saiznya, atau jarak label yang diukurnya); untuk pencetak dalam `printers.toml` seperti dalam pratonton apabila kerja cetak diletakkan dalam baris gilir, dan digantikan dengan apa yang dilaporkan pencetak apabila kerja cetak dicetak, jika ia ketika itu memberitahu tentang label yang dimuatkan. |\n"
"| `created` | string | UTC. |\n"
"| `started` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `finished` | string or null |  |\n"

