"| `builtin_variables` | array of string |  |\n"
"| `columns` | array of string | Pemegang tempat `{Column}`: kunci data_rows. |\n"
"| `data_file` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `data_file_unusable` | boolean |  |\n"
"| `data_file_missing` | boolean | data_file tidak ada (lagi): hantar baris dalam data_rows. |\n"
"| `data_sheet` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `counter` | object | used (label mempunyai `{=counter}`), next, step. |\n"
"| `features` | array of string |  |\n"
