#. type: Title ###
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "PrinterStatus { #printerstatus }"
msgstr "PrinterStatus { #printerstatus }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Type | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `printer` | string |  |\n"
"| `host` | string |  |\n"
"| `name` | string | Its name in `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `model` | string |  |\n"
"| `state` | string |  |\n"
"| `error` | null or Warning |  |\n"
"| `dpi` | number |  |\n"
"| `firmware` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `modes` | array of string |  |\n"
"| `media` | object | What is loaded and how the printer is set up, as far as it tells (null: not told): tape_mm, remaining_mm, total_mm, pitch_mm (die-cut labels: the label distance measured), width_mm (the print width set on a ZPL printer: a setting, not the loaded labels), print_method (direct or transfer, as set on the printer), media_type (gap, mark or continuous: how the printer is set to find the labels), cassette. Not told by the printer but from the server's settings for it: job_print_method and job_media_type, what this server's jobs do. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Medan | Jenis | Maksud |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `printer` | string |  |\n"
"| `host` | string |  |\n"
"| `name` | string | Namanya dalam `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `model` | string |  |\n"
"| `state` | string |  |\n"
"| `error` | null or Warning |  |\n"
"| `dpi` | number |  |\n"
"| `firmware` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `modes` | array of string |  |\n"
"| `media` | object | Apa yang dimuatkan dan bagaimana pencetak ditetapkan, setakat yang diberitahunya (null: tidak diberitahu): tape_mm, remaining_mm, total_mm, pitch_mm (label potong-acuan: jarak label yang diukur), width_mm (lebar cetakan yang ditetapkan pada pencetak ZPL: satu tetapan, bukan label yang dimuatkan), print_method (direct atau transfer, seperti ditetapkan pada pencetak), media_type (gap, mark atau continuous: cara pencetak ditetapkan untuk menemui label), cassette. Tidak diberitahu oleh pencetak tetapi daripada tetapan pelayan untuknya: job_print_method dan job_media_type, apa yang dilakukan kerja cetak pelayan ini. |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preview { #preview }"
msgstr "Preview { #preview }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Type | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `width` | integer |  |\n"
"| `height` | integer |  |\n"
"| `warnings` | array of Warning | What would print wrongly. other_labels_loaded: the printer of `printers.toml` reports other labels loaded than the label's (their size, or the label distance it measured). Its latest answer counts if it is of the last minute, an error as nothing known (asked anew in the background); a printer not known yet is waited for up to a second after the label is rendered. |\n"
"| `png` | string |  |\n"
"| `geometry` | null or Geometry | Where the elements are in the image; null for view=printer and a label turned onto its sheet. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Medan | Jenis | Maksud |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `width` | integer |  |\n"
"| `height` | integer |  |\n"
"| `warnings` | array of Warning | Apa yang akan dicetak dengan salah. other_labels_loaded: pencetak dalam `printers.toml` melaporkan label yang dimuatkan lain daripada label anda (saiznya, atau jarak label yang diukurnya). Jawapan terkininya diambil kira jika umurnya kurang daripada seminit, ralat dianggap tiada apa yang diketahui (ditanya semula di latar belakang); pencetak yang belum diketahui ditunggu sehingga satu saat selepas label dirender. |\n"
"| `png` | string |  |\n"
"| `geometry` | null or Geometry | Di mana elemen berada dalam imej; null untuk view=printer dan label yang diputar pada helaiannya. |\n"

