#. type: Title #
#: docs/contribute.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr "Menyumbang"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"Code, bug reports, translations and tests with other printers, cassettes and "
"label rolls are welcome."
msgstr ""
"Kod, laporan pepijat, terjemahan dan ujian dengan pencetak, kaset dan "
"gulungan label lain amat dialu-alukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"Issues and pull requests on [GitHub](https://github.com/joshii-h/tavletta) "
"are welcome, no Forgejo account needed. They are copied automatically to "
"[Forgejo](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta), the main "
"repository, with a link on GitHub. Review and merge happen there; your "
"commits are kept, so GitHub shows the pull request as merged. The discussion "
"can stay on GitHub.  With a Forgejo account you can contribute there "
"directly.  Details: [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/"
"tavletta/src/branch/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)."
msgstr ""
"Issue dan pull request di [GitHub](https://github.com/joshii-h/tavletta) "
"dialu-alukan, tidak memerlukan akaun Forgejo. Ia disalin secara automatik ke "
"[Forgejo](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta), repositori utama, "
"dengan pautan di GitHub. Semakan dan penggabungan berlaku di sana; commit "
"anda dikekalkan, jadi GitHub memaparkan pull request sebagai telah "
"digabungkan. Perbincangan boleh kekal di GitHub. Dengan akaun Forgejo anda "
"boleh menyumbang terus di sana. Butiran: [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid "**App translations**: `tools/strings_<lang>.py`, see CONTRIBUTING."
msgstr ""
"**Terjemahan aplikasi**: `tools/strings_<lang>.py`, lihat CONTRIBUTING."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"**This documentation**: `site/po/<lang>.po`, see [site/README.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/site/README.md).  Names "
"of buttons and settings come from the app translation automatically."
msgstr ""
"**Dokumentasi ini**: `site/po/<lang>.po`, lihat [site/README.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/site/README.md). Nama "
"butang dan tetapan diambil secara automatik daripada terjemahan aplikasi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"**Other printers**: printing goes through a backend interface; a new printer "
"is a new backend. The protocols of the supported printers are described in "
"[docs/](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs), "
"one file per printer."
msgstr ""
"**Pencetak lain**: pencetakan melalui antara muka backend; pencetak baharu "
"ialah backend baharu. Protokol pencetak yang disokong diterangkan dalam "
"[docs/](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs), "
"satu fail bagi setiap pencetak."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tavletta"
msgstr "Tavletta"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta designs labels under Linux and prints them over the network or USB: "
"on label printers with endless tape or die-cut labels, and on office "
"printers, one label per page or on label sheets. It talks to each printer in "
"its own language."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mereka bentuk label di Linux dan mencetaknya melalui rangkaian atau "
"USB: pada pencetak label dengan pita tanpa putus atau label potong-acuan, "
"dan pada pencetak pejabat, satu label setiap halaman atau pada helaian "
"label. Ia bercakap dengan setiap pencetak dalam bahasanya sendiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta is Romansh for a small tablet (from tavla, table/board). Pronounced "
"tav-LET-ta."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta dalam bahasa Romansh bermaksud papan kecil (daripada tavla, meja/"
"papan). Disebut tav-LET-ta."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"![Main window](media/main.png#only-light)  ![Main window](media/main-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Main window](media/main.png#only-light)  ![Main window](media/main-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Text, images, [symbols](use.md), QR codes and barcodes of many types; "
"backgrounds printed edge to edge"
msgstr ""
"Teks, imej, [simbol](use.md), kod QR dan kod bar pelbagai jenis; latar "
"belakang dicetak hingga ke tepi"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[Text styles](use.md#text-style), [lines and shapes](use.md#shapes), and a "
"[free layout](use.md#free-layout) with each element at its own place; undo "
"and redo"
msgstr ""
"[Gaya teks](use.md#text-style), [garisan dan bentuk](use.md#shapes), dan "
"[reka letak bebas](use.md#free-layout) dengan setiap elemen di tempatnya "
"sendiri; buat asal dan buat semula"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "Preview at print resolution: what you see is what is printed"
msgstr ""
"Pratonton pada resolusi cetakan: apa yang anda lihat ialah apa yang dicetak"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "Endless tape as long as the content, or die-cut labels of any size"
msgstr ""
"Pita tanpa putus sepanjang kandungan, atau label potong-acuan dalam sebarang "
"saiz"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[Serial labels](serial.md): one label for each row of a CSV, ODS or XLSX "
"file; variables such as date and counter, and a command line"
msgstr ""
"[Label bersiri](serial.md): satu label bagi setiap baris fail CSV, ODS atau "
"XLSX; pemboleh ubah seperti tarikh dan pembilang, serta baris arahan"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[Label sheets](sheets.md) on office printers, and shipping labels from a "
"carrier's PDF"
msgstr ""
"[Helaian label](sheets.md) pada pencetak pejabat, dan label penghantaran "
"daripada PDF syarikat penghantaran"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Finds the printer in the network and on USB, reads what is loaded and "
"explains printer problems in plain words"
msgstr ""
"Menemui pencetak dalam rangkaian dan pada USB, membaca apa yang dimuatkan "
"dan menerangkan masalah pencetak dengan kata-kata mudah"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "A [print server](server.md) for other programs and AI assistants"
msgstr "[Pelayan cetak](server.md) untuk program lain dan pembantu AI"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "27 languages, follows the light or dark mode of the desktop"
msgstr "27 bahasa, mengikut mod cerah atau gelap desktop"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"The supported printers and what each one can do are listed under [Printers]"
"(printer.md). Further printers can be added as a backend, see [Contribute]"
"(contribute.md)."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak yang disokong dan apa yang boleh dilakukan oleh setiap satu "
"disenaraikan di bawah [Pencetak](printer.md). Pencetak lain boleh ditambah "
"sebagai backend, lihat [Menyumbang](contribute.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Pemasangan"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flatpak"
msgstr "Flatpak"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid "Flathub is in preparation. Until then, build it yourself:"
msgstr "Flathub sedang disediakan. Sementara itu, bina sendiri:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git && cd tavletta\n"
"flatpak install --user flathub org.gnome.Sdk//51 org.gnome.Platform//51\n"
"flatpak-builder --user --install --force-clean build-dir \\\n"
"    build-aux/flatpak/xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta.yml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "install.sh"
msgstr "install.sh"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Install the system packages, then run the script as your user (no root):"
msgstr ""
"Pasang pakej sistem, kemudian jalankan skrip sebagai pengguna anda (tanpa "
"root):"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Distribution | Packages |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Debian, Ubuntu | `python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-4.0 gir1.2-adw-1 python3-gi-cairo python3-venv gettext` |\n"
"| Fedora | `python3-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python3-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Arch | `python-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Gentoo | `dev-python/pygobject gui-libs/gtk:4 gui-libs/libadwaita dev-python/pycairo sys-devel/gettext` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pengedaran | Pakej |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Debian, Ubuntu | `python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-4.0 gir1.2-adw-1 python3-gi-cairo python3-venv gettext` |\n"
"| Fedora | `python3-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python3-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Arch | `python-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Gentoo | `dev-python/pygobject gui-libs/gtk:4 gui-libs/libadwaita dev-python/pycairo sys-devel/gettext` |\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git && cd tavletta\n"
"./install.sh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Uninstall: `./install.sh --uninstall` or `flatpak uninstall "
"xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta`.  Saved labels and templates are kept."
msgstr ""
"Nyahpasang: `./install.sh --uninstall` atau `flatpak uninstall "
"xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta`. Label dan templat yang disimpan dikekalkan."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "First label"
msgstr "Label pertama"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Switch the printer on and choose it under [[ui:Printer model]]: a printer "
"found on USB or in the network (Bonjour) is at the top of the list. Tavletta "
"reads what is loaded: the tape width or the distance between the labels."
msgstr ""
"Hidupkan pencetak dan pilihnya di bawah [[ui:Printer model]]: pencetak yang "
"ditemui melalui USB atau dalam rangkaian (Bonjour) berada di bahagian atas "
"senarai. Tavletta membaca apa yang dimuatkan: lebar pita atau jarak antara "
"label."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Not found? Enter the address under [[ui:Host name or IP address]], e.g.  "
"`printer.local` or `192.168.1.50`. New printer: connect it to the network "
"first, see [Printers](printer.md)."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ditemui? Masukkan alamat di bawah [[ui:Host name or IP address]], cth. "
"`printer.local` atau `192.168.1.50`. Pencetak baharu: sambungkan ke "
"rangkaian dahulu, lihat [Pencetak](printer.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "[[ui:Add]] text, an image or a code, then [[ui:Print]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Add]] teks, imej atau kod, kemudian [[ui:Print]]."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Save]] stores the label as `.tavletta` file, [[ui:Save as template…]] "
"adds it to [[ui:Templates]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Save]] menyimpan label sebagai fail `.tavletta`, [[ui:Save as "
"template…]] menambahkannya ke [[ui:Templates]]."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printers and troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pencetak dan penyelesaian masalah"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Choose the printer under [[ui:Printer model]]; each one has its own section "
"below. Printers Tavletta finds on USB and in the network come first in that "
"list, under [[ui:Found]], with their model: choosing one takes its model and "
"its address. The models follow under [[ui:All models]]. Tavletta looks for "
"them when the window opens and with [[ui:Search for printers]], every model "
"at the same time, in the background."
msgstr ""
"Pilih pencetak di bawah [[ui:Printer model]]; setiap satu mempunyai "
"bahagiannya sendiri di bawah. Pencetak yang ditemui Tavletta melalui USB dan "
"dalam rangkaian muncul dahulu dalam senarai itu, di bawah [[ui:Found]], "
"bersama modelnya: memilih satu akan mengambil model dan alamatnya. Model-"
"model menyusul di bawah [[ui:All models]]. Tavletta mencarinya apabila "
"tetingkap dibuka dan dengan [[ui:Search for printers]], semua model "
"serentak, di latar belakang."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All printers { #common }"
msgstr "Semua pencetak { #common }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:No printer found]]: printer on and in the same network? The search "
"needs the Avahi service (installed on most desktops, any init system); "
"systemd-resolved alone resolves `.local` names but cannot search. Otherwise "
"enter the address under [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:No printer found]]: pencetak hidup dan dalam rangkaian yang sama? "
"Carian memerlukan perkhidmatan Avahi (dipasang pada kebanyakan desktop, "
"dengan mana-mana sistem init); systemd-resolved sahaja boleh menyelesaikan "
"nama `.local` tetapi tidak boleh mencari. Jika tidak, masukkan alamat di "
"bawah [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]]: check the address, the printer may have a new "
"IP. Switch the printer off and on again. On USB: check the cable and search "
"again."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]]: semak alamat, pencetak mungkin mendapat IP "
"baharu. Matikan dan hidupkan semula pencetak. Pada USB: semak kabel dan cari "
"semula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"No permission for the USB port: your user needs to be in the group `lp`.  "
"Run `sudo usermod -aG lp $USER`, then log out and in again. NIIMBOT printers "
"use another group, see [NIIMBOT](#niimbot)."
msgstr ""
"Tiada kebenaran untuk port USB: pengguna anda perlu berada dalam kumpulan "
"`lp`. Jalankan `sudo usermod -aG lp $USER`, kemudian log keluar dan log "
"masuk semula. Pencetak NIIMBOT menggunakan kumpulan lain, lihat [NIIMBOT]"
"(#niimbot)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB printer not found: check the cable, switch the printer on and wake it up "
"(a sleeping printer can drop off USB), then search again."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak USB tidak ditemui: semak kabel, hidupkan pencetak dan bangunkannya "
"(pencetak yang tidur boleh terputus daripada USB), kemudian cari semula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"\"The printer is busy\" on USB: only one program can use a USB printer at a "
"time. Close other label software, or wait until the running print is done."
msgstr ""
"\"The printer is busy\" pada USB: hanya satu program boleh menggunakan "
"pencetak USB pada satu masa. Tutup perisian label lain, atau tunggu sehingga "
"cetakan yang sedang berjalan selesai."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer needs attention]]: the printer is reachable but reports a "
"problem, the text below says what to do. Clear it on the printer, then "
"[[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer needs attention]]: pencetak boleh dicapai tetapi melaporkan "
"masalah, teks di bawah menyatakan apa yang perlu dilakukan. Selesaikannya "
"pada pencetak, kemudian [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Content cut off at the edge or askew: increase the [[ui:Safety margin]]."
msgstr ""
"Kandungan terpotong di tepi atau senget: tingkatkan [[ui:Safety margin]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:content scaled down to fit]]: the content does not fit the label.  Make "
"the label longer or larger, use [[ui:Automatic length]] on tape, or shorten "
"the content."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:content scaled down to fit]]: kandungan tidak muat pada label. Jadikan "
"label lebih panjang atau lebih besar, gunakan [[ui:Automatic length]] pada "
"pita, atau pendekkan kandungan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (die-cut labels): the printer reports labels "
"of another size, or measured another distance from one label to the next "
"than height plus [[ui:Gap]] of your label.  [[ui:Use loaded labels]] changes "
"the label and prints nothing yet: it takes the size the printer reports "
"(Brother QL), or sets the height along the roll so that height plus gap make "
"the measured distance (cab, Zebra). The gap and the width stay; a Zebra's "
"print width is what the last print set, not the width of the labels. Where "
"that height would be less than 5 mm, the gap is changed instead; where "
"neither makes a label, only [[ui:Print anyway]] is offered."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (label potong-mati): pencetak melaporkan "
"label dengan saiz lain, atau mengukur jarak yang berbeza antara satu label "
"dengan label berikutnya daripada ketinggian ditambah [[ui:Gap]] label anda. "
"[[ui:Use loaded labels]] mengubah label dan belum mencetak apa-apa: ia "
"mengambil saiz yang dilaporkan pencetak (Brother QL), atau menetapkan "
"ketinggian sepanjang gulungan supaya ketinggian ditambah jurang menjadi "
"jarak yang diukur (cab, Zebra). Jurang dan lebar kekal; lebar cetakan Zebra "
"ialah yang ditetapkan oleh cetakan terakhir, bukan lebar label. Jika "
"ketinggian itu kurang daripada 5 mm, jurang yang diubah; jika kedua-duanya "
"tidak menghasilkan label, hanya [[ui:Print anyway]] ditawarkan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"After [[ui:Use loaded labels]], check the label in the preview, then print. "
"[[ui:Undo]] in the message takes the change back; the message says so if "
"elements now reach beyond the edge of the label."
msgstr ""
"Selepas [[ui:Use loaded labels]], semak label dalam pratonton, kemudian "
"cetak. [[ui:Undo]] dalam mesej membatalkan perubahan; mesej menyatakannya "
"jika kini ada elemen yang melepasi pinggir label."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brother VC-500W { #vc500w }"
msgstr "Brother VC-500W { #vc500w }"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wi-Fi setup { #wifi }"
msgstr "Persediaan Wi-Fi { #wifi }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta does not set up Wi-Fi. Use a phone or the printer's web interface "
"once:"
msgstr ""
"Tavletta tidak menyediakan Wi-Fi. Gunakan telefon atau antara muka web "
"pencetak sekali:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Hold the Wi-Fi button until it turns from blue to white."
msgstr "Tekan lama butang Wi-Fi sehingga bertukar daripada biru kepada putih."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Connect phone or computer to the open network \"Brother VC-500W…\"."
msgstr ""
"Sambungkan telefon atau komputer ke rangkaian terbuka \"Brother VC-500W…\"."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Open `https://192.168.0.1` (accept the certificate warning) or Brother's "
"Color Label Editor app."
msgstr ""
"Buka `https://192.168.0.1` (terima amaran sijil) atau aplikasi Color Label "
"Editor Brother."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Choose your network and enter the password. Only 2.4 GHz, WPA or open."
msgstr ""
"Pilih rangkaian anda dan masukkan kata laluan. Hanya 2.4 GHz, WPA atau "
"terbuka."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Later, the web interface is at `https://` and the printer's address: "
"\"Network Wi-Fi Setup\" changes the network (or \"click here\" to enter it "
"by hand), \"AirPrint Options\" sets name, location and firmware updates."
msgstr ""
"Kemudian, antara muka web berada di `https://` dan alamat pencetak: "
"\"Network Wi-Fi Setup\" menukar rangkaian (atau \"click here\" untuk "
"memasukkannya secara manual), \"AirPrint Options\" menetapkan nama, lokasi "
"dan kemas kini perisian tegar."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "USB { #vc500w-usb }"
msgstr "USB { #vc500w-usb }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it. Printing over USB "
"has not been tried on a printer yet and follows the observations of others: "
"the printer may not answer over USB at all (then the query ends with "
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]]), and it may not cut by itself, then swipe "
"across its panel. Wi-Fi is the tried way."
msgstr ""
"Palamkan pencetak; [[ui:Search for printers]] menemuinya. Pencetakan melalui "
"USB belum dicuba pada pencetak sebenar dan mengikut pemerhatian orang lain: "
"pencetak mungkin langsung tidak menjawab melalui USB (maka pertanyaan "
"berakhir dengan [[ui:Printer not reachable]]), dan mungkin tidak memotong "
"sendiri, maka leret panelnya. Wi-Fi ialah cara yang telah dicuba."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cassettes"
msgstr "Kaset"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Cassette | Width |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| CZ-1001 | 9 mm (3/8″) |\n"
"| CZ-1002 | 12 mm (1/2″) |\n"
"| CZ-1003 | 19 mm (3/4″) |\n"
"| CZ-1004 | 25 mm (1″) |\n"
"| CZ-1005 | 50 mm (2″) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kaset | Lebar |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| CZ-1001 | 9 mm (3/8″) |\n"
"| CZ-1002 | 12 mm (1/2″) |\n"
"| CZ-1003 | 19 mm (3/4″) |\n"
"| CZ-1004 | 25 mm (1″) |\n"
"| CZ-1005 | 50 mm (2″) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta shows the inserted cassette, remaining tape, printable width, lot "
"number and the presumed production date. ZINK paper ages: old paper prints "
"paler and yellowish, Tavletta warns about old cassettes. Store cassettes "
"cool and dry."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta memaparkan kaset yang dimasukkan, baki pita, lebar boleh cetak, "
"nombor lot dan anggaran tarikh pengeluaran. Kertas ZINK menua: kertas lama "
"mencetak lebih pucat dan kekuningan, Tavletta memberi amaran tentang kaset "
"lama. Simpan kaset di tempat sejuk dan kering."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Cleaning: insert the cleaning cassette CK-1000, cleaning starts by itself.  "
"Do it when stripes appear, or every 20 to 30 labels."
msgstr ""
"Pembersihan: masukkan kaset pembersih CK-1000, pembersihan bermula sendiri. "
"Lakukannya apabila jalur muncul, atau setiap 20 hingga 30 label."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print options { #vc500w-print }"
msgstr "Pilihan cetakan { #vc500w-print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] separates the labels. [[ui:Half cut]] cuts "
"through the label, the backing holds them together. [[ui:No cut]]: the "
"printer waits, swipe its panel to cut."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] memisahkan label. [[ui:Half cut]] memotong "
"menembusi label, kertas pelapik menyatukannya. [[ui:No cut]]: pencetak "
"menunggu, leret panelnya untuk memotong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Vivid]] for the strongest colours, [[ui:Normal]] "
"(Brother: Standard) for softer ones, black and white (400 lpi) for text and "
"codes."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Vivid]] untuk warna terkuat, [[ui:Normal]] (Brother: "
"Standard) untuk warna yang lebih lembut, hitam putih (400 lpi) untuk teks "
"dan kod."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Colour correction: brightness and colour balance (red, green, blue), for "
"this print only, not stored in the printer."
msgstr ""
"Pembetulan warna: kecerahan dan imbangan warna (merah, hijau, biru), untuk "
"cetakan ini sahaja, tidak disimpan dalam pencetak."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #vc500w-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #vc500w-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: the label was designed for another width. Change "
"[[ui:Tape width]] or the cassette."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: label direka untuk lebar lain. Tukar [[ui:Tape "
"width]] atau kaset."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:No cassette inserted]] or cassette not recognised: reinsert the "
"cassette until it clicks."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:No cassette inserted]] atau kaset tidak dikenali: masukkan semula kaset "
"sehingga berbunyi klik."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "No paper: the cassette is empty, replace it."
msgstr "Tiada kertas: kaset kosong, gantikan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Paper jam: open the cover, remove the jammed label, reinsert the cassette."
msgstr ""
"Kertas tersangkut: buka penutup, keluarkan label yang tersangkut, masukkan "
"semula kaset."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Cover open: close the cover."
msgstr "Penutup terbuka: tutup penutup."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Warming up, cooling down, cleaning: wait, printing continues by itself."
msgstr ""
"Memanaskan, menyejuk, membersih: tunggu, pencetakan diteruskan sendiri."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Swipe the panel to cut: the label was printed without cut, swipe across the "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Leret panel untuk memotong: label dicetak tanpa potongan, leret merentasi "
"panel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Pale colours, yellow tint: old paper (see the cassette's age), or "
"[[ui:Normal]] instead of [[ui:Vivid]]. With old cassettes try "
"[[ui:Brightness]] −1 to −3 under [[ui:Colour adjustment]]."
msgstr ""
"Warna pucat, rona kuning: kertas lama (lihat umur kaset), atau [[ui:Normal]] "
"dan bukan [[ui:Vivid]]. Dengan kaset lama cuba [[ui:Brightness]] −1 hingga "
"−3 di bawah [[ui:Colour adjustment]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Background barely visible: ZINK hardly prints very light pastel shades, "
"choose a medium shade."
msgstr ""
"Latar belakang hampir tidak kelihatan: ZINK hampir tidak dapat mencetak "
"warna pastel yang sangat cerah, pilih warna sederhana."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Stripes: clean with the CK-1000."
msgstr "Jalur: bersihkan dengan CK-1000."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Content askew: insert the cassette straight."
msgstr "Kandungan senget: masukkan kaset dengan lurus."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brother QL { #brother-ql }"
msgstr "Brother QL { #brother-ql }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on Brother QL label printers from the QL-500 to the "
"QL-1115NWB, red and black too on the QL-800, QL-810W and QL-820NWB. This has "
"not been tried on a printer yet: it follows the protocol as others "
"documented it. Reports of what works and what does not are very welcome."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mencetak pada pencetak label Brother QL daripada QL-500 hingga "
"QL-1115NWB, merah dan hitam juga pada QL-800, QL-810W dan QL-820NWB. Ini "
"belum dicuba pada pencetak sebenar: ia mengikut protokol seperti yang "
"didokumenkan orang lain. Laporan tentang apa yang berfungsi dan tidak amat "
"dialu-alukan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer model]]: the QL appears twice. Choose \"Brother QL, continuous "
"rolls\" for continuous DK rolls (the label is as long as its content or has "
"a fixed length) and \"Brother QL, die-cut labels\" for die-cut DK labels of "
"a fixed size.  Both use the same printer and settings. If the printer has "
"the other kind of roll loaded, Tavletta offers to [[ui:Switch]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer model]]: QL muncul dua kali. Pilih \"Brother QL, continuous "
"rolls\" untuk gulungan DK tanpa putus (label sepanjang kandungannya atau "
"dengan panjang tetap) dan \"Brother QL, die-cut labels\" untuk label DK "
"potong-acuan dengan saiz tetap. Kedua-duanya menggunakan pencetak dan "
"tetapan yang sama. Jika pencetak memuatkan jenis gulungan yang lain, "
"Tavletta menawarkan untuk [[ui:Switch]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Network: models with Wi-Fi or LAN are reached on port 9100.  [[ui:Search for "
"printers]] finds them, or enter the address."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian: model dengan Wi-Fi atau LAN dicapai pada port 9100. [[ui:Search "
"for printers]] menemuinya, atau masukkan alamat."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB: plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it. On the QL-700 "
"and the QL-800 series, switch off \"Editor Lite\" first (hold its button "
"until the green light goes out), otherwise the printer appears as a USB "
"drive."
msgstr ""
"USB: palamkan pencetak; [[ui:Search for printers]] menemuinya. Pada QL-700 "
"dan siri QL-800, matikan \"Editor Lite\" dahulu (tekan lama butangnya "
"sehingga lampu hijau padam), jika tidak pencetak muncul sebagai pemacu USB."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Before each print Tavletta reads which roll is loaded. A continuous roll of "
"another width is printed scaled to it after a warning ([[ui:Wrong roll]]); "
"die-cut labels of another size get a warning too ([[ui:Different labels "
"loaded]])."
msgstr ""
"Sebelum setiap cetakan Tavletta membaca gulungan yang dimuatkan. Gulungan "
"tanpa putus dengan lebar lain dicetak dengan skala mengikutnya selepas "
"amaran ([[ui:Wrong roll]]); label potong-acuan dengan saiz lain juga "
"mendapat amaran ([[ui:Different labels loaded]])."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Die-cut labels: choose the [[ui:Label size]] of the roll. The printer finds "
"the labels by itself; leave the [[ui:Gap]] at 3 mm. About 1.5 mm at the "
"sides and 3 mm at both ends of each label cannot be printed: a [[ui:Safety "
"margin]] of 3 mm keeps content away from there."
msgstr ""
"Label potong-acuan: pilih [[ui:Label size]] gulungan. Pencetak menemui label "
"sendiri; biarkan [[ui:Gap]] pada 3 mm. Kira-kira 1.5 mm di sisi dan 3 mm di "
"kedua-dua hujung setiap label tidak boleh dicetak: [[ui:Safety margin]] 3 mm "
"menjauhkan kandungan dari situ."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Black and white without dithering: text and codes stay sharp, photos become "
"hard black and white, as the preview shows."
msgstr ""
"Hitam putih tanpa dithering: teks dan kod kekal tajam, foto menjadi hitam "
"putih keras, seperti yang ditunjukkan pratonton."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print options { #brother-ql-print }"
msgstr "Pilihan cetakan { #brother-ql-print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] after every label, [[ui:Cut after the last "
"label]] keeps the copies together as one strip, [[ui:No cut]]. The QL-500 "
"has no cutter and no cut option."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] selepas setiap label, [[ui:Cut after the last "
"label]] mengekalkan salinan bersama sebagai satu jalur, [[ui:No cut]]. "
"QL-500 tiada pemotong dan tiada pilihan potong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Red and black]] appears on the QL-800 series when a 62 "
"mm continuous roll is loaded; red parts of the label print red on the red "
"and black roll DK-22251. That roll needs a red and black job even for black "
"labels: if the choice does not fit the loaded roll, the printer refuses the "
"job, Tavletta prints it the other way and says so.  From then on the choice "
"follows the roll."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Red and black]] muncul pada siri QL-800 apabila "
"gulungan tanpa putus 62 mm dimuatkan; bahagian merah label dicetak merah "
"pada gulungan merah-hitam DK-22251. Gulungan itu memerlukan kerja cetak "
"merah-hitam walaupun untuk label hitam: jika pilihan tidak sepadan dengan "
"gulungan yang dimuatkan, pencetak menolak kerja cetak, Tavletta mencetaknya "
"dengan cara lain dan memberitahu. Selepas itu pilihan mengikut gulungan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Red and black: red parts stay red; images, the background and everything "
"else are converted as for black-and-white printers, see [Black-and-white "
"printers](use.md#black-and-white)."
msgstr ""
"Merah dan hitam: bahagian merah kekal merah; imej, latar belakang dan segala "
"yang lain ditukar seperti pada pencetak hitam putih, lihat [Pencetak hitam "
"putih](use.md#black-and-white)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Quality]]: [[ui:High resolution (600 dpi)]] doubles the resolution "
"along the roll; printing takes longer. Offered on the QL-570, QL-580N, "
"QL-700, QL-710W, QL-720NW, the QL-800 series and the QL-1100 series."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Quality]]: [[ui:High resolution (600 dpi)]] menggandakan resolusi "
"sepanjang gulungan; pencetakan mengambil masa lebih lama. Ditawarkan pada "
"QL-570, QL-580N, QL-700, QL-710W, QL-720NW, siri QL-800 dan siri QL-1100."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #brother-ql-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #brother-ql-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: some models do not answer "
"status requests over the network. Printing works, but Tavletta cannot check "
"the roll first."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: sesetengah model tidak "
"menjawab permintaan keadaan melalui rangkaian. Pencetakan berfungsi, tetapi "
"Tavletta tidak dapat menyemak gulungan terlebih dahulu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"\"The loaded roll does not match the label\": a die-cut roll is loaded for a "
"label on continuous roll, or the other way round. Load the other roll or "
"choose the other entry under [[ui:Printer model]]."
msgstr ""
"\"The loaded roll does not match the label\": gulungan potong-acuan "
"dimuatkan untuk label pada gulungan tanpa putus, atau sebaliknya. Muatkan "
"gulungan yang lain atau pilih entri lain di bawah [[ui:Printer model]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of labels: load a new roll. Cover open: close it. Label jammed: open the "
"cover and remove it, check the cutter."
msgstr ""
"Label habis: muatkan gulungan baharu. Penutup terbuka: tutupnya. Label "
"tersangkut: buka penutup dan keluarkan, semak pemotong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Red parts print black: red and black only works on the QL-800 series with "
"the DK-22251 roll."
msgstr ""
"Bahagian merah dicetak hitam: merah dan hitam hanya berfungsi pada siri "
"QL-800 dengan gulungan DK-22251."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "cab label printers { #cab }"
msgstr "Pencetak label cab { #cab }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on cab printers with a 4 inch print head: EOS2, EOS5, SQUIX "
"4 and MACH 4S, at 203, 300 or 600 dpi. Developed with an EOS2/300."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mencetak pada pencetak cab dengan kepala cetak 4 inci: EOS2, EOS5, "
"SQUIX 4 dan MACH 4S, pada 203, 300 atau 600 dpi. Dibangunkan dengan EOS2/300."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Network: the printer needs an address in your network (DHCP or set on its "
"display). Tavletta uses the \"RawIP\" port 9100 with the JScript "
"interpreter, both are the printer's defaults (Setup > Interfaces > Network "
"services and Setup > Interpreter)."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian: pencetak memerlukan alamat dalam rangkaian anda (DHCP atau "
"ditetapkan pada paparannya). Tavletta menggunakan port \"RawIP\" 9100 dengan "
"jurubahasa JScript, kedua-duanya ialah lalai pencetak (Setup > Interfaces > "
"Network services dan Setup > Interpreter)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB: plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it. Printing over "
"USB has not been tried on a printer yet."
msgstr ""
"USB: palamkan pencetak; [[ui:Search for printers]] menemuinya. Pencetakan "
"melalui USB belum dicuba pada pencetak sebenar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Labels: die-cut labels with a gap, label sensor \"Gap Sensor\". Tavletta "
"sets the sensor for each job. Continuous media and a cutter are not "
"supported yet."
msgstr ""
"Label: label potong-acuan dengan jurang, penderia label \"Gap Sensor\". "
"Tavletta menetapkan penderia bagi setiap kerja cetak. Media tanpa putus dan "
"pemotong belum disokong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print method]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] keeps the printer's own "
"setting. [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] for labels printed with a ribbon, "
"[[ui:Thermal direct]] for labels that print without one. The printer then "
"prints at the speed set on it, if its web interface tells it, else at 50 mm/"
"s. [[ui:Printer details]] show the method set on the printer."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print method]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] mengekalkan tetapan "
"pencetak sendiri. [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] untuk label yang dicetak "
"dengan reben, [[ui:Thermal direct]] untuk label yang dicetak tanpa reben. "
"Pencetak kemudian mencetak pada kelajuan yang ditetapkan padanya, jika "
"antara muka webnya memberitahu, jika tidak pada 50 mm/s. [[ui:Printer "
"details]] menunjukkan kaedah yang ditetapkan pada pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: the label comes out turned by 180°, as the "
"manufacturer's label software prints it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: label keluar diputar 180°, seperti yang dicetak "
"oleh perisian label pengeluar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print offset]]: a printer that prints off the label's place (the print "
"a little higher or lower on every label than the preview shows it) is made "
"up for here: measure on a printed label how far the print lies off, and "
"enter it, positive to move the print down on labels across the roll, "
"negative to move it up. The preview keeps showing the label as it should "
"come out; only what is sent to the printer moves. Content within this "
"distance of the edge the print moves to is cut off."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print offset]]: pencetak yang mencetak tidak pada tempat label (cetakan "
"sedikit lebih tinggi atau lebih rendah pada setiap label daripada yang "
"ditunjukkan pratonton) ditampung di sini: ukur pada label yang dicetak "
"sejauh mana cetakan tersasar, dan masukkannya, positif untuk menggerakkan "
"cetakan ke bawah pada label yang melintang gulungan, negatif untuk "
"menggerakkannya ke atas. Pratonton terus menunjukkan label seperti yang "
"sepatutnya keluar; hanya apa yang dihantar ke pencetak yang bergerak. "
"Kandungan dalam jarak ini dari pinggir tempat cetakan bergerak akan "
"terpotong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Labels per job]]: the labels of a series go to the printer together, up "
"to this many (250 by default, 1 to 1000) in one job, and run through without "
"stopping between them. [[ui:Stop]] takes effect between two jobs: a job that "
"has started is printed in full. 1 sends every label as a job of its own, as "
"other printers get them. Labels whose content changes from copy to copy "
"always go one by one."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Labels per job]]: label dalam satu siri dihantar bersama ke pencetak, "
"sehingga sebanyak ini (250 secara lalai, 1 hingga 1000) dalam satu kerja "
"cetak, dan berjalan tanpa berhenti di antaranya. [[ui:Stop]] berkuat kuasa "
"antara dua kerja cetak: kerja cetak yang sudah bermula dicetak sepenuhnya. 1 "
"menghantar setiap label sebagai kerja cetak tersendiri, seperti yang "
"diterima pencetak lain. Label yang kandungannya berubah dari satu salinan ke "
"salinan lain sentiasa dihantar satu demi satu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Heat and tear-off position stay as set on the printer."
msgstr "Haba dan kedudukan koyak kekal seperti yang ditetapkan pada pencetak."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #cab-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #cab-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]]: the printer measured another distance "
"between the labels than height plus gap of your label. Check [[ui:Label "
"size]] and [[ui:Gap]], or load the right roll. Press Feed on the printer "
"once after changing the roll so it measures again, then [[ui:Use loaded "
"labels]] adapts the label to it ([All printers](#common))."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]]: pencetak mengukur jarak yang berbeza antara "
"label daripada ketinggian ditambah jurang label anda. Semak [[ui:Label "
"size]] dan [[ui:Gap]], atau muatkan gulungan yang betul. Tekan Feed pada "
"pencetak sekali selepas menukar gulungan supaya ia mengukur semula, kemudian "
"[[ui:Use loaded labels]] menyesuaikan label dengannya ([Semua pencetak]"
"(#common))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Everything printed a little too high or too low, the same on every label, "
"while the preview shows it in its place: set [[ui:Print offset]]. A label "
"laid out to make up for this in another program prints off its place in the "
"preview; move its content back into place and set the offset instead."
msgstr ""
"Segala-galanya dicetak sedikit terlalu tinggi atau terlalu rendah, sama pada "
"setiap label, manakala pratonton menunjukkannya pada tempatnya: tetapkan "
"[[ui:Print offset]]. Label yang direka dalam program lain untuk menampung "
"perkara ini dicetak tidak pada tempatnya dalam pratonton; pulangkan "
"kandungannya ke tempatnya dan tetapkan anjakan sebagai gantinya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"A print that stopped because of a problem is cancelled, so printing again "
"does not give extra labels."
msgstr ""
"Cetakan yang berhenti kerana masalah dibatalkan, jadi mencetak semula tidak "
"menghasilkan label tambahan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of labels: load a new roll, the printer then synchronises by itself."
msgstr ""
"Label habis: muatkan gulungan baharu, pencetak kemudian menyegerak sendiri."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Print head open: close the print head."
msgstr "Kepala cetak terbuka: tutup kepala cetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Next label not found: labels not threaded through the label sensor, or "
"labels without gaps (continuous media is not supported yet)."
msgstr ""
"Label seterusnya tidak ditemui: label tidak dilalukan melalui penderia "
"label, atau label tanpa jurang (media tanpa putus belum disokong)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Ribbon problem: no ribbon in thermal transfer mode, or a ribbon in thermal "
"direct mode. Load or remove the ribbon, or choose the other [[ui:Print "
"method]]."
msgstr ""
"Masalah reben: tiada reben dalam mod pindahan terma, atau ada reben dalam "
"mod terma terus. Muatkan atau keluarkan reben, atau pilih [[ui:Print "
"method]] yang lain."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of memory: the printer had no room for the labels of a job. Lower "
"[[ui:Labels per job]], then print again from the row the message names."
msgstr ""
"Kehabisan memori: pencetak tiada ruang untuk label dalam satu kerja cetak. "
"Kurangkan [[ui:Labels per job]], kemudian cetak semula dari baris yang "
"dinamakan mesej."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"\"The job was sent, but its outcome is unknown\": the connection to the "
"printer broke while it printed (or the printer could not tell how far it "
"got). Tavletta counts the labels it knows were printed; the printer may have "
"printed more. Check the labels that came out: printing again from the row "
"the message names may print some twice, but leaves none out.  With the "
"printer's web interface reachable on the network (the default), Tavletta "
"also checks the number against the printer's label counter; where the two "
"differ, the message gives the range."
msgstr ""
"\"Kerja cetak telah dihantar, tetapi hasilnya tidak diketahui\": sambungan "
"ke pencetak terputus semasa mencetak (atau pencetak tidak dapat memaklumkan "
"setakat mana ia sampai). Tavletta mengira label yang diketahuinya telah "
"dicetak; pencetak mungkin telah mencetak lebih banyak. Semak label yang "
"keluar: mencetak semula dari baris yang dinamakan mesej boleh mencetak "
"sebahagian dua kali, tetapi tidak meninggalkan satu pun. Jika antara muka "
"web pencetak boleh dicapai dalam rangkaian (lalai), Tavletta juga menyemak "
"nombor itu dengan pembilang label pencetak; jika kedua-duanya berbeza, mesej "
"memberikan julatnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Labels with a ribbon print blank or smeared, the ribbon does not move: the "
"printer is set to thermal direct. Choose [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] "
"under [[ui:Print method]]."
msgstr ""
"Label dengan reben dicetak kosong atau comot, reben tidak bergerak: pencetak "
"ditetapkan kepada terma terus. Pilih [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] di "
"bawah [[ui:Print method]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Paused: resume the printer on its display."
msgstr "Dijeda: sambung semula pencetak pada paparannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Print too pale or too dark: change the heat level in the printer's setup."
msgstr ""
"Cetakan terlalu pucat atau terlalu gelap: tukar tahap haba dalam tetapan "
"pencetak."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brother P-touch { #ptouch }"
msgstr "Brother P-touch { #ptouch }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on Brother P-touch tape printers with TZe tape and HSe heat-"
"shrink tube: the PT-P700, PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P710BT, the PT-P900 series, "
"the PT-D series and older models such as the PT-2430PC. Not tried on a "
"printer yet."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mencetak pada pencetak pita Brother P-touch dengan pita TZe dan "
"tiub kecut haba HSe: PT-P700, PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P710BT, siri PT-P900, "
"siri PT-D dan model lebih lama seperti PT-2430PC. Belum dicuba pada pencetak "
"sebenar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "USB: plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it."
msgstr "USB: palamkan pencetak; [[ui:Search for printers]] menemuinya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Network (PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P900W, PT-P950NW): the search finds the "
"printer, or enter its address. Tavletta uses port 9100."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian (PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P900W, PT-P950NW): carian menemui "
"pencetak, atau masukkan alamatnya. Tavletta menggunakan port 9100."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Bluetooth is not supported; models with Bluetooth print over USB."
msgstr "Bluetooth tidak disokong; model dengan Bluetooth mencetak melalui USB."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Editor Lite: with the Editor Lite lamp on, the printer is a USB drive and "
"cannot print. Switch Editor Lite off, then search again."
msgstr ""
"Editor Lite: apabila lampu Editor Lite menyala, pencetak ialah pemacu USB "
"dan tidak boleh mencetak. Matikan Editor Lite, kemudian cari semula."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tape { #ptouch-tape }"
msgstr "Pita { #ptouch-tape }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta shows the inserted tape, its type (laminated, heat-shrink "
"tube, ...) and the printable width under [[ui:Printer details]]."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta memaparkan pita yang dimasukkan, jenisnya (berlamina, tiub kecut "
"haba, ...) dan lebar boleh cetak di bawah [[ui:Printer details]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The label fills the printable part of the tape. The edges of the tape stay "
"blank: on 12 mm tape about 9.9 mm are printed."
msgstr ""
"Label memenuhi bahagian pita yang boleh dicetak. Tepi pita dibiarkan kosong: "
"pada pita 12 mm kira-kira 9.9 mm dicetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Heat-shrink tube: choose the nearest [[ui:Tape width]] (12 mm for an 11.2 mm "
"tube)."
msgstr ""
"Tiub kecut haba: pilih [[ui:Tape width]] yang paling hampir (12 mm untuk "
"tiub 11.2 mm)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Print in black: on coloured tape the tape's ink colour prints. Images are "
"printed in black and white without dithering."
msgstr ""
"Cetak hitam: pada pita berwarna, warna dakwat pita dicetak. Imej dicetak "
"hitam putih tanpa dithering."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print options { #ptouch-print }"
msgstr "Pilihan cetakan { #ptouch-print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] cuts each label off. [[ui:Half cut]] cuts "
"through the label, the backing holds the labels together. [[ui:No cut]] "
"prints the labels as one strip. The strip is cut after the last label.  "
"Models with a cutter lever have no cut setting."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] memotong setiap label. [[ui:Half cut]] memotong "
"menembusi label, kertas pelapik menyatukan label. [[ui:No cut]] mencetak "
"label sebagai satu jalur. Jalur dipotong selepas label terakhir. Model "
"dengan tuas pemotong tiada tetapan potong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Chain printing]]: the last label stays in the printer and comes out "
"with the next print. Saves about 25 mm of tape per print."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Chain printing]]: label terakhir kekal dalam pencetak dan keluar "
"bersama cetakan seterusnya. Menjimatkan kira-kira 25 mm pita bagi setiap "
"cetakan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "[[ui:High resolution]]: finer print along the tape, slower."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:High resolution]]: cetakan lebih halus sepanjang pita, lebih perlahan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Tape feed]]: blank tape before and after each label, at least 2 mm (PT-"
"P900 series: 1 mm)."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Tape feed]]: pita kosong sebelum dan selepas setiap label, sekurang-"
"kurangnya 2 mm (siri PT-P900: 1 mm)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The first label after switching on starts with a blank piece: the cutter "
"sits behind the print head."
msgstr ""
"Label pertama selepas dihidupkan bermula dengan bahagian kosong: pemotong "
"terletak di belakang kepala cetak."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #ptouch-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #ptouch-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: another tape width is inserted. The label is scaled "
"to the tape."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: pita dengan lebar lain dimasukkan. Label diskalakan "
"mengikut pita."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Cover open, no tape, tape not recognised: close the cover, insert the tape "
"until it clicks."
msgstr ""
"Penutup terbuka, tiada pita, pita tidak dikenali: tutup penutup, masukkan "
"pita sehingga berbunyi klik."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Batteries low: connect the power adapter."
msgstr "Bateri lemah: sambungkan penyesuai kuasa."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Print head too hot: wait a few minutes."
msgstr "Kepala cetak terlalu panas: tunggu beberapa minit."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Model not supported: Tavletta knows the models listed above."
msgstr ""
"Model tidak disokong: Tavletta mengenali model yang disenaraikan di atas."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "NIIMBOT { #niimbot }"
msgstr "NIIMBOT { #niimbot }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on NIIMBOT label printers over USB: B1, B21, B3S, B4, D11, "
"D110, D101 and related models. It has not been tried on a printer yet; "
"please report how it works."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mencetak pada pencetak label NIIMBOT melalui USB: B1, B21, B3S, B4, "
"D11, D110, D101 dan model berkaitan. Belum dicuba pada pencetak sebenar; "
"sila laporkan bagaimana ia berfungsi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB: plug the printer in and switch it on; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds "
"it. Otherwise enter its port, for example `/dev/ttyACM0`, under [[ui:Host "
"name or IP address]]."
msgstr ""
"USB: palamkan pencetak dan hidupkannya; [[ui:Search for printers]] "
"menemuinya. Jika tidak, masukkan portnya, contohnya `/dev/ttyACM0`, di bawah "
"[[ui:Host name or IP address]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The port belongs to the group `dialout` (Fedora, Debian, Ubuntu) or `uucp` "
"(Arch Linux), not `lp`. Run `sudo usermod -aG dialout $USER` (on Arch Linux: "
"`uucp`), then log out and in again."
msgstr ""
"Port itu milik kumpulan `dialout` (Fedora, Debian, Ubuntu) atau `uucp` (Arch "
"Linux), bukan `lp`. Jalankan `sudo usermod -aG dialout $USER` (pada Arch "
"Linux: `uucp`), kemudian log keluar dan log masuk semula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Bluetooth is not supported yet. Older B3S with a micro-USB port do not "
"answer over USB; the B3S P with USB-C does."
msgstr ""
"Bluetooth belum disokong. B3S lama dengan port micro-USB tidak menjawab "
"melalui USB; B3S P dengan USB-C menjawab."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: the labels on the roll, the width across the printer.  On "
"the D11, D110 and D101 the roll is narrow (12 mm on a D11): choose "
"[[ui:Along the roll]] under [[ui:Content direction]] for text along the "
"label."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: label pada gulungan, lebar merentasi pencetak. Pada D11, "
"D110 dan D101 gulungannya sempit (12 mm pada D11): pilih [[ui:Along the "
"roll]] di bawah [[ui:Content direction]] untuk teks sepanjang label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"A label narrower than the print head is printed in its middle. One a little "
"wider is cut to the middle: a B1 prints 48 mm of a 50 mm label.  Keep 1 mm "
"or more as [[ui:Safety margin]]."
msgstr ""
"Label yang lebih sempit daripada kepala cetak dicetak di tengahnya. Yang "
"sedikit lebih lebar dipotong ke tengah: B1 mencetak 48 mm daripada label 50 "
"mm. Kekalkan 1 mm atau lebih sebagai [[ui:Safety margin]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"In the printer group: [[ui:Print density]] (higher prints darker) and "
"[[ui:Label sensor]] (labels with gaps, black marks, a continuous roll or "
"transparent labels, as loaded). Tavletta offers what the connected model "
"takes and remembers the choice."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kumpulan pencetak: [[ui:Print density]] (lebih tinggi mencetak lebih "
"gelap) dan [[ui:Label sensor]] (label dengan jurang, tanda hitam, gulungan "
"tanpa putus atau label lutsinar, seperti yang dimuatkan). Tavletta "
"menawarkan apa yang diterima model yang disambungkan dan mengingati pilihan "
"itu."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #niimbot-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #niimbot-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"No permission for the serial port: add your user to the group, see above."
msgstr ""
"Tiada kebenaran untuk port bersiri: tambahkan pengguna anda ke kumpulan, "
"lihat di atas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]] right after plugging in: some systems probe new "
"serial ports for a modem first. Wait a few seconds, then [[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]] sejurus selepas dipalamkan: sesetengah sistem "
"menyiasat port bersiri baharu untuk modem dahulu. Tunggu beberapa saat, "
"kemudian [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Cover open, out of labels or a low battery: close the cover, load a roll or "
"charge the printer, then [[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"Penutup terbuka, label habis atau bateri lemah: tutup penutup, muatkan "
"gulungan atau cas pencetak, kemudian [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Printing fails after some copies: the message says how many labels were "
"already printed. The job is canceled, nothing prints later on its own."
msgstr ""
"Pencetakan gagal selepas beberapa salinan: mesej menyatakan berapa banyak "
"label telah dicetak. Kerja cetak dibatalkan, tiada apa yang dicetak sendiri "
"kemudian."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The printer is found, but printing reports an unknown model: Tavletta does "
"not know its model number yet. Please [[ui:Report a problem…]], the report "
"contains the number."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak ditemui, tetapi pencetakan melaporkan model tidak diketahui: "
"Tavletta belum mengetahui nombor modelnya. Sila [[ui:Report a problem…]], "
"laporan mengandungi nombornya."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "System printer (CUPS, IPP) { #system }"
msgstr "Pencetak sistem (CUPS, IPP) { #system }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Prints on the printers your computer knows: printers set up in the system "
"settings (also over USB) and printers in the network that support IPP "
"Everywhere or AirPrint, as most office printers do. The label is printed as "
"one page of exactly its size, unscaled."
msgstr ""
"Mencetak pada pencetak yang dikenali komputer anda: pencetak yang disediakan "
"dalam tetapan sistem (juga melalui USB) dan pencetak dalam rangkaian yang "
"menyokong IPP Everywhere atau AirPrint, seperti kebanyakan pencetak pejabat. "
"Label dicetak sebagai satu halaman dengan saiz yang tepat sama, tanpa skala."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Search for printers]] lists both. Otherwise enter the printer's address "
"or the name of its CUPS queue under [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Search for printers]] menyenaraikan kedua-duanya. Jika tidak, masukkan "
"alamat pencetak atau nama baris gilir CUPS-nya di bawah [[ui:Host name or IP "
"address]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "[[ui:Label size]]: the paper size, or [[ui:Custom size]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Label size]]: saiz kertas, atau [[ui:Custom size]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print on]] [[ui:Label sheet]]: several labels on a sheet of self-"
"adhesive labels, see [Label sheets](sheets.md)."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print on]] [[ui:Label sheet]]: beberapa label pada helaian label "
"pelekat sendiri, lihat [Helaian label](sheets.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Most office printers cannot print the outer 4 to 5 mm of a page: set the "
"[[ui:Safety margin]] to 5 mm. On label sheets Tavletta warns when a label "
"reaches into what the printer reports."
msgstr ""
"Kebanyakan pencetak pejabat tidak boleh mencetak 4 hingga 5 mm paling luar "
"halaman: tetapkan [[ui:Safety margin]] kepada 5 mm. Pada helaian label, "
"Tavletta memberi amaran apabila label mencapai kawasan yang dilaporkan "
"pencetak."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #system-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #system-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of paper, paper jam or cover open while printing: Tavletta shows it and "
"waits. Fix it at the printer within 5 minutes and printing goes on."
msgstr ""
"Kertas habis, kertas tersangkut atau penutup terbuka semasa mencetak: "
"Tavletta memaparkannya dan menunggu. Selesaikannya pada pencetak dalam masa "
"5 minit dan pencetakan diteruskan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of toner or ink, or a problem before printing: fix it as the printer's "
"display shows, then [[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"Toner atau dakwat habis, atau masalah sebelum mencetak: selesaikan seperti "
"yang ditunjukkan paparan pencetak, kemudian [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Printing fails after some copies: the message says how many labels were "
"already printed. The rest is canceled, nothing prints later on its own."
msgstr ""
"Pencetakan gagal selepas beberapa salinan: mesej menyatakan berapa banyak "
"label telah dicetak. Selebihnya dibatalkan, tiada apa yang dicetak sendiri "
"kemudian."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The label is printed smaller or moved: the printer or its driver scales the "
"page. Turn off \"fit to page\" in the printer's setup."
msgstr ""
"Label dicetak lebih kecil atau beralih: pencetak atau pemacunya menskalakan "
"halaman. Matikan \"fit to page\" dalam tetapan pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Other jobs are printing first: Tavletta says the label was sent, and the "
"printer prints it when its turn comes."
msgstr ""
"Kerja cetak lain dicetak dahulu: Tavletta memberitahu bahawa label telah "
"dihantar, dan pencetak mencetaknya apabila tiba gilirannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The job is held in the queue (until it is released, or until a password is "
"entered): Tavletta cancels it. Check the queue in the system settings."
msgstr ""
"Kerja cetak ditahan dalam baris gilir (sehingga dilepaskan, atau sehingga "
"kata laluan dimasukkan): Tavletta membatalkannya. Semak baris gilir dalam "
"tetapan sistem."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Label printers with ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS or DYMO { #raw }"
msgstr "Pencetak label dengan ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS atau DYMO { #raw }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on label printers that take the label as an image in their "
"own printer language. Zebra ZPL was tried on a Zebra GX420d over USB (status "
"and printing); the other printers have not been tried with Tavletta yet: if "
"you have one, a report of what works and what does not helps a lot "
"([[ui:Report a problem…]])."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mencetak pada pencetak label yang menerima label sebagai imej dalam "
"bahasa pencetaknya sendiri. Zebra ZPL dicuba pada Zebra GX420d melalui USB "
"(keadaan dan pencetakan); pencetak lain belum dicuba dengan Tavletta: jika "
"anda mempunyainya, laporan tentang apa yang berfungsi dan tidak sangat "
"membantu ([[ui:Report a problem…]])."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Printer model in Tavletta | Printers |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Zebra ZPL | Zebra GK, GX, ZD, ZT and other printers with ZPL, also ZPL compatible printers of other makers |\n"
"| Zebra EPL2 | Zebra LP/TLP 2824 and 2844, GK420 and GX420 set to EPL2 |\n"
"| TSPL (TSC, Munbyn, iDPRT, Xprinter, Rollo) | TSC printers and most 4 × 6 in shipping label printers |\n"
"| [[ui:Receipt printer (ESC/POS)]] | Epson TM and compatible receipt printers on 58 or 80 mm paper |\n"
"| DYMO LabelWriter | LabelWriter 300, 400 and 450 series, 4XL (not the 550 and 5XL) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Model pencetak dalam Tavletta | Pencetak |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Zebra ZPL | Zebra GK, GX, ZD, ZT dan pencetak lain dengan ZPL, juga pencetak serasi ZPL daripada pembuat lain |\n"
"| Zebra EPL2 | Zebra LP/TLP 2824 dan 2844, GK420 dan GX420 yang ditetapkan kepada EPL2 |\n"
"| TSPL (TSC, Munbyn, iDPRT, Xprinter, Rollo) | Pencetak TSC dan kebanyakan pencetak label penghantaran 4 × 6 in |\n"
"| [[ui:Receipt printer (ESC/POS)]] | Epson TM dan pencetak resit serasi pada kertas 58 atau 80 mm |\n"
"| DYMO LabelWriter | LabelWriter siri 300, 400 dan 450, 4XL (bukan 550 dan 5XL) |\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Connection: over the network on port 9100, or USB. Plug a USB printer in and "
"use [[ui:Search for printers]]. Some low-cost shipping label printers do not "
"show up as a printer on USB; Tavletta cannot find those."
msgstr ""
"Sambungan: melalui rangkaian pada port 9100, atau USB. Palamkan pencetak USB "
"dan gunakan [[ui:Search for printers]]. Sesetengah pencetak label "
"penghantaran murah tidak muncul sebagai pencetak pada USB; Tavletta tidak "
"dapat menemuinya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Resolution]]: choose the resolution of the print head (203, 300 or 600 "
"dpi). Zebra printers report it: [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Resolution]]: pilih resolusi kepala cetak (203, 300 atau 600 dpi). "
"Pencetak Zebra melaporkannya: [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label sensor]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] keeps the printer's own "
"setting. [[ui:Gap between labels]] for die-cut labels, [[ui:Black mark]] for "
"labels with a black mark on the back, [[ui:Continuous media]] for a roll "
"without gaps. Set the [[ui:Label size]] and the [[ui:Gap]] (or the height of "
"the mark) like the roll."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label sensor]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] mengekalkan tetapan "
"pencetak sendiri. [[ui:Gap between labels]] untuk label potong-acuan, "
"[[ui:Black mark]] untuk label dengan tanda hitam di belakang, "
"[[ui:Continuous media]] untuk gulungan tanpa jurang. Tetapkan [[ui:Label "
"size]] dan [[ui:Gap]] (atau tinggi tanda) seperti gulungan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:After printing]]: [[ui:Tear off]], [[ui:Peel off]] or [[ui:Cut off]], "
"if the printer has a peeler or a cutter.  [[ui:As set on the printer]] "
"leaves the printer's own setting."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:After printing]]: [[ui:Tear off]], [[ui:Peel off]] atau [[ui:Cut off]], "
"jika pencetak mempunyai pengupas atau pemotong. [[ui:As set on the printer]] "
"membiarkan tetapan pencetak sendiri."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Darkness]] and [[ui:Speed]] change the printer's setting for this "
"print; [[ui:As set on the printer]] leaves it alone."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Darkness]] dan [[ui:Speed]] mengubah tetapan pencetak untuk cetakan "
"ini; [[ui:As set on the printer]] membiarkannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: for a printer that puts out the label the wrong "
"way round."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: untuk pencetak yang mengeluarkan label terbalik."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Receipt printers print the label on endless paper: choose the paper width "
"under [[ui:Tape width]]. The printable width is narrower than the paper (48 "
"mm on 58 mm paper, 72 mm on 80 mm paper). [[ui:Cut]] in the print dialog "
"cuts the paper after each label."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak resit mencetak label pada kertas tanpa putus: pilih lebar kertas di "
"bawah [[ui:Tape width]]. Lebar boleh cetak lebih sempit daripada kertas (48 "
"mm pada kertas 58 mm, 72 mm pada kertas 80 mm). [[ui:Cut]] dalam dialog "
"cetak memotong kertas selepas setiap label."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #raw-problems }"
msgstr "Masalah { #raw-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: the printer takes jobs but "
"answers no questions, which many of these printers do (EPL2 printers never "
"answer). Problems such as an open cover then show on the printer only."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: pencetak menerima kerja "
"cetak tetapi tidak menjawab soalan, seperti banyak pencetak jenis ini "
"(pencetak EPL2 tidak pernah menjawab). Masalah seperti penutup terbuka "
"kemudian hanya kelihatan pada pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The printer did not report its resolution in time: choose it under "
"[[ui:Resolution]] instead of [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak tidak melaporkan resolusinya tepat pada masanya: pilihnya di bawah "
"[[ui:Resolution]] dan bukan [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The label comes out upside down: switch on [[ui:Print upside down]], and "
"please report it with the printer model; the orientation was tried on a "
"Zebra GX420d only."
msgstr ""
"Label keluar terbalik: hidupkan [[ui:Print upside down]], dan sila "
"laporkannya bersama model pencetak; orientasi ini hanya dicuba pada Zebra "
"GX420d."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Print too pale or too dark: change [[ui:Darkness]]."
msgstr "Cetakan terlalu pucat atau terlalu gelap: tukar [[ui:Darkness]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (Zebra ZPL): the printer reports the distance "
"it measured last, perhaps on an earlier roll. After changing the roll, let "
"it measure the labels again (most printers do that with a long press on "
"Feed) before you use [[ui:Use loaded labels]] ([All printers](#common))."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (Zebra ZPL): pencetak melaporkan jarak yang "
"diukurnya kali terakhir, mungkin pada gulungan terdahulu. Selepas menukar "
"gulungan, biarkan ia mengukur label semula (kebanyakan pencetak berbuat "
"demikian dengan tekanan lama pada Feed) sebelum anda menggunakan [[ui:Use "
"loaded labels]] ([Semua pencetak](#common))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The printer prints several blank labels or stops between labels: the "
"[[ui:Label sensor]] does not match the roll, or the printer has to measure "
"the labels again (most printers do that with a long press on Feed)."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak mencetak beberapa label kosong atau berhenti di antara label: "
"[[ui:Label sensor]] tidak sepadan dengan gulungan, atau pencetak perlu "
"mengukur label semula (kebanyakan pencetak berbuat demikian dengan tekan "
"lama pada Feed)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Nothing is printed and the printer shows no problem: check that its printer "
"language is the one chosen in Tavletta (many printers can switch between ZPL "
"and EPL2, or between TSPL and ESC/POS)."
msgstr ""
"Tiada apa dicetak dan pencetak tidak menunjukkan masalah: semak bahawa "
"bahasa pencetaknya ialah yang dipilih dalam Tavletta (banyak pencetak boleh "
"bertukar antara ZPL dan EPL2, atau antara TSPL dan ESC/POS)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Bantuan"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Something else? [[ui:Report a problem…]] in the main menu (also offered with "
"error messages) opens a prefilled issue in the browser with version, system "
"and printer. You see everything before sending it."
msgstr ""
"Ada masalah lain? [[ui:Report a problem…]] dalam menu utama (juga ditawarkan "
"bersama mesej ralat) membuka isu yang telah diisi dalam pelayar dengan "
"versi, sistem dan pencetak. Anda melihat segalanya sebelum menghantarnya."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Serial labels"
msgstr "Label bersiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"One label for each row of a table: inventory numbers, shelf labels, name "
"badges, addresses. The label holds placeholders such as `{Name}`; each "
"printed label shows the values of its row."
msgstr ""
"Satu label bagi setiap baris jadual: nombor inventori, label rak, tag nama, "
"alamat. Label mengandungi pemegang tempat seperti `{Name}`; setiap label "
"yang dicetak memaparkan nilai barisnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"![Serial labels](media/serial.png#only-light)  ![Serial labels](media/serial-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Serial labels](media/serial.png#only-light)  ![Serial labels](media/serial-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data file"
msgstr "Fail data"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Data for serial labels…]] in the main menu, [[ui:Choose…]] under "
"[[ui:Serial labels]], or drop the file onto the window."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Data for serial labels…]] dalam menu utama, [[ui:Choose…]] di bawah "
"[[ui:Serial labels]], atau lepaskan fail ke atas tetingkap."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"CSV (comma, semicolon or tab), ODS (LibreOffice) or XLSX (Excel). The first "
"filled row holds the column names."
msgstr ""
"CSV (koma, koma bertitik atau tab), ODS (LibreOffice) atau XLSX (Excel). "
"Baris pertama yang berisi memegang nama lajur."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"A title above the column names counts as the first row: delete it, or put "
"the table on a sheet of its own."
msgstr ""
"Tajuk di atas nama lajur dikira sebagai baris pertama: padamkannya, atau "
"letakkan jadual pada helaian sendiri."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "ODS: cells as LibreOffice shows them, dates as `2026-11-11`."
msgstr ""
"ODS: sel seperti yang dipaparkan LibreOffice, tarikh sebagai `2026-11-11`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"XLSX: numbers with their decimals, leading zeros and percent signs, dates as "
"`2026-11-11`. Thousands separators and text in the number format, such as a "
"currency, are left out. Dates in the East Asian built-in formats come out as "
"numbers. Leading zeros fill up to 30 digits; a number format longer than the "
"255 characters Excel takes is ignored."
msgstr ""
"XLSX: nombor dengan perpuluhannya, sifar di hadapan dan tanda peratus, "
"tarikh sebagai `2026-11-11`. Pemisah ribu dan teks dalam format nombor, "
"seperti mata wang, ditinggalkan. Tarikh dalam format terbina dalam Asia "
"Timur keluar sebagai nombor. Sifar di hadapan diisi sehingga 30 digit; "
"format nombor yang lebih panjang daripada 255 aksara yang diterima Excel "
"diabaikan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "Empty rows are left out. The hidden cells of merged cells are empty."
msgstr ""
"Baris kosong ditinggalkan. Sel tersembunyi bagi sel yang digabungkan adalah "
"kosong."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Several sheets: choose one under [[ui:Sheet]]. If the sheet saved with the "
"label is no longer there, nothing is printed until another one is chosen."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa helaian: pilih satu di bawah [[ui:Sheet]]. Jika helaian yang "
"disimpan bersama label tidak lagi ada, tiada apa dicetak sehingga yang lain "
"dipilih."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Read again]] after the file was changed in the spreadsheet program."
msgstr "[[ui:Read again]] selepas fail diubah dalam program hamparan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Up to 100 000 rows, 1000 columns, 2 000 000 cells (rows times columns, "
"without the row of column names) and 50 MB."
msgstr ""
"Sehingga 100 000 baris, 1000 lajur, 2 000 000 sel (baris darab lajur, tanpa "
"baris nama lajur) dan 50 MB."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"The label file stores where the data file is, never its content. If the data "
"file lies in the same folder as the label (or below it), both can be moved "
"or shared together. If it is missing when the label is opened, Tavletta says "
"so: choose it again or remove it."
msgstr ""
"Fail label menyimpan lokasi fail data, tidak pernah kandungannya. Jika fail "
"data berada dalam folder yang sama dengan label (atau di bawahnya), kedua-"
"duanya boleh dialihkan atau dikongsi bersama. Jika ia tiada apabila label "
"dibuka, Tavletta memberitahu: pilih semula atau alihkannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"A data file is read without asking only if it is a table (`.csv`, `.tsv`, "
"`.txt`, `.ods`, `.xlsx`) in the label's folder or below, and not in a hidden "
"folder. Any other data file is read only after asking, once for each label "
"file: a label from someone else could name any file.  [[ui:Forget allowed "
"data files]] in the main menu makes Tavletta ask again."
msgstr ""
"Fail data dibaca tanpa bertanya hanya jika ia jadual (`.csv`, `.tsv`, "
"`.txt`, `.ods`, `.xlsx`) dalam folder label atau di bawahnya, dan bukan "
"dalam folder tersembunyi. Sebarang fail data lain dibaca hanya selepas "
"bertanya, sekali bagi setiap fail label: label daripada orang lain boleh "
"menamakan sebarang fail. [[ui:Forget allowed data files]] dalam menu utama "
"menjadikan Tavletta bertanya semula."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"In the Flatpak, Tavletta sees only the files it is given: a label opened "
"from the file manager or the file chooser, but not the folder around it.  A "
"data file beside the label is then not found: choose it with [[ui:Data for "
"serial labels…]] (the file chooser gives Tavletta access to it)."
msgstr ""
"Dalam Flatpak, Tavletta hanya melihat fail yang diberikan kepadanya: label "
"yang dibuka daripada pengurus fail atau pemilih fail, tetapi bukan folder di "
"sekelilingnya. Fail data di sebelah label kemudian tidak ditemui: pilihnya "
"dengan [[ui:Data for serial labels…]] (pemilih fail memberi Tavletta akses "
"kepadanya)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Templates keep the placeholders but not the data file. Older versions of "
"Tavletta refuse labels with a data file instead of printing the placeholders."
msgstr ""
"Templat mengekalkan pemegang tempat tetapi bukan fail data. Versi Tavletta "
"yang lebih lama menolak label dengan fail data dan bukan mencetak pemegang "
"tempat."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "Pemegang tempat"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Insert column]] next to a text or the content of a code adds `{Column}` "
"at the cursor; typing it works as well."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Insert column]] di sebelah teks atau kandungan kod menambahkan `{Column}"
"` pada kursor; menaipnya juga berfungsi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Placeholders work in texts and in QR codes and barcodes, for example "
"`https://example.org/item/{Number}`."
msgstr ""
"Pemegang tempat berfungsi dalam teks dan dalam kod QR dan kod bar, contohnya "
"`https://example.org/item/{Number}`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"With a data file `{{` and `}}` print a single brace, in every text and code: "
"`{{Name}}` prints `{Name}`. Other braces need doubling too, for example JSON "
"in a QR code: `{{\"id\":{Number}}}`. Without a data file texts print as "
"typed."
msgstr ""
"Dengan fail data `{{` dan `}}` mencetak satu pendakap, dalam setiap teks dan "
"kod: `{{Name}}` mencetak `{Name}`. Pendakap lain juga perlu digandakan, "
"contohnya JSON dalam kod QR: `{{\"id\":{Number}}}`. Tanpa fail data teks "
"dicetak seperti yang ditaip."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "Values are printed as they are, even if they contain braces."
msgstr "Nilai dicetak seadanya, walaupun mengandungi pendakap."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"A placeholder without a column of that name is printed as it is; the line "
"under the preview names it."
msgstr ""
"Pemegang tempat tanpa lajur dengan nama itu dicetak seadanya; baris di bawah "
"pratonton menamakannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Before printing, the codes of every row are checked: an EAN-13 needs 12 or "
"13 digits, an empty cell gives no code, a code holds only so much (a QR code "
"less with a higher error correction), GS1 data needs the lengths of its "
"application identifiers. Rows that fail are named; print without them or "
"correct the data file."
msgstr ""
"Sebelum mencetak, kod bagi setiap baris disemak: EAN-13 memerlukan 12 atau "
"13 digit, sel kosong tidak menghasilkan kod, kod hanya memuatkan sejumlah "
"tertentu (kod QR kurang dengan pembetulan ralat lebih tinggi), data GS1 "
"memerlukan panjang application identifier-nya. Baris yang gagal dinamakan; "
"cetak tanpanya atau betulkan fail data."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Variables such as `{=counter}` or `{=date}` work together with the "
"placeholders; the counter goes on from row to row."
msgstr ""
"Pemboleh ubah seperti `{=counter}` atau `{=date}` berfungsi bersama pemegang "
"tempat; pembilang diteruskan dari baris ke baris."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Pratonton"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"The buttons under the preview step through the rows: [[ui:First row]], "
"[[ui:Previous row]], [[ui:Next row]] and [[ui:Last row]], or Alt+Page Up, "
"Alt+Page Down, Alt+Home and Alt+End."
msgstr ""
"Butang di bawah pratonton melangkah melalui baris: [[ui:First row]], "
"[[ui:Previous row]], [[ui:Next row]] dan [[ui:Last row]], atau Alt+Page Up, "
"Alt+Page Down, Alt+Home dan Alt+End."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "Rows are counted without the row of column names."
msgstr "Baris dikira tanpa baris nama lajur."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "[[ui:Export PNG…]] saves the row that is shown."
msgstr "[[ui:Export PNG…]] menyimpan baris yang dipaparkan."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print"
msgstr "Cetak"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print]] prints one label for each row. [[ui:From row]] and [[ui:To "
"row]] limit the rows (all of them by default), [[ui:Copies of each label]] "
"sets how many of each are printed."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print]] mencetak satu label bagi setiap baris. [[ui:From row]] dan "
"[[ui:To row]] mengehadkan baris (semuanya secara lalai), [[ui:Copies of each "
"label]] menetapkan berapa salinan setiap label dicetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Every label is a print job of its own, so this works on every printer.  A "
"cab printer gets up to [[ui:Labels per job]] labels as one job, which it "
"prints without stopping between them ([cab](printer.md#cab))."
msgstr ""
"Setiap label ialah kerja cetak tersendiri, jadi ini berfungsi pada setiap "
"pencetak. Pencetak cab menerima sehingga [[ui:Labels per job]] label sebagai "
"satu kerja cetak, yang dicetaknya tanpa berhenti di antaranya ([cab]"
"(printer.md#cab))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Stop]] in the bar above the window ends the series after the label "
"being printed (on a cab printer: after the job being printed); the first "
"label is always printed."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Stop]] dalam bar di atas tetingkap menamatkan siri selepas label yang "
"sedang dicetak (pada pencetak cab: selepas kerja cetak yang sedang dicetak); "
"label pertama sentiasa dicetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"If the printer reports a problem, printing stops at that row; the message "
"says how many copies of it were already printed. Solve the problem, then "
"print again starting from that row."
msgstr ""
"Jika pencetak melaporkan masalah, pencetakan berhenti pada baris itu; mesej "
"menyatakan berapa salinan baris itu telah dicetak. Selesaikan masalah, "
"kemudian cetak semula bermula dari baris itu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"On a label sheet each position gets one label: the rows in order, the copies "
"of a row on the positions after each other, starting at the positions chosen "
"for the first sheet. All sheets are one print job, so [[ui:Stop]] is not "
"offered. After a problem the message also says at which position of which "
"sheet the row to go on from belongs."
msgstr ""
"Pada helaian label setiap kedudukan mendapat satu label: baris mengikut "
"urutan, salinan satu baris pada kedudukan yang berturutan, bermula pada "
"kedudukan yang dipilih untuk helaian pertama. Semua helaian ialah satu kerja "
"cetak, jadi [[ui:Stop]] tidak ditawarkan. Selepas masalah, mesej juga "
"menyatakan pada kedudukan mana pada helaian mana baris untuk diteruskan "
"berada."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Baris arahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"`tavletta print shelf.tavletta --data items.csv --rows 3-10` prints rows 3 "
"to 10 without opening a window; see [Command line](use.md#command-line).  "
"With `--dry-run` each line of the listing starts with the row number."
msgstr ""
"`tavletta print shelf.tavletta --data items.csv --rows 3-10` mencetak baris "
"3 hingga 10 tanpa membuka tetingkap; lihat [Baris arahan](use.md#command-"
"line). Dengan `--dry-run` setiap baris senarai bermula dengan nombor baris."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server installation"
msgstr "Pemasangan pelayan"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"This guide sets up the print server (`tavletta serve`) on a Linux server for "
"a company: other programs, for example an inventory tool, print labels "
"through it over the network. What the server does and how programs use it: "
"[Print server](server.md) and [API reference](api.md)."
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menyediakan pelayan cetak (`tavletta serve`) pada pelayan Linux "
"untuk sebuah syarikat: program lain, contohnya alat inventori, mencetak "
"label melaluinya merentasi rangkaian. Apa yang dilakukan pelayan dan cara "
"program menggunakannya: [Pelayan cetak](server.md) dan [Rujukan API](api.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview { #overview }"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan { #overview }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"One small service: a REST API (and MCP for AI assistants) on port 8790.  It "
"renders the labels itself and sends them to the printers over the network; "
"no desktop, no database."
msgstr ""
"Satu perkhidmatan kecil: REST API (dan MCP untuk pembantu AI) pada port "
"8790. Ia merender label sendiri dan menghantarnya ke pencetak melalui "
"rangkaian; tanpa desktop, tanpa pangkalan data."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A web page at the same address for people: sign in with a token, see the "
"printers, print a template or a series (from a CSV, XLSX or ODS file, a "
"pasted list or number ranges such as 3000–5685), upload and delete templates "
"with an admin token. `--no-web-ui` turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Halaman web pada alamat yang sama untuk manusia: log masuk dengan token, "
"lihat pencetak, cetak templat atau siri (daripada fail CSV, XLSX atau ODS, "
"senarai yang ditampal atau julat nombor seperti 3000–5685), muat naik dan "
"padam templat dengan token admin. `--no-web-ui` mematikannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The printers it may use are named in `printers.toml`; no other address can "
"be printed on."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak yang boleh digunakannya dinamakan dalam `printers.toml`; tiada "
"alamat lain yang boleh dicetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Every program or device gets its own access token with a role "
"(`tokens.toml`); the file keeps only a fingerprint (hash) of each token."
msgstr ""
"Setiap program atau peranti mendapat token akses sendiri dengan peranan "
"(`tokens.toml`); fail hanya menyimpan cap jari (hash) setiap token."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The labels are `.tavletta` files in a labels folder, designed in the "
"Tavletta app and copied there."
msgstr ""
"Label ialah fail `.tavletta` dalam folder label, direka dalam aplikasi "
"Tavletta dan disalin ke sana."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"It listens on `127.0.0.1` only. Other computers reach it through a reverse "
"proxy with HTTPS (Traefik, nginx, Caddy)."
msgstr ""
"Ia hanya mendengar pada `127.0.0.1`. Komputer lain mencapainya melalui "
"reverse proxy dengan HTTPS (Traefik, nginx, Caddy)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements { #requirements }"
msgstr "Keperluan { #requirements }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A Linux server on x86-64 or ARM64 (a virtual machine or a Raspberry Pi 4/5 "
"is enough)."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan Linux pada x86-64 atau ARM64 (mesin maya atau Raspberry Pi 4/5 "
"mencukupi)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Either Docker Engine with the Compose plugin (option A, recommended), or "
"Python 3.11 or newer with PyGObject, Pango and Cairo from the distribution "
"(option B)."
msgstr ""
"Sama ada Docker Engine dengan pemalam Compose (pilihan A, disyorkan), atau "
"Python 3.11 atau lebih baharu dengan PyGObject, Pango dan Cairo daripada "
"pengedaran (pilihan B)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Or Debian 13 or Fedora 44 on x86-64, for their packages (option C)."
msgstr "Atau Debian 13 atau Fedora 44 pada x86-64, untuk pakejnya (pilihan C)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Resources: 1 CPU core, 1 GB RAM reserved (the server usually uses 50–150 MB; "
"a large label is limited to 40 megapixels), 500 MB of disk for the image or "
"the installation, plus the labels."
msgstr ""
"Sumber: 1 teras CPU, 1 GB RAM diperuntukkan (pelayan biasanya menggunakan 50–"
"150 MB; label besar dihadkan kepada 40 megapiksel), 500 MB cakera untuk imej "
"atau pemasangan, ditambah label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Network from the server to the printers:"
msgstr "Rangkaian dari pelayan ke pencetak:"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  | Printer | Port |\n"
"  |---|---|\n"
"  | cab, Brother QL, ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS, DYMO and others printing \"raw\" | TCP 9100 |\n"
"  | Office printers and CUPS queues (IPP) | TCP 631 |\n"
"  | Brother VC-500W | TCP 9100 |\n"
msgstr ""
"  | Pencetak | Port |\n"
"  |---|---|\n"
"  | cab, Brother QL, ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS, DYMO dan lain-lain yang mencetak \"raw\" | TCP 9100 |\n"
"  | Pencetak pejabat dan baris gilir CUPS (IPP) | TCP 631 |\n"
"  | Brother VC-500W | TCP 9100 |\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Only for finding printers automatically (mDNS) or USB printers: the host's "
"network (option A with `compose.host.yaml`) or a native installation."
msgstr ""
"Hanya untuk menemui pencetak secara automatik (mDNS) atau pencetak USB: "
"rangkaian hos (pilihan A dengan `compose.host.yaml`) atau pemasangan natif."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Fonts: every font the labels use must be installed on the server (see [Fonts]"
"(#fonts))."
msgstr ""
"Fon: setiap fon yang digunakan label mesti dipasang pada pelayan (lihat [Fon]"
"(#fonts))."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option A: Docker Compose { #docker }"
msgstr "Pilihan A: Docker Compose { #docker }"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get the files and the image { #docker-build }"
msgstr "1. Dapatkan fail dan imej { #docker-build }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo git clone https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git /opt/tavletta\n"
"cd /opt/tavletta\n"
"sudo git checkout v1.2.2      # the release to run: git tag lists them\n"
"cd packaging/docker\n"
"sudo docker compose pull      # ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2, for x86-64 and ARM64\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The image (about 230 MB), built and tested by the project's CI and signed "
"(see [Server and container](server.md#container)), contains Tavletta, "
"Python, Pango and Cairo, the fonts DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation "
"(metrics of Arial, Times New Roman and Courier New) and Carlito (metrics of "
"Calibri). It runs as an unprivileged user, read-only, without capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Imej (kira-kira 230 MB), dibina dan diuji oleh CI projek dan ditandatangani "
"(lihat [Pelayan dan kontena](server.md#container)), mengandungi Tavletta, "
"Python, Pango dan Cairo, fon DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation (metrik "
"Arial, Times New Roman dan Courier New) dan Carlito (metrik Calibri). Ia "
"berjalan sebagai pengguna tanpa keistimewaan, baca sahaja, tanpa capability."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Folders { #docker-folders }"
msgstr "2. Folder { #docker-folders }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Everything that belongs to your installation lives in three folders next to "
"`compose.yaml` (git ignores them):"
msgstr ""
"Segala yang tergolong dalam pemasangan anda terletak dalam tiga folder di "
"sebelah `compose.yaml` (diabaikan oleh git):"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/opt/tavletta/packaging/docker/\n"
"├── compose.yaml\n"
"├── config/          printers.toml, tokens.toml\n"
"├── labels/          the label files (.tavletta) and their data files\n"
"└── fonts/           fonts of your own (.ttf, .otf), may stay empty\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo mkdir -p config labels fonts\n"
"sudo chown -R 1000:1000 config labels fonts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The container runs as user 1000 (set `TAVLETTA_UID` and `TAVLETTA_GID` for "
"another one): it reads `config/` and saves counters into the label files of "
"`labels/`."
msgstr ""
"Kontena berjalan sebagai pengguna 1000 (tetapkan `TAVLETTA_UID` dan "
"`TAVLETTA_GID` untuk yang lain): ia membaca `config/` dan menyimpan "
"pembilang dalam fail label `labels/`."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Printers: printers.toml { #printers }"
msgstr "3. Pencetak: printers.toml { #printers }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`config/printers.toml` names every printer programs may use. An example with "
"a cab printer for asset labels (thermal transfer, printed turned by 180 "
"degrees), a Brother QL at the reception and an office printer over IPP:"
msgstr ""
"`config/printers.toml` menamakan setiap pencetak yang boleh digunakan "
"program. Contoh dengan pencetak cab untuk label aset (pindahan terma, "
"dicetak diputar 180 darjah), Brother QL di kaunter penyambut tetamu dan "
"pencetak pejabat melalui IPP:"

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[printers.it-cab]\n"
"backend = \"cab\"                          # cab EOS, SQUIX, MACH\n"
"host = \"cab-it.example.com\"              # name or IP address of the printer\n"
"description = \"Asset labels\"\n"
"location = \"IT store room\"\n"
"media = \"57 x 32 mm polyester, resin ribbon\"\n"
"default = true                           # used when a request names no printer\n"
"max_copies = 50\n"
"\n"
"[printers.it-cab.settings]\n"
"method = \"transfer\"                      # thermal transfer with ribbon (direct: without)\n"
"upside_down = true                       # printed turned by 180 degrees\n"
"\n"
"[printers.reception-ql]\n"
"backend = \"brother_ql\"                   # Brother QL-700, QL-8xx, QL-1100 …\n"
"host = \"192.0.2.21\"\n"
"description = \"Visitor and sample labels\"\n"
"location = \"Reception\"\n"
"media = \"DK-22205, 62 mm continuous\"\n"
"max_copies = 20\n"
"cut = \"full\"\n"
"\n"
"[printers.reception-ql.settings]\n"
"quality = \"high\"\n"
"\n"
"[printers.office]\n"
"backend = \"system\"                       # any IPP printer or CUPS queue\n"
"host = \"ipp://office-printer.example.com/ipp/print\"\n"
"description = \"Label sheets, A4\"\n"
"max_copies = 10\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`backend` is the printer model: `cab`, `brother_ql`, `brother_ql_diecut`, "
"`ptouch`, `vc500w`, `zpl`, `epl`, `tspl`, `escpos`, `dymo`, `niimbot`, "
"`system` (`tavletta list-printers` shows them)."
msgstr ""
"`backend` ialah model pencetak: `cab`, `brother_ql`, `brother_ql_diecut`, "
"`ptouch`, `vc500w`, `zpl`, `epl`, `tspl`, `escpos`, `dymo`, `niimbot`, "
"`system` (`tavletta list-printers` memaparkannya)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`host` is the printer's name or IP address; for `system` an IPP address. "
"Give printers a fixed address (DHCP reservation or DNS name)."
msgstr ""
"`host` ialah nama atau alamat IP pencetak; untuk `system` alamat IPP. "
"Berikan pencetak alamat tetap (tempahan DHCP atau nama DNS)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The settings of a model are those of the app's printer settings; the full "
"list is in [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/"
"branch/main/docs/server.md)."
msgstr ""
"Tetapan sesuatu model ialah tetapan pencetak aplikasi; senarai penuh "
"terdapat dalam [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"src/branch/main/docs/server.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A mistake stops the server with the file, the key and the problem, for "
"example `printers.toml: printers.it-cab.settings.method: expected one of: "
"printer, transfer, direct`. Changes need a restart."
msgstr ""
"Kesilapan menghentikan pelayan dengan fail, kunci dan masalahnya, contohnya "
"`printers.toml: printers.it-cab.settings.method: expected one of: printer, "
"transfer, direct`. Perubahan memerlukan mula semula."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Access tokens: tokens.toml { #tokens }"
msgstr "4. Token akses: tokens.toml { #tokens }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Create one token per program or device. The token is shown once; the file "
"keeps only its hash."
msgstr ""
"Cipta satu token bagi setiap program atau peranti. Token dipaparkan sekali; "
"fail hanya menyimpan hash-nya."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo docker run --rm --user 1000:1000 -v ./config:/config --entrypoint tavletta \\\n"
"    ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2 token new inventory-tool --role print --printer it-cab \\\n"
"    --description \"Inventory tool\" \\\n"
"    --tokens /config/tokens.toml --printers /config/printers.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tav_3f9c0a1b2c4d_Xq2…\n"
"tavletta: The token is shown only this once; /config/tokens.toml keeps only its hash.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Give the token to the program's administrator over a safe channel (a "
"password manager), never by e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Serahkan token kepada pentadbir program melalui saluran selamat (pengurus "
"kata laluan), jangan sekali-kali melalui e-mel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Roles: `preview` (look only), `print` (also print, see its own jobs), "
"`admin` (see and cancel every job). Give programs `print`, monitoring "
"`preview`."
msgstr ""
"Peranan: `preview` (lihat sahaja), `print` (juga mencetak, melihat kerja "
"cetaknya sendiri), `admin` (melihat dan membatalkan setiap kerja cetak). "
"Berikan `print` kepada program, `preview` kepada pemantauan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`--printer` (repeatable) limits the token to these printers; `--expires "
"2027-12-31` to a date."
msgstr ""
"`--printer` (boleh diulang) menghadkan token kepada pencetak ini; `--expires "
"2027-12-31` kepada satu tarikh."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Always pass `--printers`: once a token is limited to printers, the file can "
"only be checked with the printer list."
msgstr ""
"Sentiasa sertakan `--printers`: apabila token dihadkan kepada pencetak, fail "
"hanya boleh disemak dengan senarai pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"New tokens work at once, without a restart. To revoke one, delete its entry "
"from `config/tokens.toml`."
msgstr ""
"Token baharu berfungsi serta-merta, tanpa mula semula. Untuk membatalkan "
"satu token, padamkan entrinya daripada `config/tokens.toml`."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Labels { #labels }"
msgstr "5. Label { #labels }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Design the labels in the Tavletta app and copy the `.tavletta` files into "
"`labels/` (subfolders are allowed). Programs name them without the ending: "
"`labels/inventory/asset-tag.tavletta` is `\"label\": \"inventory/asset-"
"tag\"`."
msgstr ""
"Reka label dalam aplikasi Tavletta dan salin fail `.tavletta` ke `labels/` "
"(subfolder dibenarkan). Program menamakannya tanpa hujung: `labels/inventory/"
"asset-tag.tavletta` ialah `\"label\": \"inventory/asset-tag\"`."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo cp asset-tag.tavletta labels/\n"
"sudo chown 1000:1000 labels/asset-tag.tavletta\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Start { #docker-start }"
msgstr "6. Mula { #docker-start }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo docker compose up -d\n"
"sudo docker compose ps\n"
"curl http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/health\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "{\"status\": \"ok\", \"version\": \"1.2.2\"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "The container restarts by itself after a crash or a reboot."
msgstr "Kontena dimulakan semula sendiri selepas ranap atau but semula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Set the time zone of `{=date}` and `{=time}` on labels with "
"`TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` in a file `.env` next to `compose.yaml` (UTC by "
"default)."
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan zon waktu `{=date}` dan `{=time}` pada label dengan "
"`TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` dalam fail `.env` di sebelah `compose.yaml` (UTC "
"secara lalai)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Check the token and the printers:"
msgstr "Semak token dan pencetak:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  TOKEN=tav_3f9c0a1b2c4d_Xq2…\n"
"  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/printers\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Each printer is listed with its state; `UNREACHABLE` with a message if\n"
"  the server cannot reach it.\n"
"- Open `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` in a browser on the server (others use\n"
"  the proxy's address, see [Reverse proxy](#proxy)) and sign in with a\n"
"  token: the web page shows what its role may do. The page keeps the\n"
"  token in the browser tab only, until the tab is closed or \"Sign out\".\n"
msgstr ""
"  Setiap pencetak disenaraikan dengan keadaannya; `UNREACHABLE` dengan mesej jika\n"
"  pelayan tidak dapat mencapainya.\n"
"- Buka `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` dalam pelayar pada pelayan (yang lain\n"
"  menggunakan alamat proksi, lihat [Reverse proxy](#proxy)) dan log masuk dengan\n"
"  token: halaman web menunjukkan apa yang dibenarkan oleh peranannya. Halaman\n"
"  menyimpan token dalam tab pelayar sahaja, sehingga tab ditutup atau \"Log keluar\".\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host network: mDNS and USB { #docker-host }"
msgstr "Rangkaian hos: mDNS dan USB { #docker-host }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"To find printers on the network by mDNS, to print on CUPS queues of the host "
"or on USB printers, start with the override `compose.host.yaml`:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menemui pencetak dalam rangkaian melalui mDNS, mencetak pada baris "
"gilir CUPS hos atau pada pencetak USB, mulakan dengan override "
"`compose.host.yaml`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.host.yaml up -d\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The container then shares the host's network and listens on\n"
"`127.0.0.1:8790` of the host. CUPS queues of the host are\n"
"`ipp://localhost:631/printers/<queue>` in `printers.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kontena kemudian berkongsi rangkaian hos dan mendengar pada\n"
"`127.0.0.1:8790` hos. Baris gilir CUPS hos ialah\n"
"`ipp://localhost:631/printers/<queue>` dalam `printers.toml`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logs { #docker-logs }"
msgstr "Log { #docker-logs }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo docker compose logs -f\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Each request is logged with the client's address, the token's name, the path "
"and the status; each job with its label, printer and outcome. Tokens and "
"label contents are never logged."
msgstr ""
"Setiap permintaan dilog dengan alamat klien, nama token, laluan dan "
"statusnya; setiap kerja cetak dengan label, pencetak dan hasilnya. Token dan "
"kandungan label tidak pernah dilog."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating { #docker-update }"
msgstr "Kemas kini { #docker-update }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /opt/tavletta\n"
"sudo git fetch --tags\n"
"sudo git checkout v1.2.2         # the new release\n"
"cd packaging/docker\n"
"sudo docker compose pull\n"
"sudo docker compose up -d\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Read the release notes first. Waiting jobs are canceled when the server "
"stops; a label being printed is finished. `config/`, `labels/` and `fonts/` "
"are kept."
msgstr ""
"Baca nota keluaran dahulu. Kerja cetak yang menunggu dibatalkan apabila "
"pelayan berhenti; label yang sedang dicetak disiapkan. `config/`, `labels/` "
"dan `fonts/` dikekalkan."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup { #docker-backup }"
msgstr "Sandaran { #docker-backup }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Back up the three folders: `config/` (the printer list, the token hashes), "
"`labels/` (the labels and their counters: the next number of each label with "
"`{=counter}` is saved in its file) and `fonts/`. The image can be pulled "
"again at any time."
msgstr ""
"Sandarkan ketiga-tiga folder: `config/` (senarai pencetak, hash token), "
"`labels/` (label dan pembilangnya: nombor seterusnya bagi setiap label "
"dengan `{=counter}` disimpan dalam failnya) dan `fonts/`. Imej boleh ditarik "
"semula pada bila-bila masa."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uninstalling { #docker-uninstall }"
msgstr "Penyahpasangan { #docker-uninstall }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /opt/tavletta/packaging/docker\n"
"sudo docker compose down\n"
"sudo docker image rm ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2\n"
"sudo rm -r /opt/tavletta     # also deletes config, labels and fonts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option B: native with systemd { #native }"
msgstr "Pilihan B: natif dengan systemd { #native }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"For a server without Docker. Tested on Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04 and Fedora "
"44. The installation needs internet access (Python packages from PyPI, one "
"from GitHub)."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pelayan tanpa Docker. Diuji pada Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04 dan Fedora "
"44. Pemasangan memerlukan akses internet (pakej Python daripada PyPI, satu "
"daripada GitHub)."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. System packages { #native-packages }"
msgstr "1. Pakej sistem { #native-packages }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Debian, Ubuntu:"
msgstr "Debian, Ubuntu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt install python3 python3-venv python3-gi python3-gi-cairo gir1.2-pango-1.0 \\\n"
"    gettext git fontconfig fonts-dejavu-core\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Fedora:"
msgstr "Fedora:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo dnf install python3 python3-gobject gobject-introspection pango gettext git-core\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "No GTK is needed. `gettext` and `git` are needed only while installing."
msgstr ""
"GTK tidak diperlukan. `gettext` dan `git` hanya diperlukan semasa memasang."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Install Tavletta { #native-install }"
msgstr "2. Pasang Tavletta { #native-install }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Into its own Python environment in `/opt/tavletta`, which uses the system's "
"PyGObject:"
msgstr ""
"Ke dalam persekitaran Python tersendiri di `/opt/tavletta`, yang menggunakan "
"PyGObject sistem:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo python3 -m venv --system-site-packages /opt/tavletta\n"
"sudo /opt/tavletta/bin/pip install \"git+https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git@v1.2.2\"\n"
"/opt/tavletta/bin/tavletta --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Service user and folders { #native-user }"
msgstr "3. Pengguna perkhidmatan dan folder { #native-user }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo useradd --system --home-dir /var/lib/tavletta --create-home \\\n"
"    --shell /usr/sbin/nologin tavletta\n"
"sudo install -d -o tavletta -g tavletta -m 0750 /etc/tavletta /var/lib/tavletta/labels\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path | Content | Owner, mode |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/printers.toml` | the printers ([as above](#printers)) | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/tokens.toml` | the token hashes | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/var/lib/tavletta/labels/` | the label files | `tavletta`, 750 |\n"
"| `/usr/local/share/fonts/` | fonts of your own | `root`, readable by all |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Laluan | Kandungan | Pemilik, mod |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/printers.toml` | pencetak ([seperti di atas](#printers)) | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/tokens.toml` | hash token | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/var/lib/tavletta/labels/` | fail label | `tavletta`, 750 |\n"
"| `/usr/local/share/fonts/` | fon anda sendiri | `root`, boleh dibaca oleh semua |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Create the tokens as the service user, so the file belongs to it:"
msgstr "Cipta token sebagai pengguna perkhidmatan, supaya fail miliknya:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo -u tavletta /opt/tavletta/bin/tavletta token new inventory-tool --role print \\\n"
"    --printer it-cab --tokens /etc/tavletta/tokens.toml --printers /etc/tavletta/printers.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server refuses a `tokens.toml` that every user may change, and warns "
"about one that others may read."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan menolak `tokens.toml` yang boleh diubah oleh semua pengguna, dan "
"memberi amaran tentang yang boleh dibaca orang lain."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. The service { #native-service }"
msgstr "4. Perkhidmatan { #native-service }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service` runs the server as `tavletta`, "
"sandboxed (read-only system, no home folders, no capabilities, 1 GB memory):"
msgstr ""
"`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service` menjalankan pelayan sebagai "
"`tavletta`, dalam kotak pasir (sistem baca sahaja, tiada folder utama, tiada "
"capability, memori 1 GB):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo curl -fsSLo /etc/systemd/system/tavletta-server.service \\\n"
"    https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/raw/tag/v1.2.2/packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service\n"
"sudo systemctl daemon-reload\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now tavletta-server\n"
"systemctl status tavletta-server\n"
"curl http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/health\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`sudo systemctl reload tavletta-server` reads `tokens.toml` again (SIGHUP); "
"it is also read again whenever it changes."
msgstr ""
"`sudo systemctl reload tavletta-server` membaca `tokens.toml` semula "
"(SIGHUP); ia juga dibaca semula setiap kali berubah."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`sudo systemctl restart tavletta-server` after changing `printers.toml` or "
"installing fonts."
msgstr ""
"`sudo systemctl restart tavletta-server` selepas mengubah `printers.toml` "
"atau memasang fon."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Logs: `journalctl -u tavletta-server -f`."
msgstr "Log: `journalctl -u tavletta-server -f`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "The time zone is the server's (`timedatectl`)."
msgstr "Zon waktu ialah zon waktu pelayan (`timedatectl`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"For a single user on a desktop there is the user service `packaging/systemd/"
"tavletta.service` instead."
msgstr ""
"Untuk seorang pengguna pada desktop terdapat perkhidmatan pengguna "
"`packaging/systemd/tavletta.service` sebagai gantinya."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating { #native-update }"
msgstr "Kemas kini { #native-update }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo /opt/tavletta/bin/pip install --upgrade \"git+https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git@v1.2.2\"\n"
"sudo curl -fsSLo /etc/systemd/system/tavletta-server.service \\\n"
"    https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/raw/tag/v1.2.2/packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service\n"
"sudo systemctl daemon-reload\n"
"sudo systemctl restart tavletta-server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Back up `/etc/tavletta`, `/var/lib/tavletta/labels` and your fonts."
msgstr "Sandarkan `/etc/tavletta`, `/var/lib/tavletta/labels` dan fon anda."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option C: Debian or Fedora package { #package }"
msgstr "Pilihan C: pakej Debian atau Fedora { #package }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Each release has packages for Debian 13 (trixie) and Fedora 44 on x86-64: "
"Tavletta, the Python packages it needs that the distribution does not have, "
"and `tavletta-server`, the service of option B, installed but not enabled, "
"with the user `tavletta` and its folders. Installing them needs only the "
"distribution's package sources, no PyPI or GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Setiap keluaran mempunyai pakej untuk Debian 13 (trixie) dan Fedora 44 pada "
"x86-64: Tavletta, pakej Python yang diperlukannya yang tiada dalam "
"pengedaran, dan `tavletta-server`, perkhidmatan pilihan B, dipasang tetapi "
"tidak didayakan, dengan pengguna `tavletta` dan foldernya. Memasangnya hanya "
"memerlukan sumber pakej pengedaran, tanpa PyPI atau GitHub."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install { #package-install }"
msgstr "1. Pasang { #package-install }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"From the [latest release](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"releases/latest), download into an empty folder the `.deb` files and "
"`SHA256SUMS-deb` (Debian), or the `.noarch.rpm` and `.x86_64.rpm` files and "
"`SHA256SUMS-rpm` (Fedora). Check and install them:"
msgstr ""
"Daripada [keluaran terkini](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"releases/latest), muat turun ke dalam folder kosong fail `.deb` dan "
"`SHA256SUMS-deb` (Debian), atau fail `.noarch.rpm` dan `.x86_64.rpm` serta "
"`SHA256SUMS-rpm` (Fedora). Semak dan pasangnya:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sha256sum --ignore-missing -c SHA256SUMS-deb && sudo apt install ./*.deb   # Debian\n"
"sha256sum --ignore-missing -c SHA256SUMS-rpm && sudo dnf install ./*.noarch.rpm ./*.x86_64.rpm   # Fedora\n"
"/usr/bin/tavletta --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Configure and start { #package-start }"
msgstr "2. Konfigurasi dan mula { #package-start }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The package `tavletta-server` has made `/etc/tavletta` and `/var/lib/"
"tavletta/labels`, owned by `tavletta`, with the paths of [option B](#native-"
"user). Put `printers.toml` there ([as above](#printers)), make the tokens as "
"the service user, then start the service:"
msgstr ""
"Pakej `tavletta-server` telah mencipta `/etc/tavletta` dan `/var/lib/"
"tavletta/labels`, dimiliki oleh `tavletta`, dengan laluan [pilihan B]"
"(#native-user). Letakkan `printers.toml` di sana ([seperti di atas]"
"(#printers)), cipta token sebagai pengguna perkhidmatan, kemudian mulakan "
"perkhidmatan:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo install -o tavletta -g tavletta -m 600 printers.toml /etc/tavletta/\n"
"sudo -u tavletta /usr/bin/tavletta token new inventory-tool --role print \\\n"
"    --printer it-cab --tokens /etc/tavletta/tokens.toml --printers /etc/tavletta/printers.toml\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now tavletta-server\n"
"curl http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/health\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Reload, restart and logs work as in [option B](#native-service). The service "
"prints to network printers; it has no access to devices."
msgstr ""
"Reload, restart dan log berfungsi seperti dalam [pilihan B](#native-"
"service). Perkhidmatan mencetak ke pencetak rangkaian; ia tiada akses kepada "
"peranti."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating { #package-update }"
msgstr "Kemas kini { #package-update }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Install the packages of the new release the same way; a running service is "
"restarted with the new version. Back up `/etc/tavletta` and `/var/lib/"
"tavletta/labels`."
msgstr ""
"Pasang pakej keluaran baharu dengan cara yang sama; perkhidmatan yang sedang "
"berjalan dimulakan semula dengan versi baharu. Sandarkan `/etc/tavletta` dan "
"`/var/lib/tavletta/labels`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse proxy and HTTPS { #proxy }"
msgstr "Reverse proxy dan HTTPS { #proxy }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server speaks plain HTTP on `127.0.0.1`. Other computers reach it "
"through a reverse proxy that adds HTTPS. Give the server the proxy's address "
"with `--trusted-proxy`, so the log and the limits per client see the real "
"client, not the proxy."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan bertutur HTTP biasa pada `127.0.0.1`. Komputer lain mencapainya "
"melalui reverse proxy yang menambah HTTPS. Berikan pelayan alamat proksi "
"dengan `--trusted-proxy`, supaya log dan had bagi setiap klien melihat klien "
"sebenar, bukan proksi."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traefik (Docker) { #traefik }"
msgstr "Traefik (Docker) { #traefik }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Traefik and Tavletta in one Docker network, Traefik with a fixed address. In "
"`compose.yaml`, remove `ports:` (the server is then reached only through "
"Traefik) and add:"
msgstr ""
"Traefik dan Tavletta dalam satu rangkaian Docker, Traefik dengan alamat "
"tetap. Dalam `compose.yaml`, buang `ports:` (pelayan kemudian hanya dicapai "
"melalui Traefik) dan tambah:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"services:\n"
"  tavletta:\n"
"    # ... as in compose.yaml, without ports:\n"
"    networks: [proxy]\n"
"    command:\n"
"      - \"--mcp\"\n"
"      - \"--printers\"\n"
"      - \"/config/printers.toml\"\n"
"      - \"--tokens\"\n"
"      - \"/config/tokens.toml\"\n"
"      - \"--trusted-proxy\"\n"
"      - \"172.30.0.10/32\"          # Traefik's address in the network\n"
"    labels:\n"
"      - \"traefik.enable=true\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.routers.tavletta.rule=Host(`labels.example.com`)\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.routers.tavletta.entrypoints=websecure\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.routers.tavletta.tls.certresolver=letsencrypt\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.services.tavletta.loadbalancer.server.port=8790\"\n"
"\n"
"networks:\n"
"  proxy:\n"
"    external: true                # Traefik's network, Traefik at 172.30.0.10\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "nginx { #nginx }"
msgstr "nginx { #nginx }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server on `127.0.0.1` answers only requests for a local host name "
"(against DNS rebinding): nginx must not pass on the public name. Its default "
"(`127.0.0.1:8790`) is right; do not add `proxy_set_header Host $host`."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan pada `127.0.0.1` hanya menjawab permintaan untuk nama hos tempatan "
"(terhadap DNS rebinding): nginx tidak boleh meneruskan nama awam. Lalainya "
"(`127.0.0.1:8790`) betul; jangan tambah `proxy_set_header Host $host`."

#. type: Fenced code block (nginx)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"server {\n"
"    listen 443 ssl;\n"
"    server_name labels.example.com;\n"
"    ssl_certificate     /etc/ssl/certs/labels.example.com.pem;\n"
"    ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/private/labels.example.com.key;\n"
"\n"
"    client_max_body_size 4m;           # as the server's --max-body\n"
"    location / {\n"
"        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8790;\n"
"        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n"
"        proxy_read_timeout 330s;       # print requests may wait up to 300 s\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Start the server with `--trusted-proxy 127.0.0.1/32` (append it to "
"`ExecStart` in the service, or to `command:` in `compose.yaml`)."
msgstr ""
"Mulakan pelayan dengan `--trusted-proxy 127.0.0.1/32` (tambahkan pada "
"`ExecStart` dalam perkhidmatan, atau pada `command:` dalam `compose.yaml`)."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Caddy { #caddy }"
msgstr "Caddy { #caddy }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Caddy passes on the public host name by default; set it to the server's own:"
msgstr ""
"Caddy meneruskan nama hos awam secara lalai; tetapkannya kepada nama pelayan "
"sendiri:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"labels.example.com {\n"
"    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8790 {\n"
"        header_up Host {upstream_hostport}\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Caddy gets a certificate by itself. Start the server with `--trusted-proxy "
"127.0.0.1/32`."
msgstr ""
"Caddy mendapat sijil sendiri. Mulakan pelayan dengan `--trusted-proxy "
"127.0.0.1/32`."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Firewall { #firewall }"
msgstr "Tembok api { #firewall }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Open only the proxy's port 443, and only for the networks that need it (the "
"inventory tool's server, the clients' VLAN)."
msgstr ""
"Buka hanya port 443 proksi, dan hanya untuk rangkaian yang memerlukannya "
"(pelayan alat inventori, VLAN klien)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Port 8790 stays closed: the server listens on `127.0.0.1` (Docker publishes "
"it on `127.0.0.1` only)."
msgstr ""
"Port 8790 kekal tertutup: pelayan mendengar pada `127.0.0.1` (Docker "
"menerbitkannya pada `127.0.0.1` sahaja)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Outgoing from the server to the printers: TCP 9100 and 631."
msgstr "Keluar dari pelayan ke pencetak: TCP 9100 dan 631."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Never make the server reachable from the internet."
msgstr "Jangan sekali-kali menjadikan pelayan boleh dicapai dari internet."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Signing in with OpenID Connect { #oidc }"
msgstr "Log masuk dengan OpenID Connect { #oidc }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"People can sign in to the web page with your organisation's identity "
"provider (Keycloak, Authentik, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta …) instead of an "
"access token; their roles at the provider become Tavletta's roles.  Programs "
"keep using tokens. It needs HTTPS through the reverse proxy (only `http://"
"localhost` works without, for testing)."
msgstr ""
"Orang boleh log masuk ke halaman web dengan penyedia identiti organisasi "
"anda (Keycloak, Authentik, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta …) dan bukannya token "
"akses; peranan mereka pada penyedia menjadi peranan Tavletta. Program terus "
"menggunakan token. Ia memerlukan HTTPS melalui reverse proxy (hanya `http://"
"localhost` berfungsi tanpanya, untuk ujian)."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Register a client at the provider: confidential (with a secret), the "
"authorization code flow only, PKCE S256, redirect URI `https://"
"labels.example.com/oidc/callback`, post-logout redirect URI `https://"
"labels.example.com/`. Make the roles or groups reach the ID token: in "
"Keycloak a mapper *User Client Role* (or *User Realm Role*)  on the client "
"with *Add to ID token* on; Authentik sends `groups`."
msgstr ""
"Daftarkan klien pada penyedia: confidential (dengan secret), aliran "
"authorization code sahaja, PKCE S256, redirect URI `https://"
"labels.example.com/oidc/callback`, post-logout redirect URI `https://"
"labels.example.com/`. Pastikan peranan atau kumpulan sampai ke ID token: "
"dalam Keycloak sebuah mapper *User Client Role* (atau *User Realm Role*) "
"pada klien dengan *Add to ID token* dihidupkan; Authentik menghantar "
"`groups`."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Put the secret into `config/oidc-secret` (the secret alone, mode 600)  and "
"write `config/oidc.toml` (`cp oidc.example.toml config/oidc.toml` gives a "
"commented start):"
msgstr ""
"Letakkan secret dalam `config/oidc-secret` (secret sahaja, mod 600) dan "
"tulis `config/oidc.toml` (`cp oidc.example.toml config/oidc.toml` memberi "
"permulaan yang berkomen):"

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   [oidc]\n"
"   issuer = \"https://id.example.com/realms/example\"\n"
"   client_id = \"tavletta\"\n"
"   client_secret_file = \"/config/oidc-secret\"\n"
"   public_url = \"https://labels.example.com\"\n"
"   provider_name = \"Example ID\"\n"
"   roles_claim = \"resource_access.tavletta.roles\"   # Authentik: \"groups\"\n"
"\n"
"   [oidc.roles]\n"
"   preview = [\"tavletta-preview\"]\n"
"   print = [\"tavletta-print\"]\n"
"   admin = [\"tavletta-admin\"]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Add `\"--oidc\"` and `\"/config/oidc.toml\"` to `command:` in `compose.yaml` "
"(native: to `ExecStart`, with `/etc/tavletta/...`), keep `--trusted-proxy`, "
"and restart. With `--trusted-proxy` the server needs `public_url` and does "
"not start without it."
msgstr ""
"Tambah `\"--oidc\"` dan `\"/config/oidc.toml\"` pada `command:` dalam "
"`compose.yaml` (native: pada `ExecStart`, dengan `/etc/tavletta/...`), "
"kekalkan `--trusted-proxy`, dan mulakan semula. Dengan `--trusted-proxy` "
"pelayan memerlukan `public_url` dan tidak bermula tanpanya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Signing in needs PyJWT, which the container image and the deb and rpm "
"packages have; the Flatpak has not, and nothing can be installed into it: "
"run the server from one of the others for `--oidc`."
msgstr ""
"Log masuk memerlukan PyJWT, yang dimiliki imej kontena serta pakej deb dan "
"rpm; Flatpak tidak memilikinya, dan tiada apa dapat dipasang di dalamnya: "
"untuk `--oidc`, jalankan pelayan daripada salah satu yang lain."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The page then shows \"Sign in with Example ID\". Someone without one of the "
"roles gets \"no access\". A session lasts 8 hours, or 60 minutes without use "
"(`session_hours`, `idle_minutes`); a role removed or an account disabled at "
"the provider counts from the next sign in, so keep sessions short where "
"admins sign in. `token_login = false` hides the token field on the page. "
"Printers can be limited per role (`[oidc.printers]`) or by a claim "
"(`printers_claim`). Every key and the security details: [docs/server.md]"
"(https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"server.md#signing-in-with-openid-connect-oidctoml)."
msgstr ""
"Halaman kemudian memaparkan \"Log masuk dengan Example ID\". Seseorang tanpa "
"salah satu peranan mendapat \"tiada akses\". Satu sesi bertahan 8 jam, atau "
"60 minit tanpa penggunaan (`session_hours`, `idle_minutes`); peranan yang "
"ditarik balik atau akaun yang dilumpuhkan pada penyedia hanya diambil kira "
"mulai log masuk berikutnya, jadi pastikan sesi pendek di tempat pentadbir "
"log masuk. `token_login = false` menyembunyikan medan token pada halaman. "
"Pencetak boleh dihadkan mengikut peranan (`[oidc.printers]`) atau dengan "
"sebuah claim (`printers_claim`). Setiap kunci dan butiran keselamatan: [docs/"
"server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"server.md#signing-in-with-openid-connect-oidctoml)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fonts { #fonts }"
msgstr "Fon { #fonts }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A label is drawn with the fonts of the computer that prints it. A text in a "
"font the server does not have is drawn in another one; the preview and the "
"print job then warn with `font_missing` (for example `Element 2: the font "
"Source Sans 3 is not installed – another font is used`)."
msgstr ""
"Label dilukis dengan fon komputer yang mencetaknya. Teks dalam fon yang "
"tiada pada pelayan dilukis dalam fon lain; pratonton dan kerja cetak "
"kemudian memberi amaran dengan `font_missing` (contohnya `Element 2: the "
"font Source Sans 3 is not installed – another font is used`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A metric-compatible stand-in counts as installed: it has the same widths, so "
"the text takes the room it was designed for. Liberation Sans stands in for "
"Arial and Helvetica (Liberation Sans Narrow for Arial Narrow), Liberation "
"Serif for Times New Roman, Liberation Mono for Courier New, Carlito for "
"Calibri, Caladea for Cambria, Gelasio for Georgia, and the TeX Gyre fonts "
"for Helvetica, Times and Courier; also for their styles named as a family "
"(`Arial Bold`, `Calibri Light`). Only a stand-in that is installed counts: "
"without one, Arial is warned about."
msgstr ""
"Pengganti yang serasi metrik dikira sebagai dipasang: ia mempunyai lebar "
"yang sama, jadi teks mengambil ruang seperti yang direka. Liberation Sans "
"menggantikan Arial dan Helvetica (Liberation Sans Narrow untuk Arial "
"Narrow), Liberation Serif untuk Times New Roman, Liberation Mono untuk "
"Courier New, Carlito untuk Calibri, Caladea untuk Cambria, Gelasio untuk "
"Georgia, dan fon TeX Gyre untuk Helvetica, Times dan Courier; juga untuk "
"gayanya yang dinamakan sebagai keluarga (`Arial Bold`, `Calibri Light`). "
"Hanya pengganti yang dipasang dikira: tanpanya, Arial diberi amaran."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Docker: the image has DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation and Carlito.  Copy "
"other fonts (`.ttf`, `.otf`, e.g. the corporate font) into `fonts/` and "
"restart: `sudo docker compose restart`. More Debian font packages: build the "
"image yourself, `sudo docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml "
"build --build-arg FONTS=\"fonts-dejavu-core fonts-adobe-sourcesans3 fonts-"
"liberation fonts-crosextra-carlito fonts-noto-core\"`, then `up -d` with the "
"same two files."
msgstr ""
"Docker: imej mempunyai DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation dan Carlito. Salin "
"fon lain (`.ttf`, `.otf`, cth. fon korporat) ke `fonts/` dan mula semula: "
"`sudo docker compose restart`. Lebih banyak pakej fon Debian: bina imej "
"sendiri, `sudo docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml build --"
"build-arg FONTS=\"fonts-dejavu-core fonts-adobe-sourcesans3 fonts-liberation "
"fonts-crosextra-carlito fonts-noto-core\"`, kemudian `up -d` dengan dua fail "
"yang sama."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Native: install the distribution's font packages (Debian, Ubuntu: `fonts-"
"adobe-sourcesans3`; Fedora: `adobe-source-sans-pro-fonts`) or copy the font "
"files to `/usr/local/share/fonts/`, then `sudo fc-cache -f` and restart the "
"service."
msgstr ""
"Natif: pasang pakej fon pengedaran (Debian, Ubuntu: `fonts-adobe-"
"sourcesans3`; Fedora: `adobe-source-sans-pro-fonts`) atau salin fail fon ke "
"`/usr/local/share/fonts/`, kemudian `sudo fc-cache -f` dan mulakan semula "
"perkhidmatan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Check what the server has: `fc-list : family` (in the container: `sudo "
"docker compose exec tavletta fc-list : family`)."
msgstr ""
"Semak apa yang ada pada pelayan: `fc-list : family` (dalam kontena: `sudo "
"docker compose exec tavletta fc-list : family`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Fonts may need a license for use on a server; Source Sans 3, Liberation, "
"Carlito, DejaVu and Noto are free."
msgstr ""
"Fon mungkin memerlukan lesen untuk digunakan pada pelayan; Source Sans 3, "
"Liberation, Carlito, DejaVu dan Noto adalah percuma."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security checklist { #security }"
msgstr "Senarai semak keselamatan { #security }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"One token per program or device, with the smallest role (`print` for "
"programs, `preview` for monitoring) and limited to its printers (`--"
"printer`); an expiry date for temporary ones."
msgstr ""
"Satu token bagi setiap program atau peranti, dengan peranan terkecil "
"(`print` untuk program, `preview` untuk pemantauan) dan dihadkan kepada "
"pencetaknya (`--printer`); tarikh luput untuk yang sementara."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Tokens kept in a password manager; `tokens.toml` mode 600."
msgstr "Token disimpan dalam pengurus kata laluan; `tokens.toml` mod 600."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "`printers.toml` in use: programs can print only on these printers."
msgstr ""
"`printers.toml` digunakan: program hanya boleh mencetak pada pencetak ini."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "`max_copies` per printer set to what is sensible."
msgstr ""
"`max_copies` bagi setiap pencetak ditetapkan kepada nilai yang munasabah."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server reachable only through the HTTPS proxy, only from the networks "
"that need it; never from the internet."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan hanya boleh dicapai melalui proksi HTTPS, hanya dari rangkaian yang "
"memerlukannya; tidak pernah dari internet."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "`--trusted-proxy` set to the proxy's own address, nothing wider."
msgstr ""
"`--trusted-proxy` ditetapkan kepada alamat proksi sendiri, tidak lebih luas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"With `--oidc`: `public_url` set, the client confidential with PKCE, only the "
"roles people need, short sessions where admins sign in, `oidc-secret` mode "
"600."
msgstr ""
"Dengan `--oidc`: `public_url` ditetapkan, klien confidential dengan PKCE, "
"hanya peranan yang diperlukan orang, sesi pendek di tempat pentadbir log "
"masuk, `oidc-secret` mod 600."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"No one prints from a browser: `--no-web-ui` (the web page needs no token to "
"load, but shows nothing without one)."
msgstr ""
"Tiada sesiapa mencetak daripada pelayar: `--no-web-ui` (halaman web tidak "
"memerlukan token untuk dimuatkan, tetapi tidak menunjukkan apa-apa tanpanya)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Updates: watch the releases and update within weeks; the image of each "
"release brings Debian's security updates of its day (`docker compose pull`)."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini: pantau keluaran dan kemas kini dalam masa beberapa minggu; imej "
"setiap keluaran membawa kemas kini keselamatan Debian pada harinya (`docker "
"compose pull`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Backup of `config/` (or `/etc/tavletta`) and the labels."
msgstr "Sandaran `config/` (atau `/etc/tavletta`) dan label."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The details of every protection (limits, rate limit, file access, web "
"pages): [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/"
"branch/main/docs/server.md#security)."
msgstr ""
"Butiran setiap perlindungan (had, had kadar, akses fail, halaman web): [docs/"
"server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"server.md#security)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting { #troubleshooting }"
msgstr "Penyelesaian masalah { #troubleshooting }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom | Cause and remedy |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| A printer is `UNREACHABLE` (`printer_timeout`, `printer_not_found`) | The server cannot reach it: test from the server with `nc -vz <printer> 9100` (631 for IPP); check the address, the firewall, that the printer is on. In Docker the container must reach the printer's network. |\n"
"| `401 unauthorized` | Token missing, mistyped, expired or removed from `tokens.toml`. The header is `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. |\n"
"| `429 too_many_requests` | Ten wrong tokens from this address within a minute: fix the token, wait a minute. Behind a reverse proxy not given with `--trusted-proxy` everyone shares the proxy's address. |\n"
"| `429 queue_full` | 100 jobs (20 per token) are waiting: the printer is slow or stopped; check it, retry later. |\n"
"| `503 busy` | All request or render slots are taken for a moment: retry after a second or two. |\n"
"| `404 printer_not_found` | Not in `printers.toml`, or the token may not use it (`--printer`). |\n"
"| `413 label_too_large` | The label has too many elements, too long texts or renders larger than 40 megapixels: simplify it or use fewer data rows per request. |\n"
"| `421 wrong_host` | A reverse proxy passes the public host name to a server on `127.0.0.1`: see [nginx](#nginx) and [Caddy](#caddy). |\n"
"| `font_missing` in the warnings, text looks wrong | The font is not installed on the server: see [Fonts](#fonts). |\n"
"| `other_labels_loaded` in the warnings | The printer has other labels loaded than the label's: load the matching roll, or check the label's size and gap. A ZPL printer may report a distance it measured on an earlier roll: calibrate it. |\n"
"| `409 counter_not_saved` | The label file is not writable for the server's user: `chown` it to the user (Docker: 1000, native: `tavletta`). |\n"
"| Date or time on labels off by an hour or two | The container runs on UTC: set `TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` in `.env`, then `docker compose up -d`. |\n"
"| \"Signing in did not work\" on the web page | The log says why: the provider cannot be reached, the redirect URI or secret is wrong at the provider, or the page is reached over plain HTTP (set `public_url`, `--trusted-proxy`). \"No access\": the roles do not reach the ID token (a mapper is missing) or none is mapped in `[oidc.roles]`. |\n"
"| The server does not start | `docker compose logs` or `journalctl -u tavletta-server`: a mistake in `printers.toml` or `tokens.toml` is named with its key. |\n"
"| Permission denied on the folders (Fedora, RHEL with SELinux and Podman) | Add `:Z` to the volumes in `compose.yaml`. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Gejala | Punca dan penyelesaian |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Pencetak `UNREACHABLE` (`printer_timeout`, `printer_not_found`) | Pelayan tidak dapat mencapainya: uji daripada pelayan dengan `nc -vz <printer> 9100` (631 untuk IPP); semak alamat, tembok api, dan bahawa pencetak dihidupkan. Dalam Docker kontena mesti dapat mencapai rangkaian pencetak. |\n"
"| `401 unauthorized` | Token tiada, tersalah taip, tamat tempoh atau dibuang daripada `tokens.toml`. Pengepalanya ialah `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. |\n"
"| `429 too_many_requests` | Sepuluh token salah dari alamat ini dalam seminit: betulkan token, tunggu seminit. Di belakang reverse proxy yang tidak diberikan dengan `--trusted-proxy`, semua orang berkongsi alamat proksi. |\n"
"| `429 queue_full` | 100 kerja cetak (20 bagi setiap token) menunggu: pencetak perlahan atau berhenti; semaknya, cuba semula kemudian. |\n"
"| `503 busy` | Semua slot permintaan atau render telah diambil seketika: cuba semula selepas satu atau dua saat. |\n"
"| `404 printer_not_found` | Tiada dalam `printers.toml`, atau token tidak boleh menggunakannya (`--printer`). |\n"
"| `413 label_too_large` | Label mempunyai terlalu banyak elemen, teks terlalu panjang atau dirender lebih besar daripada 40 megapiksel: ringkaskannya atau gunakan lebih sedikit baris data bagi setiap permintaan. |\n"
"| `421 wrong_host` | Reverse proxy meneruskan nama hos awam ke pelayan pada `127.0.0.1`: lihat [nginx](#nginx) dan [Caddy](#caddy). |\n"
"| `font_missing` dalam amaran, teks kelihatan salah | Fon tidak dipasang pada pelayan: lihat [Fon](#fonts). |\n"
"| `other_labels_loaded` dalam amaran | Pencetak memuatkan label yang lain daripada label anda: muatkan gulungan yang betul, atau semak saiz dan jurang label. Pencetak ZPL mungkin melaporkan jarak yang diukurnya pada gulungan terdahulu: tentukur. |\n"
"| `409 counter_not_saved` | Fail label tidak boleh ditulis oleh pengguna pelayan: `chown` kepada pengguna itu (Docker: 1000, natif: `tavletta`). |\n"
"| Tarikh atau masa pada label tersasar satu atau dua jam | Kontena berjalan pada UTC: tetapkan `TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` dalam `.env`, kemudian `docker compose up -d`. |\n"
"| \"Log masuk tidak berjaya\" pada halaman web | Log menerangkan sebabnya: penyedia tidak dapat dicapai, redirect URI atau secret salah pada penyedia, atau halaman dicapai melalui HTTP biasa (tetapkan `public_url`, `--trusted-proxy`). \"Tiada akses\": peranan tidak sampai ke ID token (mapper tiada) atau tiada yang dipetakan dalam `[oidc.roles]`. |\n"
"| Pelayan tidak bermula | `docker compose logs` atau `journalctl -u tavletta-server`: kesilapan dalam `printers.toml` atau `tokens.toml` dinamakan dengan kuncinya. |\n"
"| Permission denied pada folder (Fedora, RHEL dengan SELinux dan Podman) | Tambah `:Z` pada volume dalam `compose.yaml`. |\n"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print server"
msgstr "Pelayan cetak"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Other programs, AI assistants and people in a browser can print labels "
"through Tavletta without opening the window: `tavletta serve` offers a web "
"page for people and a web interface for programs (REST API), `tavletta mcp` "
"connects AI assistants such as Claude."
msgstr ""
"Program lain, pembantu AI dan orang dalam pelayar boleh mencetak label "
"melalui Tavletta tanpa membuka tetingkap: `tavletta serve` menawarkan "
"halaman web untuk manusia dan antara muka web untuk program (REST API), "
"`tavletta mcp` menyambungkan pembantu AI seperti Claude."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Setting up the server for a company, with Docker or systemd, HTTPS and "
"fonts: [Server installation](server-install.md)."
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan pelayan untuk syarikat, dengan Docker atau systemd, HTTPS dan "
"fon: [Pemasangan pelayan](server-install.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Every request and error code: [API reference](api.md)."
msgstr "Setiap permintaan dan kod ralat: [Rujukan API](api.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"A walkthrough for programs, with code in Python and C#: [Connecting an "
"inventory tool](api-guide.md)."
msgstr ""
"Panduan langkah demi langkah untuk program, dengan kod Python dan C#: "
"[Menyambungkan alat inventori](api-guide.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start { #start }"
msgstr "Mula { #start }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tavletta serve --labels-dir ~/Labels\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "The server listens on `http://127.0.0.1:8790`, only on this computer."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan mendengar pada `http://127.0.0.1:8790`, hanya pada komputer ini."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Only label files in the labels folder (and its subfolders) can be used, with "
"their data files. Without `--labels-dir`: `~/.local/share/tavletta/labels`."
msgstr ""
"Hanya fail label dalam folder label (dan subfoldernya) boleh digunakan, "
"dengan fail datanya. Tanpa `--labels-dir`: `~/.local/share/tavletta/labels`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Printer address, safety margin and print settings are those set in the app."
msgstr ""
"Alamat pencetak, jidar keselamatan dan tetapan cetakan ialah yang ditetapkan "
"dalam aplikasi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Open `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` in a browser: the [web page](#web-page)."
msgstr "Buka `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` dalam pelayar: [halaman web](#web-page)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`--mcp` adds the connection for AI assistants at `/mcp`."
msgstr "`--mcp` menambah sambungan untuk pembantu AI pada `/mcp`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Stop with Ctrl+C: waiting jobs are canceled, a label being printed is "
"finished and the counter saved."
msgstr ""
"Henti dengan Ctrl+C: kerja cetak yang menunggu dibatalkan, label yang sedang "
"dicetak disiapkan dan pembilang disimpan."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printers { #printers }"
msgstr "Pencetak { #printers }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Name the printers in a file `printers.toml` and start the server with `--"
"printers printers.toml`. Programs then choose a printer by its name; no "
"other printer can be used."
msgstr ""
"Namakan pencetak dalam fail `printers.toml` dan mulakan pelayan dengan `--"
"printers printers.toml`. Program kemudian memilih pencetak mengikut namanya; "
"tiada pencetak lain boleh digunakan."

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  [printers.shipping]\n"
"  backend = \"cab\"\n"
"  host = \"cab-shipping.example.com\"\n"
"  description = \"Shipping labels\"\n"
"  location = \"Warehouse, gate 2\"\n"
"  default = true\n"
"  max_copies = 200\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`backend` is the printer model, `host` the printer's address."
msgstr "`backend` ialah model pencetak, `host` alamat pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The printer's settings, as in the app's printer settings, go into a table of "
"their own; only the ones the model has:"
msgstr ""
"Tetapan pencetak, seperti dalam tetapan pencetak aplikasi, masuk ke dalam "
"jadual tersendiri; hanya yang dimiliki model itu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  [printers.inventory]\n"
"  backend = \"cab\"\n"
"  host = \"cab-it.example.com\"\n"
"\n"
"  [printers.inventory.settings]\n"
"  method = \"transfer\"\n"
"  upside_down = true\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`method` is the [[ui:Print method]] (`printer`, `transfer`, `direct`), "
"`upside_down` [[ui:Print upside down]], `offset_mm` the [[ui:Print offset]] "
"(−5 to 5), `labels_per_job` [[ui:Labels per job]] (1 to 1000, 250 by "
"default); others are `quality`, `chain`, `high_res`, `feed_mm`, `darkness`, "
"`media` and `outlines`, see [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/"
"joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md#printers)."
msgstr ""
"`method` ialah [[ui:Print method]] (`printer`, `transfer`, `direct`), "
"`upside_down` [[ui:Print upside down]], `offset_mm` [[ui:Print offset]] (−5 "
"hingga 5), `labels_per_job` [[ui:Labels per job]] (1 hingga 1000, 250 secara "
"lalai); yang lain ialah `quality`, `chain`, `high_res`, `feed_mm`, "
"`darkness`, `media` dan `outlines`, lihat [docs/server.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"server.md#printers)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The printer's state tells the print method set on the printer "
"(`media.print_method`) and the one its jobs print with "
"(`media.job_print_method`): with `method = \"transfer\"` a cab set up for "
"thermal direct prints the server's jobs with a ribbon. The same for how the "
"labels are found: `media.media_type` and `media.job_media_type`."
msgstr ""
"Keadaan pencetak menyatakan kaedah cetakan yang ditetapkan pada pencetak "
"(`media.print_method`) dan yang digunakan kerja cetaknya untuk mencetak "
"(`media.job_print_method`): dengan `method = \"transfer\"` cab yang "
"ditetapkan kepada terma terus mencetak kerja cetak pelayan dengan reben. "
"Perkara yang sama untuk cara label ditemui: `media.media_type` dan "
"`media.job_media_type`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Mistakes in the file are named when the server starts."
msgstr "Kesilapan dalam fail dinamakan apabila pelayan bermula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "The list of printers shows each printer with its state."
msgstr "Senarai pencetak memaparkan setiap pencetak dengan keadaannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The server searches the network for printers only when started with `--"
"discover`."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan hanya mencari pencetak dalam rangkaian apabila dimulakan dengan `--"
"discover`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access token { #token }"
msgstr "Token akses { #token }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Create a token and keep it secret:"
msgstr "Cipta token dan rahsiakannya:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  mkdir -p ~/.config/tavletta\n"
"  openssl rand -hex 32 > ~/.config/tavletta/token\n"
"  chmod 600 ~/.config/tavletta/token\n"
"  tavletta serve --token-file ~/.config/tavletta/token\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Every request then needs the header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`."
msgstr ""
"Setiap permintaan kemudian memerlukan pengepala `Authorization: Bearer "
"<token>`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"To listen on another address (`--host 0.0.0.0`), a token is required.  For "
"other computers, put a reverse proxy with HTTPS in front."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendengar pada alamat lain (`--host 0.0.0.0`), token diperlukan. Untuk "
"komputer lain, letakkan reverse proxy dengan HTTPS di hadapan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`--allow-printer` limits the printer addresses, for example `--allow-printer "
"'*.local'`."
msgstr ""
"`--allow-printer` menghadkan alamat pencetak, contohnya `--allow-printer "
"'*.local'`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access per device { #tokens }"
msgstr "Akses bagi setiap peranti { #tokens }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Several devices or people get a token each, with a role:"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa peranti atau orang masing-masing mendapat token, dengan peranan:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  tavletta token new shipping-pc --role print --tokens ~/.config/tavletta/tokens.toml\n"
"  tavletta serve --printers printers.toml --tokens ~/.config/tavletta/tokens.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The token is shown only once; the file keeps only a fingerprint (hash)  of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Token dipaparkan sekali sahaja; fail hanya menyimpan cap jari (hash)-nya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`preview` only lists and shows previews, `print` also prints and follows its "
"own jobs, `admin` sees and cancels all jobs and uploads and deletes "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"`preview` hanya menyenaraikan dan menunjukkan pratonton, `print` juga "
"mencetak dan mengikuti kerja cetaknya sendiri, `admin` melihat dan "
"membatalkan semua kerja cetak serta memuat naik dan memadam templat."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`--printer shipping` limits a token to that printer, `--expires 2027-12-31` "
"to a date."
msgstr ""
"`--printer shipping` menghadkan token kepada pencetak itu, `--expires "
"2027-12-31` kepada satu tarikh."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"To take a token back, delete its entry in `tokens.toml`. The server notices "
"it at once."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menarik balik token, padamkan entrinya dalam `tokens.toml`. Pelayan "
"menyedarinya serta-merta."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web page { #web-page }"
msgstr "Halaman web { #web-page }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The server's own page, at its address (`http://127.0.0.1:8790/`, or the "
"address of the [reverse proxy](server-install.md#proxy)):"
msgstr ""
"Halaman milik pelayan sendiri, pada alamatnya (`http://127.0.0.1:8790/`, "
"atau alamat [reverse proxy](server-install.md#proxy)):"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"**Sign in** with an access token (without a token on the server there is "
"nothing to sign in to). The browser keeps it in this tab only; \"Sign out\" "
"forgets it. Where the server is set up for it, \"Sign in with …\" uses your "
"organisation's account instead ([OpenID Connect](server-install.md#oidc))."
msgstr ""
"**Log masuk** dengan token akses (tanpa token pada pelayan tiada apa untuk "
"dilog masuki). Pelayar menyimpannya dalam tab ini sahaja; \"Log keluar\" "
"melupakannya. Jika pelayan disediakan untuknya, \"Log masuk dengan …\" "
"menggunakan akaun organisasi anda sebagai ganti ([OpenID Connect](server-"
"install.md#oidc))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"**Printers**: their state, the labels or tape loaded and problems, in words."
msgstr ""
"**Pencetak**: keadaannya, label atau pita yang dimuatkan dan masalah, dalam "
"perkataan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"**Templates**: the label files of the labels folder with a preview.  Data "
"fields show the first row of the template's data file, or sample values if "
"it has none or it is missing. \"Print\" fills in the fields of one label and "
"shows the preview as it is typed; the elements a field fills are outlined in "
"it. With an `admin` token, templates are uploaded (`.tavletta` files) and "
"deleted here."
msgstr ""
"**Templat**: fail label dalam folder label beserta pratonton. Medan data "
"menunjukkan baris pertama fail data templat, atau nilai contoh jika tiada "
"atau hilang. \"Cetak\" mengisi medan satu label dan menunjukkan pratonton "
"semasa ditaip; elemen yang diisi sesuatu medan dilorekkan garis tepi di "
"dalamnya. Dengan token `admin`, templat dimuat naik (fail `.tavletta`) dan "
"dipadam di sini."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "**Series**, step by step:"
msgstr "**Siri**, langkah demi langkah:"

#. type: Bullet: '  1. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Data: a CSV, XLSX or ODS file, a list pasted from a spreadsheet, or no data "
"at all. Leading zeros stay (`00300`)."
msgstr ""
"Data: fail CSV, XLSX atau ODS, senarai yang ditampal daripada hamparan, atau "
"tiada data langsung. Sifar di hadapan kekal (`00300`)."

#. type: Bullet: '  2. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Assign: which column fills which field of the template (the same names are "
"assigned already, case and spaces aside). The preview of the first label "
"beside it outlines the field in use; each field shows its value, each column "
"its first values."
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan: lajur mana mengisi medan templat yang mana (nama yang sama sudah "
"ditetapkan, tanpa mengira huruf besar-kecil dan ruang). Pratonton label "
"pertama di sebelahnya melorekkan medan yang digunakan; setiap medan "
"menunjukkan nilainya, setiap lajur nilai pertamanya."

#. type: Bullet: '  3. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Choose: all rows, some rows (`1-20, 25, 30-`), or by ranges of a field. "
"Without data, ranges make the values: Inventory number from `3000` to `5685` "
"is 2686 labels, `00300` to `00450` keeps the zeros, a step makes every "
"second or tenth number; `3000-5685` can be typed or pasted at once."
msgstr ""
"Pilih: semua baris, beberapa baris (`1-20, 25, 30-`), atau mengikut julat "
"sesuatu medan. Tanpa data, julat menghasilkan nilainya: Nombor inventori "
"dari `3000` hingga `5685` ialah 2686 label, `00300` hingga `00450` "
"mengekalkan sifar, satu langkah menghasilkan setiap nombor kedua atau "
"kesepuluh; `3000-5685` boleh ditaip atau ditampal sekali gus."

#. type: Bullet: '  4. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Check: the number of labels, the first and the last one, the limits of the "
"server and the printer."
msgstr ""
"Semak: bilangan label, yang pertama dan yang terakhir, had pelayan dan "
"pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '  5. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Print: from 100 labels on, the page asks first. The progress shows how many "
"are printed; Cancel stops after the current label (a cab printer: after the "
"current job of up to [[ui:Labels per job]] labels). After a cancel or a "
"printer problem, \"Continue from …\" prints the rest."
msgstr ""
"Cetak: mulai 100 label, halaman bertanya dahulu. Kemajuan menunjukkan berapa "
"yang sudah dicetak; Batal berhenti selepas label yang sedang dicetak "
"(pencetak cab: selepas kerja cetak semasa yang berisi paling banyak "
"[[ui:Labels per job]] label). Selepas pembatalan atau masalah pencetak, "
"\"Teruskan dari …\" mencetak bakinya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The page speaks the language of the browser, or the one chosen at the top: "
"every language of the app, Arabic right to left. Times are on a 24-hour "
"clock."
msgstr ""
"Halaman bertutur dalam bahasa pelayar, atau yang dipilih di atas: setiap "
"bahasa aplikasi, bahasa Arab dari kanan ke kiri. Masa menggunakan jam 24 jam."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`--no-web-ui` turns the page off, for servers that only programs use."
msgstr ""
"`--no-web-ui` mematikan halaman, untuk pelayan yang hanya digunakan program."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Programs (REST API) { #api }"
msgstr "Program (REST API) { #api }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The description of all requests: the [API reference](api.md), and for "
"programs `http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/openapi.json` (OpenAPI 3.1, with any "
"valid token)."
msgstr ""
"Huraian semua permintaan: [Rujukan API](api.md), dan untuk program `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/openapi.json` (OpenAPI 3.1, dengan sebarang token yang "
"sah)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/v1/labels` lists the labels, `GET /api/v1/labels/<name>` shows "
"what can be filled in: element names, variables and columns."
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/v1/labels` menyenaraikan label, `GET /api/v1/labels/<name>` "
"menunjukkan apa yang boleh diisi: nama elemen, pemboleh ubah dan lajur."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`POST /api/v1/preview` returns the label as a PNG image."
msgstr "`POST /api/v1/preview` mengembalikan label sebagai imej PNG."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`POST /api/v1/print` queues a print job; `GET /api/v1/jobs/<id>` shows its "
"state, `DELETE` cancels it between two labels (a cab printer: between two "
"jobs of a series)."
msgstr ""
"`POST /api/v1/print` meletakkan kerja cetak dalam baris gilir; `GET /api/v1/"
"jobs/<id>` menunjukkan keadaannya, `DELETE` membatalkannya antara dua label "
"(pencetak cab: antara dua kerja cetak dalam satu siri)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Each printer prints one job after the other."
msgstr "Setiap pencetak mencetak satu kerja cetak demi satu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Messages come in the language of the `Accept-Language` header."
msgstr "Mesej datang dalam bahasa pengepala `Accept-Language`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Without an access token, requests that ask printers need the header `X-"
"Tavletta-Request: 1`, so that no web page can send them."
msgstr ""
"Tanpa token akses, permintaan yang bertanya kepada pencetak memerlukan "
"pengepala `X-Tavletta-Request: 1`, supaya tiada halaman web boleh "
"menghantarnya."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(cat ~/.config/tavletta/token)\" \\\n"
"     -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"serial\", \"data_rows\": [{\"Code\": \"B-07-1\", \"Name\": \"Tea\", \"Shelf\": \"B-07\", \"Box\": \"1\"}], \"copies\": 2}' \\\n"
"     http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/print\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`set` fills in elements by their name and variables such as `{=lot}`, as on "
"the command line."
msgstr ""
"`set` mengisi elemen mengikut namanya dan pemboleh ubah seperti `{=lot}`, "
"seperti pada baris arahan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Serial labels: `\"data_rows\"`, one object per label with every column the "
"label uses (`[{\"Name\": \"Tea\", …}, {\"Name\": \"Rice\", …}]`), or "
"`\"data_file\"` with a table in the labels folder."
msgstr ""
"Label bersiri: `\"data_rows\"`, satu objek bagi setiap label dengan setiap "
"lajur yang digunakan label (`[{\"Name\": \"Tea\", …}, {\"Name\": \"Rice\", "
"…}]`), atau `\"data_file\"` dengan jadual dalam folder label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"One label from another program, for example an inventory: the fields as one "
"data row, the printer by its name."
msgstr ""
"Satu label daripada program lain, contohnya inventori: medan sebagai satu "
"baris data, pencetak mengikut namanya."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(cat ~/.config/tavletta/token)\" \\\n"
"       -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"       -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"copies\": 1,\n"
"            \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}]}' \\\n"
"       http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/print\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The whole walkthrough, with series, retries and code in Python and C#: "
"[Connecting an inventory tool](api-guide.md)."
msgstr ""
"Panduan lengkap, dengan siri, percubaan semula dan kod Python dan C#: "
"[Menyambungkan alat inventori](api-guide.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`{=counter}`: the server saves the next number in the label file. A program "
"that keeps its own numbers sends the number in the data row or as "
"`\"counter_start\"` with `\"no_save_counter\": true`."
msgstr ""
"`{=counter}`: pelayan menyimpan nombor seterusnya dalam fail label. Program "
"yang menyimpan nombornya sendiri menghantar nombor itu dalam baris data atau "
"sebagai `\"counter_start\"` dengan `\"no_save_counter\": true`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI assistants (MCP) { #mcp }"
msgstr "Pembantu AI (MCP) { #mcp }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The assistant can list the labels and printers, show a preview, print and "
"follow or cancel print jobs. It asks before it uses a tool, depending on its "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Pembantu boleh menyenaraikan label dan pencetak, menunjukkan pratonton, "
"mencetak serta mengikuti atau membatalkan kerja cetak. Ia bertanya sebelum "
"menggunakan alat, bergantung pada tetapannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Claude Code:"
msgstr "Claude Code:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "claude mcp add tavletta -- tavletta mcp --labels-dir ~/Labels\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Claude Desktop, in `claude_desktop_config.json`:"
msgstr "Claude Desktop, dalam `claude_desktop_config.json`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"mcpServers\": {\n"
"    \"tavletta\": {\n"
"      \"command\": \"tavletta\",\n"
"      \"args\": [\"mcp\", \"--labels-dir\", \"/home/me/Labels\"]\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Over the network: `tavletta serve --mcp` and the address `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8790/mcp` with the access token as `Authorization: Bearer` header."
msgstr ""
"Melalui rangkaian: `tavletta serve --mcp` dan alamat `http://127.0.0.1:8790/"
"mcp` dengan token akses sebagai pengepala `Authorization: Bearer`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Printing uses real labels: ask for a preview first."
msgstr "Pencetakan menggunakan label sebenar: minta pratonton dahulu."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server and container { #service }"
msgstr "Pelayan dan kontena { #service }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"On a server for a company: [Server installation](server-install.md), with "
"Docker Compose (`packaging/docker/compose.yaml`) or as a system service "
"(`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service`)."
msgstr ""
"Pada pelayan syarikat: [Pemasangan pelayan](server-install.md), dengan "
"Docker Compose (`packaging/docker/compose.yaml`) atau sebagai perkhidmatan "
"sistem (`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"As a service of your user on a desktop: `packaging/systemd/tavletta.service` "
"(instructions in the file)."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai perkhidmatan pengguna anda pada desktop: `packaging/systemd/"
"tavletta.service` (arahan terdapat dalam fail)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Technical details and security: [docs/server.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md)."
msgstr ""
"Butiran teknikal dan keselamatan: [docs/server.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container image { #container }"
msgstr "Imej kontena { #container }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The print server is published as a container image for amd64 and arm64 (also "
"a Raspberry Pi with a 64-bit system):"
msgstr ""
"Pelayan cetak diterbitkan sebagai imej kontena untuk amd64 dan arm64 (juga "
"Raspberry Pi dengan sistem 64-bit):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker pull ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2.2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`1.2.2` is a release, `1.2` the latest bug fix release of 1.2, `latest` the "
"latest release. `edge` is the state of development, not a release."
msgstr ""
"`1.2.2` ialah satu keluaran, `1.2` keluaran pembetulan pepijat terkini bagi "
"1.2, `latest` keluaran terkini. `edge` ialah keadaan pembangunan, bukan "
"keluaran."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`packaging/docker/compose.yaml` uses the published image: `docker compose "
"pull`, then `docker compose up -d`."
msgstr ""
"`packaging/docker/compose.yaml` menggunakan imej yang diterbitkan: `docker "
"compose pull`, kemudian `docker compose up -d`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"To build the image yourself instead, add `compose.build.yaml`: `docker "
"compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml up -d --build`."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membina imej sendiri, tambah `compose.build.yaml`: `docker compose -f "
"compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml up -d --build`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The image runs without root rights and reports its state to Docker "
"(`HEALTHCHECK`)."
msgstr ""
"Imej berjalan tanpa hak root dan melaporkan keadaannya kepada Docker "
"(`HEALTHCHECK`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Check that an image was built from Tavletta's repository, with the [GitHub "
"CLI](https://cli.github.com) or [cosign](https://docs.sigstore.dev):"
msgstr ""
"Semak bahawa imej dibina daripada repositori Tavletta, dengan [GitHub CLI]"
"(https://cli.github.com) atau [cosign](https://docs.sigstore.dev):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gh attestation verify oci://ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2.2 --repo joshii-h/tavletta\n"
"cosign verify ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2.2 \\\n"
"    --certificate-oidc-issuer https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com \\\n"
"    --certificate-identity-regexp '^https://github\\.com/joshii-h/tavletta/\\.github/workflows/docker\\.yml@refs/tags/v'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Label sheets { #sheets }"
msgstr "Helaian label { #sheets }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"With the [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]], an office printer prints on "
"sheets of self-adhesive labels: A4 or US Letter pages with a grid of labels, "
"as Avery, Zweckform, Herma and many others sell them. Tavletta knows more "
"than 1700 of these sheets, from the template collection of gLabels."
msgstr ""
"Dengan [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]], pencetak pejabat mencetak pada "
"helaian label pelekat sendiri: halaman A4 atau US Letter dengan grid label, "
"seperti yang dijual oleh Avery, Zweckform, Herma dan ramai lagi. Tavletta "
"mengenali lebih daripada 1700 helaian sebegini, daripada koleksi templat "
"gLabels."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the sheet { #choose }"
msgstr "Pilih helaian { #choose }"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "[[ui:Printer model]]: [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Printer model]]: [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]]."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Label sheet]]. The list of sheets opens."
msgstr "[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Label sheet]]. Senarai helaian dibuka."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"Search by brand and part number as printed on the package (\"Avery L7160\", "
"\"Zweckform 3475\"), or by the size of one label in millimetres (\"70x37\", "
"either way round). The paper size narrows the list down."
msgstr ""
"Cari mengikut jenama dan nombor bahagian seperti yang tercetak pada "
"bungkusan (\"Avery L7160\", \"Zweckform 3475\"), atau mengikut saiz satu "
"label dalam milimeter (\"70x37\", mana-mana susunan). Saiz kertas "
"menyempitkan senarai."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "The picture shows the sheet; [[ui:Use sheet]] takes it."
msgstr "Gambar menunjukkan helaian; [[ui:Use sheet]] memilihnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"The label now has the size of the sheet's labels. Round labels and CDs are "
"designed as a rectangle, and printed only inside their shape; the preview "
"shows them that way."
msgstr ""
"Label kini mempunyai saiz label pada helaian. Label bulat dan CD direka "
"sebagai segi empat tepat, dan dicetak hanya di dalam bentuknya; pratonton "
"menunjukkannya sedemikian."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Turn the content]]: for labels read from the side, such as folder "
"spines: the label is designed lying on its side and turned onto the sheet."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Turn the content]]: untuk label yang dibaca dari sisi, seperti tulang "
"belakang fail: label direka berbaring pada sisinya dan diputar ke atas "
"helaian."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Single label]] prints the label as a page of its own "
"again; choosing [[ui:Label sheet]] again brings back the last sheet."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Single label]] mencetak label sebagai halaman "
"tersendiri semula; memilih [[ui:Label sheet]] sekali lagi mengembalikan "
"helaian terakhir."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partly used sheets { #positions }"
msgstr "Helaian yang separuh digunakan { #positions }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Positions]] shows the sheet. Click a label to leave it out (it is "
"already used) or to print on it again, or set [[ui:Start at position]]: the "
"labels are counted row by row from the top left. This only applies to the "
"first sheet; further sheets are filled completely. The sheet and the "
"positions are saved with the label."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Positions]] menunjukkan helaian. Klik pada label untuk melangkaunya "
"(sudah digunakan) atau untuk mencetak padanya semula, atau tetapkan "
"[[ui:Start at position]]: label dikira baris demi baris dari kiri atas. Ini "
"hanya terpakai pada helaian pertama; helaian seterusnya diisi sepenuhnya. "
"Helaian dan kedudukan disimpan bersama label."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print { #print }"
msgstr "Cetak { #print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Labels]]: how many labels to print. At first as many as positions are "
"chosen; more fill further sheets. The dialog shows how many sheets that "
"takes. One print job takes at most 999 labels; with serial labels that is "
"the rows times the copies of each."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Labels]]: berapa banyak label hendak dicetak. Pada mulanya sebanyak "
"kedudukan yang dipilih; lebih banyak mengisi helaian seterusnya. Dialog "
"menunjukkan berapa helaian diperlukan. Satu kerja cetak mengambil paling "
"banyak 999 label; dengan label bersiri itu ialah baris darab salinan bagi "
"setiap satu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print outlines]]: prints the outline of every label. Print a test page "
"on plain paper first and hold it against a label sheet in front of a light: "
"if the content sits inside the outlines, the sheet fits."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print outlines]]: mencetak garis tepi setiap label. Cetak halaman ujian "
"pada kertas biasa dahulu dan pegang pada helaian label di hadapan cahaya: "
"jika kandungan terletak di dalam garis tepi, helaian itu sesuai."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"Office printers cannot print near the paper's edges. Tavletta asks the "
"printer for that margin and warns if the content of a label (inside the "
"[[ui:Safety margin]]) reaches into it. Leave those positions out, or "
"increase the [[ui:Safety margin]]."
msgstr ""
"Pencetak pejabat tidak boleh mencetak berhampiran tepi kertas. Tavletta "
"bertanya kepada pencetak tentang jidar itu dan memberi amaran jika kandungan "
"label (di dalam [[ui:Safety margin]]) mencapainya. Tinggalkan kedudukan itu, "
"atau tingkatkan [[ui:Safety margin]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"The paper size comes from the sheet; turn off \"fit to page\" in the "
"printer's setup, otherwise the printer may scale the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Saiz kertas datang daripada helaian; matikan \"fit to page\" dalam tetapan "
"pencetak, jika tidak pencetak mungkin menskalakan helaian."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"Older versions of Tavletta refuse to open labels for a label sheet and say "
"that the label needs a newer version, instead of printing them as a single "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Versi Tavletta yang lebih lama menolak membuka label untuk helaian label dan "
"menyatakan bahawa label memerlukan versi yang lebih baharu, dan bukan "
"mencetaknya sebagai satu halaman."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "The sheet templates come from gLabels (© Jaye Evins, MIT license)."
msgstr "Templat helaian datang daripada gLabels (© Jaye Evins, lesen MIT)."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design and print"
msgstr "Reka bentuk dan cetak"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content"
msgstr "Kandungan"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Elements are placed one after another along the label. Order them with "
"[[ui:Move up]] and [[ui:Move down]]."
msgstr ""
"Elemen diletakkan satu demi satu sepanjang label. Susunnya dengan [[ui:Move "
"up]] dan [[ui:Move down]]."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Editing a text element](media/expand.png#only-light)  ![Editing a text "
"element](media/expand-dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Editing a text element](media/expand.png#only-light)  ![Editing a text "
"element](media/expand-dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"**Text**: any installed font, colour, several lines. [[ui:Size]] 0 fills the "
"label height, otherwise fixed in pt."
msgstr ""
"**Teks**: sebarang fon yang dipasang, warna, beberapa baris. [[ui:Size]] 0 "
"memenuhi tinggi label, jika tidak tetap dalam pt."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "**Image**: photos and graphics; drag and drop works too."
msgstr "**Imej**: foto dan grafik; seret dan lepas juga berfungsi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "**Symbol**: a pictogram from the symbol library, see below."
msgstr "**Simbol**: piktograf daripada pustaka simbol, lihat di bawah."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"**Code**: [[ui:Type]] offers 2D codes (QR code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec), "
"linear barcodes (Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, "
"ITF-14) and GS1 codes (GS1-128, GS1 DataMatrix). Below the type it says what "
"the type is for and what it accepts."
msgstr ""
"**Kod**: [[ui:Type]] menawarkan kod 2D (kod QR, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec), "
"kod bar linear (Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, "
"ITF-14) dan kod GS1 (GS1-128, GS1 DataMatrix). Di bawah jenis dinyatakan "
"untuk apa jenis itu dan apa yang diterimanya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"EAN, UPC and ITF-14: enter the digits without the check digit, it is added; "
"with it, it is checked."
msgstr ""
"EAN, UPC dan ITF-14: masukkan digit tanpa digit semakan, ia ditambah; jika "
"disertakan, ia disemak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"GS1-128 and GS1 DataMatrix: application identifiers in brackets, each "
"followed by its value, e.g. `(01)09501101530003(17)261231(10)AB12`.  "
"Tavletta checks identifiers, lengths, dates and check digits and says which "
"identifier is wrong. GS1-128 shows the identifiers in brackets below the "
"bars."
msgstr ""
"GS1-128 dan GS1 DataMatrix: application identifier dalam kurungan, masing-"
"masing diikuti nilainya, cth. `(01)09501101530003(17)261231(10)AB12`. "
"Tavletta menyemak identifier, panjang, tarikh dan digit semakan dan "
"menyatakan identifier mana yang salah. GS1-128 memaparkan identifier dalam "
"kurungan di bawah palang."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A GS1 value with round brackets in it: write the identifiers in square "
"brackets, e.g. `[01]09501101530003[21]A(B)C`."
msgstr ""
"Nilai GS1 dengan kurungan bulat di dalamnya: tulis identifier dalam kurungan "
"siku, cth. `[01]09501101530003[21]A(B)C`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"ITF-14 and GS1-128 on shipping cartons: GS1 asks for modules of at least "
"0.495 mm. On narrow labels they come out narrower: fine for your own "
"scanners, too small for carton labels read in logistics."
msgstr ""
"ITF-14 dan GS1-128 pada karton penghantaran: GS1 meminta modul sekurang-"
"kurangnya 0.495 mm. Pada label sempit ia keluar lebih sempit: sesuai untuk "
"pengimbas anda sendiri, terlalu kecil untuk label karton yang dibaca dalam "
"logistik."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Code 39: a `$`, `/`, `+` or `%` before a capital letter is read as another "
"character by scanners set to Full ASCII; Tavletta warns."
msgstr ""
"Code 39: `$`, `/`, `+` atau `%` sebelum huruf besar dibaca sebagai aksara "
"lain oleh pengimbas yang ditetapkan kepada Full ASCII; Tavletta memberi "
"amaran."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Content a code type cannot take is not changed silently: the element is "
"crossed out and a warning says why."
msgstr ""
"Kandungan yang tidak boleh diterima oleh sesuatu jenis kod tidak diubah "
"secara senyap: elemen dipangkah dan amaran menyatakan sebabnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels with a code type other than QR code, Code 128 and EAN-13 do not open "
"in earlier versions of Tavletta: they say the label needs a newer version."
msgstr ""
"Label dengan jenis kod selain kod QR, Code 128 dan EAN-13 tidak dibuka dalam "
"versi Tavletta terdahulu: ia menyatakan bahawa label memerlukan versi yang "
"lebih baharu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Codes print sharp on every printer: each bar and square is a whole number of "
"printer dots, as close to the designed width as the element's space allows, "
"with the blank margin a scanner needs. The code may come out slightly "
"smaller than designed, centred in its space."
msgstr ""
"Kod dicetak tajam pada setiap pencetak: setiap palang dan petak ialah "
"bilangan bulat titik pencetak, sedekat mungkin dengan lebar yang direka "
"sebagaimana yang dibenarkan ruang elemen, dengan jidar kosong yang "
"diperlukan pengimbas. Kod mungkin keluar sedikit lebih kecil daripada yang "
"direka, di tengah ruangnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A code whose bars are only one printer dot wide, or without room for its "
"blank margin, may not scan: Tavletta warns before printing, make the code "
"larger. A code that does not fit at all is not printed."
msgstr ""
"Kod yang palangnya hanya selebar satu titik pencetak, atau tanpa ruang untuk "
"jidar kosongnya, mungkin tidak dapat diimbas: Tavletta memberi amaran "
"sebelum mencetak, besarkan kod. Kod yang langsung tidak muat tidak dicetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"QR codes with characters beyond plain ASCII (umlauts, °, £ …) are now marked "
"as UTF-8, so scanners read them correctly. Labels made with earlier versions "
"print such a QR code with a different pattern, some with more and smaller "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"Kod QR dengan aksara di luar ASCII biasa (umlaut, °, £ …) kini ditandakan "
"sebagai UTF-8, supaya pengimbas membacanya dengan betul. Label yang dibuat "
"dengan versi terdahulu mencetak kod QR sedemikian dengan corak yang berbeza, "
"sesetengahnya dengan modul yang lebih banyak dan lebih kecil."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels made with earlier versions: QR codes come out a quarter to a third "
"narrower, about half the area (44 to 56 % less), as their blank margin is "
"now inside the element. On narrow tape, where each module is a whole number "
"of printer dots, up to 60 % narrower. Barcodes come out slightly wider."
msgstr ""
"Label yang dibuat dengan versi terdahulu: kod QR keluar suku hingga satu "
"pertiga lebih sempit, kira-kira separuh luasnya (44 hingga 56 % kurang), "
"kerana jidar kosongnya kini berada di dalam elemen. Pada pita sempit, tempat "
"setiap modul ialah bilangan bulat titik pencetak, sehingga 60 % lebih "
"sempit. Kod bar keluar sedikit lebih lebar."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Text style { #text-style }"
msgstr "Gaya teks { #text-style }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Text in a box and a frame, lines and a rounded border](media/"
"design.png#only-light)  ![Text in a box and a frame, lines and a rounded "
"border](media/design-dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Text in a box and a frame, lines and a rounded border](media/"
"design.png#only-light)  ![Text in a box and a frame, lines and a rounded "
"border](media/design-dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The rows of a text element; [[ui:Spacing and fitting]], [[ui:Box and frame]] "
"and [[ui:Outline and shadow]] open a page of their own in the sidebar, its "
"header names the element:"
msgstr ""
"Baris elemen teks; [[ui:Spacing and fitting]], [[ui:Box and frame]] dan "
"[[ui:Outline and shadow]] membuka halaman tersendiri dalam bar sisi, "
"pengepalanya menamakan elemen:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Font]]: family, [[ui:Bold]], [[ui:Italic]], [[ui:Underline]], "
"[[ui:Strikethrough]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Font]]: keluarga, [[ui:Bold]], [[ui:Italic]], [[ui:Underline]], "
"[[ui:Strikethrough]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Spacing and fitting]]: [[ui:Letter spacing]] and [[ui:Line spacing]]; "
"[[ui:Shrink to fit]] makes the text smaller until it fits the label height "
"and, with a fixed length, the length, never below [[ui:Smallest size]]; "
"[[ui:Wrap width]] breaks long lines into several; [[ui:Rotation]] 90° or "
"270° turns the whole text, the letters lie on their side (not upright "
"columns of Chinese or Japanese)."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Spacing and fitting]]: [[ui:Letter spacing]] dan [[ui:Line spacing]]; "
"[[ui:Shrink to fit]] mengecilkan teks sehingga muat pada tinggi label dan, "
"dengan panjang tetap, pada panjang itu, tidak pernah di bawah [[ui:Smallest "
"size]]; [[ui:Wrap width]] memecahkan baris panjang kepada beberapa baris; "
"[[ui:Rotation]] 90° atau 270° memutar seluruh teks, huruf berbaring pada "
"sisinya (bukan lajur tegak aksara Cina atau Jepun)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Letter spacing leaves out scripts whose letters join, such as Arabic or "
"Devanagari."
msgstr ""
"Jarak huruf tidak terpakai pada tulisan yang hurufnya bersambung, seperti "
"Arab atau Devanagari."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Box and frame]]: [[ui:White on black]] cuts the text out of a box in "
"the text colour; [[ui:Background box]] puts a box of another colour behind "
"it; [[ui:Padding]], [[ui:Corner radius]] and [[ui:Frame]] shape the box."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Box and frame]]: [[ui:White on black]] memotong teks keluar daripada "
"kotak dalam warna teks; [[ui:Background box]] meletakkan kotak warna lain di "
"belakangnya; [[ui:Padding]], [[ui:Corner radius]] dan [[ui:Frame]] membentuk "
"kotak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Outline and shadow]]: a line around each letter, a shadow down and to "
"the right."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Outline and shadow]]: garisan di sekeliling setiap huruf, bayang ke "
"bawah dan ke kanan."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images { #images }"
msgstr "Imej { #images }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Crop…]]: drag on the image or type the area in percent."
msgstr "[[ui:Crop…]]: seret pada imej atau taip kawasan dalam peratus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Adjust]]: [[ui:Brightness]], [[ui:Contrast]], [[ui:Gamma]], "
"[[ui:Invert]], [[ui:Rotation]], [[ui:Mirror]], [[ui:Flip]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Adjust]]: [[ui:Brightness]], [[ui:Contrast]], [[ui:Gamma]], "
"[[ui:Invert]], [[ui:Rotation]], [[ui:Mirror]], [[ui:Flip]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Corners and border]]: rounded corners and a border around the image."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Corners and border]]: sudut bulat dan sempadan di sekeliling imej."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Black and white]]: how black-and-white printers print the image, see "
"below."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Black and white]]: cara pencetak hitam putih mencetak imej, lihat di "
"bawah."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lines and shapes { #shapes }"
msgstr "Garisan dan bentuk { #shapes }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Line or shape]] in the add menu:"
msgstr "[[ui:Line or shape]] dalam menu tambah:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Line]]: horizontal, vertical or diagonal, with [[ui:Arrows]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Line]]: mengufuk, menegak atau menyerong, dengan [[ui:Arrows]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Rectangle]] (rounded with [[ui:Corner radius]]) and [[ui:Ellipse]], "
"with a [[ui:Fill]]: solid, hatched, dotted or a grid."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Rectangle]] (bulat dengan [[ui:Corner radius]]) dan [[ui:Ellipse]], "
"dengan [[ui:Fill]]: pepejal, berlorek, bertitik atau grid."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Separator]]: a line across the whole label height between two elements."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Separator]]: garisan merentasi seluruh tinggi label di antara dua "
"elemen."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Line width]] and [[ui:Line style]] (solid, dashed, dotted). Every line "
"is at least one printer dot wide."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Line width]] dan [[ui:Line style]] (pepejal, sengkang, bertitik). "
"Setiap garisan sekurang-kurangnya selebar satu titik pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels with lines or shapes, or with the options on this page, do not open "
"in earlier versions of Tavletta: they say the label needs a newer version. "
"Labels without them open as before."
msgstr ""
"Label dengan garisan atau bentuk, atau dengan pilihan pada halaman ini, "
"tidak dibuka dalam versi Tavletta terdahulu: ia menyatakan bahawa label "
"memerlukan versi yang lebih baharu. Label tanpanya dibuka seperti sebelum "
"ini."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Position { #position }"
msgstr "Kedudukan { #position }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Each element has [[ui:Position]]:"
msgstr "Setiap elemen mempunyai [[ui:Position]]:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Vertical alignment]]: at the top, in the middle or at the bottom of the "
"label height."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Vertical alignment]]: di atas, di tengah atau di bawah tinggi label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Own spacing]]: [[ui:Space after it]] instead of the label's "
"[[ui:Spacing]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Own spacing]]: [[ui:Space after it]] dan bukan [[ui:Spacing]] label."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Free layout { #free-layout }"
msgstr "Reka letak bebas { #free-layout }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Layout]] at the top of [[ui:Content]] places the elements [[ui:One "
"after another]] along the tape, or [[ui:Free]]: each one where you put it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Layout]] di bahagian atas [[ui:Content]] meletakkan elemen [[ui:One "
"after another]] sepanjang pita, atau [[ui:Free]]: setiap satu di tempat yang "
"anda letakkan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the free layout every element has [[ui:Position and size]]: X and Y from "
"the label's top left corner, to a hundredth of a millimetre."
msgstr ""
"Dalam reka letak bebas setiap elemen mempunyai [[ui:Position and size]]: X "
"dan Y dari sudut kiri atas label, sehingga perseratus milimeter."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A text is placed by the top left corner of its letters' ink, a code by its "
"first module. The numbers of other label designers can be taken over as they "
"are."
msgstr ""
"Teks diletakkan mengikut sudut kiri atas dakwat hurufnya, kod mengikut modul "
"pertamanya. Nombor daripada pereka label lain boleh diambil seadanya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A text's [[ui:Size]] is the height of its font (the em) in mm, as label "
"designers give it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Size]] teks ialah tinggi fonnya (em) dalam mm, seperti yang diberikan "
"pereka label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A code's [[ui:Module size]] is rounded to whole printer dots: 0.67 mm at 12 "
"dots per mm prints as 8 dots. Leave room for the quiet zone around the code. "
"Codes can be turned ([[ui:Rotation]]), a barcode has its [[ui:Bar height]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Module size]] kod dibundarkan kepada titik pencetak yang utuh: 0.67 mm "
"pada 12 titik setiap mm dicetak sebagai 8 titik. Tinggalkan ruang untuk zon "
"senyap di sekeliling kod. Kod boleh diputar ([[ui:Rotation]]), kod bar "
"mempunyai [[ui:Bar height]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"An image has its [[ui:Height]], a symbol its [[ui:Size]], a line or shape "
"its width and height. A shipping label fills the label from its position to "
"the right and bottom edge."
msgstr ""
"Imej mempunyai [[ui:Height]], simbol mempunyai [[ui:Size]], garisan atau "
"bentuk mempunyai lebar dan tinggi. Label penghantaran memenuhi label dari "
"kedudukannya hingga tepi kanan dan bawah."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Switching to the free layout for the first time keeps every element where it "
"was."
msgstr ""
"Beralih kepada reka letak bebas buat kali pertama mengekalkan setiap elemen "
"di tempatnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"An element that reaches beyond the label is cut off there; the preview warns "
"about it."
msgstr ""
"Elemen yang melangkaui label dipotong di situ; pratonton memberi amaran "
"tentangnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Labels in the free layout do not open in earlier versions of Tavletta."
msgstr ""
"Label dalam reka letak bebas tidak dibuka dalam versi Tavletta terdahulu."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arranging in the preview { #arrange }"
msgstr "Menyusun dalam pratonton { #arrange }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the free layout the elements can be arranged in the preview with the "
"mouse, a finger or a pen:"
msgstr ""
"Dalam reka letak bebas, elemen boleh disusun dalam pratonton dengan tetikus, "
"jari atau pen:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Click an element to select it; its row in [[ui:Content]] opens. Click with "
"Shift or Ctrl to add an element to the selection or take it out.  Drag "
"across an empty part to select every element the rubber band touches (with "
"Alt held: only those inside it). A click on an empty part selects nothing. "
"Opening an element's row selects it too."
msgstr ""
"Klik pada elemen untuk memilihnya; barisnya dalam [[ui:Content]] terbuka. "
"Klik dengan Shift atau Ctrl untuk menambah elemen pada pilihan atau "
"mengeluarkannya. Seret merentasi bahagian kosong untuk memilih setiap elemen "
"yang disentuh kotak pemilihan (dengan Alt ditahan: hanya yang berada di "
"dalamnya). Klik pada bahagian kosong tidak memilih apa-apa. Membuka baris "
"sesuatu elemen juga memilihnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Drag the selection to move it. It snaps to the label's edges and middle and "
"to the edges and middles of the other elements; a red line shows where. Hold "
"Alt, or Ctrl, to place it freely (some desktops move the window when Alt is "
"held while dragging: then use Ctrl). Hold Shift to move it along one axis "
"only. Escape while dragging puts it back."
msgstr ""
"Seret pilihan untuk menggerakkannya. Ia melekat pada pinggir dan tengah "
"label serta pada pinggir dan tengah elemen lain; garis merah menunjukkan "
"tempatnya. Tahan Alt, atau Ctrl, untuk meletakkannya dengan bebas "
"(sesetengah desktop menggerakkan tetingkap apabila Alt ditahan semasa "
"menyeret: gunakan Ctrl). Tahan Shift untuk menggerakkannya sepanjang satu "
"paksi sahaja. Escape semasa menyeret mengembalikannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"One selected element has handles at its corners and edges: drag one to "
"resize it. A line or shape changes its width and height on their own (Shift "
"keeps its proportions); a text, an image, a symbol and a QR code keep their "
"proportions; a barcode gets longer bars or wider modules. A shipping label "
"is only moved."
msgstr ""
"Satu elemen yang dipilih mempunyai pemegang pada sudut dan pinggirnya: seret "
"satu untuk mengubah saiznya. Garis atau bentuk mengubah lebar dan "
"ketinggiannya secara berasingan (Shift mengekalkan nisbahnya); teks, imej, "
"simbol dan kod QR mengekalkan nisbahnya; kod bar mendapat palang lebih "
"panjang atau modul lebih lebar. Label penghantaran hanya digerakkan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Arrange]] in the header bar aligns the selected elements: one element "
"at the label's edge or middle, several at one another's. It spaces three or "
"more evenly ([[ui:Distribute]]), turns snapping on and off ([[ui:Snap to "
"guides]]) and adds a grid to snap to."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Arrange]] dalam bar pengepala menjajarkan elemen yang dipilih: satu "
"elemen pada pinggir atau tengah label, beberapa elemen sesama sendiri. Ia "
"mengagihkan tiga elemen atau lebih secara sekata ([[ui:Distribute]]), "
"menghidupkan dan mematikan pelekatan ([[ui:Snap to guides]]) dan menambah "
"grid untuk dilekati."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"With the preview focused (click it, or Tab to it), the arrow keys move the "
"selection by 0.1 mm, with Shift by 1 mm; Delete removes it; Ctrl+A selects "
"all elements, Shift+Ctrl+A and Escape none. Sizes are set in the element's "
"row and on its [[ui:Position and size]] page."
msgstr ""
"Dengan pratonton difokuskan (klik padanya, atau Tab ke sana), kekunci anak "
"panah menggerakkan pilihan sebanyak 0.1 mm, dengan Shift sebanyak 1 mm; "
"Delete membuangnya; Ctrl+A memilih semua elemen, Shift+Ctrl+A dan Escape "
"tiada. Saiz ditetapkan dalam baris elemen dan pada halaman [[ui:Position and "
"size]]nya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Every drag, every resize and a run of arrow keys is one step of [[ui:Undo]], "
"in turn with the changes made in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Setiap seretan, setiap pengubahan saiz dan satu siri tekanan anak panah "
"ialah satu langkah [[ui:Undo]], bergilir dengan perubahan yang dibuat dalam "
"bar sisi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the layout [[ui:One after another]] elements can be selected, but not "
"moved: dragging one offers [[ui:Use free layout]]."
msgstr ""
"Dalam reka letak [[ui:One after another]] elemen boleh dipilih, tetapi tidak "
"digerakkan: menyeret satu menawarkan [[ui:Use free layout]]."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Weight and error correction { #weight }"
msgstr "Ketebalan dan pembetulan ralat { #weight }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Weight]] chooses one of the font's own weights, such as Light or "
"Semibold, instead of regular or bold. The bold button sets it back."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Weight]] memilih salah satu ketebalan asal fon, seperti Light atau "
"Semibold, dan bukan biasa atau tebal. Butang tebal mengembalikannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"QR codes have [[ui:Error correction]]: how much of the code may be damaged "
"and still be read. [[ui:Standard (medium)]] keeps the code of earlier "
"versions; the other levels choose the code's pattern as label printers do."
msgstr ""
"Kod QR mempunyai [[ui:Error correction]]: berapa banyak kod boleh rosak dan "
"masih dibaca. [[ui:Standard (medium)]] mengekalkan kod versi terdahulu; "
"tahap lain memilih corak kod seperti yang dilakukan pencetak label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels with a weight or an error correction do not open in earlier versions "
"of Tavletta."
msgstr ""
"Label dengan ketebalan atau pembetulan ralat tidak dibuka dalam versi "
"Tavletta terdahulu."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Black-and-white printers { #black-and-white }"
msgstr "Pencetak hitam putih { #black-and-white }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Text, codes, symbols, lines and borders print with sharp edges: text is "
"drawn without smoothed edges, every part is converted on its own."
msgstr ""
"Teks, kod, simbol, garisan dan sempadan dicetak dengan tepi tajam: teks "
"dilukis tanpa tepi yang dilicinkan, setiap bahagian ditukar secara "
"berasingan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Images: [[ui:Method]] under [[ui:Black and white]]. [[ui:Automatic]] keeps "
"drawings and logos in one or two tones sharp, prints drawings in several "
"flat tones as even patterns and dithers photos; [[ui:Threshold]] sets which "
"grey still prints black."
msgstr ""
"Imej: [[ui:Method]] di bawah [[ui:Black and white]]. [[ui:Automatic]] "
"mengekalkan lukisan dan logo dalam satu atau dua ton tajam, mencetak lukisan "
"dalam beberapa ton rata sebagai corak sekata dan men-dither foto; "
"[[ui:Threshold]] menetapkan kelabu mana yang masih dicetak hitam."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Colour emoji in a text get a line around their shapes, so light parts stay "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Emoji berwarna dalam teks mendapat garisan di sekeliling bentuknya, supaya "
"bahagian cerah kekal kelihatan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Colours print black, or white if they are lighter than what lies behind them "
"(the background colour or image, or a text's box); an element over a light "
"and a dark part takes the colour that shows on most of it."
msgstr ""
"Warna dicetak hitam, atau putih jika lebih cerah daripada yang terletak di "
"belakangnya (warna atau imej latar belakang, atau kotak teks); elemen di "
"atas bahagian cerah dan gelap mengambil warna yang kelihatan pada sebahagian "
"besarnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A warning says when an element would hardly stand out from what lies behind "
"it; codes need more contrast than text, so that they scan."
msgstr ""
"Amaran dipaparkan apabila elemen hampir tidak menonjol daripada yang di "
"belakangnya; kod memerlukan kontras lebih tinggi daripada teks, supaya ia "
"dapat diimbas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "The background colour or image is dithered on its own."
msgstr "Warna atau imej latar belakang di-dither secara berasingan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A shadow prints solid in the other colour, one dot apart from the letters. "
"Outlines and shadows are at least one printer dot."
msgstr ""
"Bayang dicetak pepejal dalam warna yang lain, satu titik dari huruf. Garis "
"tepi dan bayang sekurang-kurangnya satu titik pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Earlier versions dithered every image; now [[ui:Automatic]] keeps drawings "
"and logos sharp."
msgstr ""
"Versi terdahulu men-dither setiap imej; kini [[ui:Automatic]] mengekalkan "
"lukisan dan logo tajam."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Undo and keyboard shortcuts { #shortcuts }"
msgstr "Buat asal dan pintasan papan kekunci { #shortcuts }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Undo]] (Ctrl+Z) and [[ui:Redo]] (Ctrl+Shift+Z); typing into a field "
"counts as one step, also when the field has the focus. Undoing back to the "
"saved label makes it unchanged again."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Undo]] (Ctrl+Z) dan [[ui:Redo]] (Ctrl+Shift+Z); menaip dalam medan "
"dikira satu langkah, juga apabila medan mempunyai fokus. Membuat asal "
"kembali kepada label yang disimpan menjadikannya tidak berubah semula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The open element (its row expanded): Ctrl+D duplicates it, Delete removes "
"it, Alt+Up and Alt+Down move it."
msgstr ""
"Elemen yang terbuka (barisnya dikembangkan): Ctrl+D menggandakannya, Delete "
"memadamnya, Alt+Up dan Alt+Down menggerakkannya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Ctrl+Shift+T, G, Y, B and L add text, an image, a symbol, a code or a line."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+Shift+T, G, Y, B dan L menambah teks, imej, simbol, kod atau garisan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"With the preview focused: the arrow keys move the selected elements (Shift: "
"by 1 mm), Delete removes them, Ctrl+A and Shift+Ctrl+A select all or none "
"([see above](#arrange))."
msgstr ""
"Dengan pratonton difokuskan: kekunci anak panah menggerakkan elemen yang "
"dipilih (Shift: sebanyak 1 mm), Delete membuangnya, Ctrl+A dan Shift+Ctrl+A "
"memilih semua atau tiada ([lihat di atas](#arrange))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Keyboard shortcuts]] (Ctrl+?) in the main menu lists them all."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Keyboard shortcuts]] (Ctrl+?) dalam menu utama menyenaraikan semuanya."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbols"
msgstr "Simbol"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Symbol…]] opens the symbol library: over 7000 pictograms such as "
"arrows, warnings, recycling, tools, food or weather, from Material Design "
"Icons. Search by name, for example \"arrow\" or \"recycle\". The names and "
"categories come from the icon set and are English, so the search is in "
"English too. The list next to the search shows one category; [[ui:Recently "
"used]] shows the symbols chosen last. The \"Brand / Logo\" category and "
"further icons showing brands or trademarks are left out."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Symbol…]] membuka pustaka simbol: lebih 7000 piktograf seperti anak "
"panah, amaran, kitar semula, alat, makanan atau cuaca, daripada Material "
"Design Icons. Cari mengikut nama, contohnya \"arrow\" atau \"recycle\". Nama "
"dan kategori datang daripada set ikon dan dalam bahasa Inggeris, jadi carian "
"juga dalam bahasa Inggeris. Senarai di sebelah carian menunjukkan satu "
"kategori; [[ui:Recently used]] menunjukkan simbol yang dipilih terakhir. "
"Kategori \"Brand / Logo\" dan ikon lain yang menunjukkan jenama atau tanda "
"dagangan ditinggalkan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Size]] 0 fills the label height, otherwise the symbol has this height."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Size]] 0 memenuhi tinggi label, jika tidak simbol mempunyai tinggi ini."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Rotation]]: a quarter turn at a time, clockwise."
msgstr "[[ui:Rotation]]: satu suku pusingan sekali, mengikut arah jam."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The colour is printed on colour and office printers. Black-and-white label "
"printers print symbols in black, or in white if the colour is light, with "
"sharp edges."
msgstr ""
"Warna dicetak pada pencetak warna dan pencetak pejabat. Pencetak label hitam "
"putih mencetak simbol dalam hitam, atau putih jika warna cerah, dengan tepi "
"tajam."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The label file keeps the outline of each symbol, so a label looks the same "
"in later versions. Older versions of Tavletta cannot open labels with "
"symbols and say that the label needs a newer version."
msgstr ""
"Fail label menyimpan garis bentuk setiap simbol, jadi label kelihatan sama "
"dalam versi kemudian. Versi Tavletta yang lebih lama tidak dapat membuka "
"label dengan simbol dan menyatakan bahawa label memerlukan versi yang lebih "
"baharu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Texts and codes can contain [variables](#variables), e.g. a date or a "
"running number."
msgstr ""
"Teks dan kod boleh mengandungi [pemboleh ubah](#variables), cth. tarikh atau "
"nombor berjalan."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Label"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Endless tape:"
msgstr "Pita tanpa putus:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Automatic length]]: the label is as long as its content. Off: fixed "
"[[ui:Length]], content aligned and scaled down if needed."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Automatic length]]: label sepanjang kandungannya. Mati: [[ui:Length]] "
"tetap, kandungan diselaraskan dan dikecilkan jika perlu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "For every label:"
msgstr "Untuk setiap label:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Spacing]]: space at the ends and between elements."
msgstr "[[ui:Spacing]]: ruang di hujung dan di antara elemen."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Edge spacing]]: extra space along the label edges."
msgstr "[[ui:Edge spacing]]: ruang tambahan sepanjang tepi label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Background colour]], [[ui:Background image]]: printed edge to edge."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Background colour]], [[ui:Background image]]: dicetak hingga ke tepi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Border]]: width, 0 = none; always inside the safety margin.  "
"[[ui:Border style]]: [[ui:Corner radius]], [[ui:Line style]] (also double) "
"and [[ui:Inset]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Border]]: lebar, 0 = tiada; sentiasa di dalam jidar keselamatan. "
"[[ui:Border style]]: [[ui:Corner radius]], [[ui:Line style]] (juga berganda) "
"dan [[ui:Inset]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Units]]: millimetres or inches, by default from the system language."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Units]]: milimeter atau inci, secara lalai daripada bahasa sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Die-cut labels have a fixed size instead of a length:"
msgstr "Label potong-acuan mempunyai saiz tetap dan bukan panjang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Die-cut label](media/die-cut.png#only-light)  ![Die-cut label](media/die-"
"cut-dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Die-cut label](media/die-cut.png#only-light)  ![Die-cut label](media/die-"
"cut-dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: a common size, or [[ui:Custom size]] with [[ui:Width]] "
"(across the roll) and [[ui:Height]] (along the roll), as on the label box."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: saiz lazim, atau [[ui:Custom size]] dengan [[ui:Width]] "
"(merentasi gulungan) dan [[ui:Height]] (sepanjang gulungan), seperti pada "
"kotak label."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Gap]]: space between two labels on the roll, usually 2 to 3 mm.  Before "
"printing Tavletta compares height and gap with the distance the printer "
"measured."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Gap]]: ruang di antara dua label pada gulungan, biasanya 2 hingga 3 mm. "
"Sebelum mencetak Tavletta membandingkan tinggi dan jurang dengan jarak yang "
"diukur pencetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Content direction]]: [[ui:Across the roll]] for labels read with the "
"roll running from top to bottom, [[ui:Along the roll]] like on tape."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Content direction]]: [[ui:Across the roll]] untuk label yang dibaca "
"dengan gulungan berjalan dari atas ke bawah, [[ui:Along the roll]] seperti "
"pada pita."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Alignment]]: where the content sits if it is shorter than the label."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Alignment]]: di mana kandungan terletak jika lebih pendek daripada "
"label."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Safety margin]] (printer setting, default 1.5 mm): content and border "
"keep this distance from the label edges. Printers lose a little at the "
"edges, and long labels can run slightly askew. If text is cut off at the "
"edge, increase it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Safety margin]] (tetapan pencetak, lalai 1.5 mm): kandungan dan "
"sempadan mengekalkan jarak ini dari tepi label. Pencetak kehilangan sedikit "
"di tepi, dan label panjang boleh berjalan sedikit senget. Jika teks "
"terpotong di tepi, tingkatkannya."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shipping labels"
msgstr "Label penghantaran"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Carriers and marketplaces send shipping labels as a PDF or an image, often "
"an A4 page with the label in one half or quarter and a receipt or "
"instructions next to it. [[ui:Shipping label…]] in the main menu (or a PDF "
"dropped onto the window) opens such a file and makes a new label of it."
msgstr ""
"Syarikat penghantaran dan pasar dalam talian menghantar label penghantaran "
"sebagai PDF atau imej, selalunya halaman A4 dengan label pada separuh atau "
"satu perempat dan resit atau arahan di sebelahnya. [[ui:Shipping label…]] "
"dalam menu utama (atau PDF yang dilepaskan ke atas tetingkap) membuka fail "
"sedemikian dan membuat label baharu daripadanya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta looks for the label on the page: a large area with the shape of a "
"label, best with a printed frame and a barcode; a page with one label "
"filling it is taken whole. Check the selection: drag it, drag its edges, or "
"draw a new one. [[ui:Next suggestion]] shows other areas that could be the "
"label, [[ui:Whole page]] selects all of it."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta mencari label pada halaman: kawasan besar dengan bentuk label, "
"terbaik dengan bingkai tercetak dan kod bar; halaman dengan satu label yang "
"memenuhinya diambil keseluruhannya. Semak pilihan: seretnya, seret tepinya, "
"atau lukis yang baharu. [[ui:Next suggestion]] menunjukkan kawasan lain yang "
"mungkin label, [[ui:Whole page]] memilih semuanya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Page]]: the page of a PDF with several pages."
msgstr "[[ui:Page]]: halaman PDF dengan beberapa halaman."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: 4 × 6 in (101.6 × 152.4 mm), 100 × 150 mm, 100 × 200 mm, "
"a 62 mm roll that is as long as the label needs, or A6 and A4 paper on the "
"system printer. Only sizes the printer can print are offered; on endless "
"tape the label runs along the tape."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: 4 × 6 in (101.6 × 152.4 mm), 100 × 150 mm, 100 × 200 mm, "
"gulungan 62 mm yang sepanjang yang diperlukan label, atau kertas A6 dan A4 "
"pada pencetak sistem. Hanya saiz yang boleh dicetak pencetak ditawarkan; "
"pada pita tanpa putus label berjalan sepanjang pita."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A label printed sideways on the page is turned upright for the size; "
"[[ui:Rotate left]] and [[ui:Rotate right]] turn it by hand."
msgstr ""
"Label yang dicetak mengiring pada halaman diputar tegak mengikut saiz; "
"[[ui:Rotate left]] dan [[ui:Rotate right]] memutarkannya secara manual."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Scale]]: [[ui:Whole area, centred]] keeps all of the area, [[ui:Fill "
"the label, edges cut off]] fills the label completely."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Scale]]: [[ui:Whole area, centred]] mengekalkan seluruh kawasan, "
"[[ui:Fill the label, edges cut off]] memenuhi label sepenuhnya."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Create label]] replaces the open label. The area stays an element of "
"the label: [[ui:Area]] in its row opens the selection again."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Create label]] menggantikan label yang terbuka. Kawasan kekal sebagai "
"elemen label: [[ui:Area]] pada barisnya membuka pilihan semula."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A PDF page is drawn right at the resolution it is printed at, without "
"smoothing: bars and text come out as whole dots, so barcodes stay readable. "
"Lines thinner than a dot are printed at least one dot wide (sometimes two), "
"and in black even if they are light grey or coloured; white lines thinner "
"than a dot on black may vanish. Label printers get the label at their own "
"resolution. The system printer gets it without loss: as PWG Raster drawn at "
"the printer's resolution, or as a PDF drawn at 300 dpi, which a printer of "
"another resolution scales itself (on a 203 dpi printer the edges of bars may "
"then soften: check that the barcode scans).  Only printers that take nothing "
"but JPEG get a compressed copy."
msgstr ""
"Halaman PDF dilukis tepat pada resolusi semasa dicetak, tanpa pelicinan: "
"palang dan teks keluar sebagai titik utuh, jadi kod bar kekal boleh dibaca. "
"Garisan yang lebih nipis daripada satu titik dicetak sekurang-kurangnya satu "
"titik (kadangkala dua), dan dalam hitam walaupun ia kelabu cerah atau "
"berwarna; garisan putih yang lebih nipis daripada satu titik pada hitam "
"mungkin hilang. Pencetak label mendapat label pada resolusi mereka sendiri. "
"Pencetak sistem mendapatnya tanpa kehilangan: sebagai PWG Raster yang "
"dilukis pada resolusi pencetak, atau sebagai PDF yang dilukis pada 300 dpi, "
"yang diskalakan sendiri oleh pencetak dengan resolusi lain (pada pencetak "
"203 dpi tepi palang mungkin menjadi lembut: semak bahawa kod bar dapat "
"diimbas). Hanya pencetak yang hanya menerima JPEG mendapat salinan termampat."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Images are enlarged by repeating pixels, evenly only by whole multiples "
"(otherwise some pixels come out one dot wider than others); reduced, the "
"pixels that fall together are averaged into grey."
msgstr ""
"Imej dibesarkan dengan mengulang piksel, sekata hanya dengan gandaan penuh "
"(jika tidak sesetengah piksel keluar satu titik lebih lebar daripada yang "
"lain); apabila dikecilkan, piksel yang jatuh bersama dipuratakan menjadi "
"kelabu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"On black-and-white printers the area is looked at piece by piece. Where it "
"is black and white but for grey edges (barcodes and text, also from a scan "
"with grey ink on grey paper), it is cut at the middle between its own black "
"and white, so bars keep clean edges; images are enlarged smoothly for this, "
"so the edges fall between the pixels of the scan.  Where it has grey of its "
"own (a grey logo, grey text down to light grey, a shaded band), the grey is "
"printed as a dot pattern; black text on it gets a narrow edge of paper so "
"that it stays readable. A scan or photo of a label should have at least 150 "
"dpi; at 100 dpi only a clean one keeps all its bars."
msgstr ""
"Pada pencetak hitam putih, kawasan diperhatikan sekeping demi sekeping. Di "
"mana ia hitam dan putih kecuali tepi kelabu (kod bar dan teks, juga daripada "
"imbasan dengan dakwat kelabu pada kertas kelabu), ia dipotong di tengah "
"antara hitam dan putihnya sendiri, supaya palang mengekalkan tepi yang "
"bersih; imej dibesarkan dengan licin untuk ini, jadi tepi jatuh di antara "
"piksel imbasan. Di mana ia mempunyai kelabu sendiri (logo kelabu, teks "
"kelabu hingga kelabu cerah, jalur berlorek), kelabu dicetak sebagai corak "
"titik; teks hitam di atasnya mendapat tepi kertas yang sempit supaya kekal "
"boleh dibaca. Imbasan atau foto label hendaklah sekurang-kurangnya 150 dpi; "
"pada 100 dpi hanya yang bersih mengekalkan semua palangnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The label file keeps the whole page the area was taken from, also outside "
"the area (addresses, tracking numbers). Of a PDF with several pages only the "
"chosen page is kept if it can be copied unchanged, otherwise the whole "
"document (the dialog then says so). Unchanged is strict: a copy that differs "
"by more than rounding anywhere, even by a few dots, is not used; pages with "
"embedded fonts that are drawn slightly differently when copied (TeX, for "
"example) keep the whole document. Of a TIFF with several pages only the "
"chosen page is kept."
msgstr ""
"Fail label menyimpan seluruh halaman tempat kawasan itu diambil, juga di "
"luar kawasan (alamat, nombor penjejakan). Daripada PDF dengan beberapa "
"halaman hanya halaman yang dipilih disimpan jika ia boleh disalin tanpa "
"perubahan, jika tidak keseluruhan dokumen (dialog menyatakannya). Tanpa "
"perubahan itu ketat: salinan yang berbeza lebih daripada pembundaran di mana-"
"mana, walaupun beberapa titik, tidak digunakan; halaman dengan fon terbenam "
"yang dilukis sedikit berbeza apabila disalin (TeX, contohnya) menyimpan "
"keseluruhan dokumen. Daripada TIFF dengan beberapa halaman hanya halaman "
"yang dipilih disimpan."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Opening PDF files needs Poppler (poppler-glib); the Flatpak brings it along, "
"otherwise install it from your distribution (package names: [docs/install.md]"
"(https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"install.md)).  Older versions of Tavletta refuse to open labels with a "
"shipping label and say that the label needs a newer version."
msgstr ""
"Membuka fail PDF memerlukan Poppler (poppler-glib); Flatpak membawanya "
"bersama, jika tidak pasang daripada pengedaran anda (nama pakej: [docs/"
"install.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/"
"docs/install.md)). Versi Tavletta yang lebih lama menolak membuka label "
"dengan label penghantaran dan menyatakan bahawa label memerlukan versi yang "
"lebih baharu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Most shipping label rolls are direct thermal labels: they need no ribbon, "
"but the print fades in heat and sunlight within months. That is fine for a "
"parcel on its way; for labels that must last, use thermal transfer labels "
"with a ribbon."
msgstr ""
"Kebanyakan gulungan label penghantaran ialah label terma terus: ia tidak "
"memerlukan reben, tetapi cetakan pudar dalam haba dan cahaya matahari dalam "
"beberapa bulan. Itu tidak mengapa untuk bungkusan dalam perjalanan; untuk "
"label yang mesti tahan lama, gunakan label pindahan terma dengan reben."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Print dialog](media/print.png#only-light)  ![Print dialog](media/print-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Print dialog](media/print.png#only-light)  ![Print dialog](media/print-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Copies]]: number of labels."
msgstr "[[ui:Copies]]: bilangan label."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The print dialog only shows what the printer can do; the options of each "
"printer are listed under [Printers](printer.md). Printers without such "
"options print with the settings made on the printer itself."
msgstr ""
"Dialog cetak hanya menunjukkan apa yang boleh dilakukan pencetak; pilihan "
"setiap pencetak disenaraikan di bawah [Pencetak](printer.md). Pencetak tanpa "
"pilihan sedemikian mencetak dengan tetapan yang dibuat pada pencetak itu "
"sendiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Export PNG…]] saves the label as image."
msgstr "[[ui:Export PNG…]] menyimpan label sebagai imej."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Variables { #variables }"
msgstr "Pemboleh ubah { #variables }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Variables are filled in when printing, in texts and in the content of codes. "
"[[ui:Insert variable]] next to the text or the content offers the common "
"ones; type the others."
msgstr ""
"Pemboleh ubah diisi semasa mencetak, dalam teks dan dalam kandungan kod. "
"[[ui:Insert variable]] di sebelah teks atau kandungan menawarkan yang lazim; "
"taip yang lain."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Result |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `{=date}` | today, as the system language writes dates |\n"
"| `{=date:%d.%m.%Y}` | today in a format of your own, e.g. 31.12.2026 |\n"
"| `{=date+30d}` | in 30 days, e.g. \"best before\"; also `w` (weeks), `m` (months), `y` (years), `h` (hours), combined like `{=date+1m-1d}` |\n"
"| `{=time}`, `{=time:%H:%M}` | the time |\n"
"| `{=counter}` | a running number |\n"
"| `{=counter:0001}` | with leading zeros, as many digits as the pattern |\n"
"| `{=copy}`, `{=copies}` | number of this copy and of all copies |\n"
"| `{=id}`, `{=id:12}` | a short random ID, 8 characters by default |\n"
"| `{=uuid}` | a random UUID |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pemboleh ubah | Hasil |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `{=date}` | hari ini, seperti bahasa sistem menulis tarikh |\n"
"| `{=date:%d.%m.%Y}` | hari ini dalam format anda sendiri, cth. 31.12.2026 |\n"
"| `{=date+30d}` | dalam 30 hari, cth. \"tarikh luput\"; juga `w` (minggu), `m` (bulan), `y` (tahun), `h` (jam), digabungkan seperti `{=date+1m-1d}` |\n"
"| `{=time}`, `{=time:%H:%M}` | masa |\n"
"| `{=counter}` | nombor berjalan |\n"
"| `{=counter:0001}` | dengan sifar di hadapan, sebanyak digit pada corak |\n"
"| `{=copy}`, `{=copies}` | nombor salinan ini dan semua salinan |\n"
"| `{=id}`, `{=id:12}` | ID rawak pendek, 8 aksara secara lalai |\n"
"| `{=uuid}` | UUID rawak |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Formats use the letters of [strftime](https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"datetime.html#format-codes): `%d` day, `%m` month, `%Y` year, `%H:%M` hours "
"and minutes, `%B` the name of the month."
msgstr ""
"Format menggunakan huruf [strftime](https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"datetime.html#format-codes): `%d` hari, `%m` bulan, `%Y` tahun, `%H:%M` jam "
"dan minit, `%B` nama bulan."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The counter goes up with every printed label, also from copy to copy: 5 "
"copies get 5 numbers. Set the [[ui:Next number]] and the [[ui:Step]] in the "
"[[ui:Counter]] group below the content; it appears once a text uses the "
"counter. After printing the label remembers the next number: save it to keep "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Pembilang meningkat dengan setiap label yang dicetak, juga dari salinan ke "
"salinan: 5 salinan mendapat 5 nombor. Tetapkan [[ui:Next number]] dan "
"[[ui:Step]] dalam kumpulan [[ui:Counter]] di bawah kandungan; ia muncul "
"sebaik sahaja teks menggunakan pembilang. Selepas mencetak, label mengingati "
"nombor seterusnya: simpan untuk mengekalkannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"On one label every variable has one value: a counter or an ID used in the "
"text and in the QR code is the same number. The preview shows the values the "
"next print uses."
msgstr ""
"Pada satu label setiap pemboleh ubah mempunyai satu nilai: pembilang atau ID "
"yang digunakan dalam teks dan dalam kod QR ialah nombor yang sama. Pratonton "
"menunjukkan nilai yang digunakan cetakan seterusnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"To print a brace, double it: `{{=date}}` prints `{=date}`. Texts without "
"variables print exactly as typed, unless the label has a data file for "
"[serial labels](serial.md): then `{{` and `}}` always print one brace."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mencetak pendakap, gandakannya: `{{=date}}` mencetak `{=date}`. Teks "
"tanpa pemboleh ubah dicetak tepat seperti yang ditaip, kecuali label "
"mempunyai fail data untuk [label bersiri](serial.md): maka `{{` dan `}}` "
"sentiasa mencetak satu pendakap."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Dates and times are in the computer's time zone. `+1d` keeps the time of "
"day, also when summer time starts or ends; `+2h` counts real hours. `%z` and "
"`%Z` give the offset and the name of the time zone."
msgstr ""
"Tarikh dan masa mengikut zon waktu komputer. `+1d` mengekalkan waktu dalam "
"hari, juga apabila waktu musim panas bermula atau berakhir; `+2h` mengira "
"jam sebenar. `%z` dan `%Z` memberikan ofset dan nama zon waktu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A label with variables or a counter needs this version of Tavletta or a "
"newer one: older versions refuse to open it instead of printing `{=date}` as "
"it is."
msgstr ""
"Label dengan pemboleh ubah atau pembilang memerlukan versi Tavletta ini atau "
"yang lebih baharu: versi lebih lama menolak membukanya dan bukan mencetak "
"`{=date}` seadanya."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Command line { #command-line }"
msgstr "Baris arahan { #command-line }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`tavletta print` prints a saved label without opening a window, also on a "
"computer without a screen:"
msgstr ""
"`tavletta print` mencetak label yang disimpan tanpa membuka tetingkap, juga "
"pada komputer tanpa skrin:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tavletta print label.tavletta\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --copies 5 --counter-start 100\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --set title=\"Batch 7\" --set lot=A12\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --printer system --host ipp://printer.local/ipp/print\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --copies 3 --dry-run --output preview.png\n"
"tavletta print shelf.tavletta --data items.csv --rows 3-10\n"
"tavletta list-printers\n"
"tavletta --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Without `--host` Tavletta uses the printer set in the app, or the only one "
"it finds on the network. `tavletta list-printers` shows model, address and "
"name of each printer found."
msgstr ""
"Tanpa `--host` Tavletta menggunakan pencetak yang ditetapkan dalam aplikasi, "
"atau satu-satunya yang ditemuinya dalam rangkaian. `tavletta list-printers` "
"menunjukkan model, alamat dan nama setiap pencetak yang ditemui."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`--set NAME=VALUE` replaces the text of the element with that [[ui:Name for "
"the command line]] (in the element's settings), or fills in a variable of "
"your own: `{=lot}` in the label, `--set lot=A12` when printing; a name may "
"use letters of any language. Variables in a new text are filled in; `--set-"
"literal NAME=VALUE` takes the value as it is. `--set date=2026-12-31` prints "
"with another date."
msgstr ""
"`--set NAME=VALUE` menggantikan teks elemen dengan [[ui:Name for the command "
"line]] itu (dalam tetapan elemen), atau mengisi pemboleh ubah anda sendiri: "
"`{=lot}` dalam label, `--set lot=A12` semasa mencetak; nama boleh "
"menggunakan huruf mana-mana bahasa. Pemboleh ubah dalam teks baharu diisi; "
"`--set-literal NAME=VALUE` mengambil nilai seadanya. `--set date=2026-12-31` "
"mencetak dengan tarikh lain."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"With a counter the next number is saved in the label file after printing, "
"also when the printer fails half-way or the print is stopped with Ctrl+C. If "
"the file cannot be written, nothing is printed; `--no-save-counter` prints "
"anyway and saves nothing, so the next print repeats the numbers. The label "
"file is locked while printing: a second `tavletta print` of the same file "
"waits. The window reads the saved number again before printing and saving."
msgstr ""
"Dengan pembilang nombor seterusnya disimpan dalam fail label selepas "
"mencetak, juga apabila pencetak gagal separuh jalan atau cetakan dihentikan "
"dengan Ctrl+C. Jika fail tidak boleh ditulis, tiada apa dicetak; `--no-save-"
"counter` tetap mencetak dan tidak menyimpan apa-apa, jadi cetakan seterusnya "
"mengulang nombor. Fail label dikunci semasa mencetak: `tavletta print` kedua "
"bagi fail yang sama menunggu. Tetingkap membaca nombor yang disimpan semula "
"sebelum mencetak dan menyimpan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"It prints with the choices last made in the app for that printer model: cut, "
"colours, quality, chain printing, high resolution, tape feed, the printer "
"settings and [[ui:Print outlines]] on a label sheet.  `--printer-defaults` "
"takes the model's defaults for these instead (no outlines); the printer's "
"address and the [[ui:Safety margin]] stay as set in the app."
msgstr ""
"Ia mencetak dengan pilihan terakhir yang dibuat dalam aplikasi untuk model "
"pencetak itu: potong, warna, kualiti, chain printing, resolusi tinggi, tape "
"feed, tetapan pencetak dan [[ui:Print outlines]] pada helaian label. `--"
"printer-defaults` mengambil lalai model untuk perkara ini sebagai gantinya "
"(tanpa garis tepi); alamat pencetak dan [[ui:Safety margin]] kekal seperti "
"yang ditetapkan dalam aplikasi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`--print-method printer|transfer|direct` sets the [[ui:Print method]] of a "
"thermal printer that has it for this print (as set on the printer, with a "
"ribbon, thermal direct), also with `--printer-defaults`."
msgstr ""
"`--print-method printer|transfer|direct` menetapkan [[ui:Print method]] "
"pencetak terma yang mempunyainya untuk cetakan ini (seperti ditetapkan pada "
"pencetak, dengan reben, terma terus), juga dengan `--printer-defaults`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A roll whose label distance, as the printer measured it, is not the label's "
"height plus [[ui:Gap]], or whose label size is not the label's (Brother QL "
"with DK labels), gets a hint, as in the window; the label is printed anyway."
msgstr ""
"Gulungan yang jarak labelnya, seperti yang diukur pencetak, bukan tinggi "
"label ditambah [[ui:Gap]], atau yang saiz labelnya bukan saiz label (Brother "
"QL dengan label DK), mendapat petunjuk, seperti dalam tetingkap; label tetap "
"dicetak."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Some printers are asked before the label is drawn, because it depends on "
"what they report (the tape, the resolution), a Brother QL with DK labels for "
"the hint above (the labels loaded); a printer that does not answer within 5 "
"s (2 s for `--dry-run`) gets the label drawn without.  A question still on "
"its way then gets up to 10 s more to end before the label is sent (Tavletta "
"says so); an answer in that time is used.  `--no-query` skips the question."
msgstr ""
"Sesetengah pencetak ditanya sebelum label dilukis, kerana ia bergantung pada "
"apa yang mereka laporkan (pita, resolusi), Brother QL dengan label DK untuk "
"petunjuk di atas (label yang dimuatkan); pencetak yang tidak menjawab dalam "
"5 s (2 s untuk `--dry-run`) mendapat label yang dilukis tanpanya. Soalan "
"yang masih dalam perjalanan kemudian diberi sehingga 10 s lagi untuk tamat "
"sebelum label dihantar (Tavletta memberitahu); jawapan dalam masa itu "
"digunakan. `--no-query` melangkau soalan."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Serial labels: one label for each row of the data file, `--copies` of each; "
"`--data` gives the data file (by default the label's own, if it lies in the "
"label's folder), `--sheet` the sheet, `--rows` the rows (`3-10`, `5`, `7-` "
"to the last). The counter goes on from row to row.  A placeholder without a "
"column or a code a row cannot make stops the print before the first label. "
"See [Serial labels](serial.md)."
msgstr ""
"Label bersiri: satu label bagi setiap baris fail data, `--copies` bagi "
"setiap satu; `--data` memberikan fail data (secara lalai milik label "
"sendiri, jika ia terletak dalam folder label), `--sheet` helaian, `--rows` "
"baris (`3-10`, `5`, `7-` hingga yang terakhir). Pembilang diteruskan dari "
"baris ke baris. Pemegang tempat tanpa lajur atau kod yang tidak dapat dibuat "
"oleh sesuatu baris menghentikan cetakan sebelum label pertama. Lihat [Label "
"bersiri](serial.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`--dry-run` only checks and renders: it lists the texts of each label; `--"
"output file.png` saves each label as [[ui:Export PNG…]] does: as printed, on "
"the whole tape, at most 600 dpi like the preview (a large page coarser), "
"with its resolution (`file-1.png`, `file-2.png` … if they differ; `-` writes "
"the first to standard output). The first label is also drawn as the printer "
"would get it. With `--output` every label is drawn, and a code that does not "
"fit stops the dry run (exit code 4); without it the labels after the first "
"are not drawn: their columns and codes are checked, not whether a code fits."
msgstr ""
"`--dry-run` hanya menyemak dan merender: ia menyenaraikan teks setiap label; "
"`--output file.png` menyimpan setiap label seperti [[ui:Export PNG…]]: "
"seperti yang dicetak, pada seluruh pita, paling banyak 600 dpi seperti "
"pratonton (halaman besar lebih kasar), dengan resolusinya (`file-1.png`, "
"`file-2.png` … jika berbeza; `-` menulis yang pertama ke output standard). "
"Label pertama juga dilukis seperti yang akan diterima pencetak. Dengan `--"
"output` setiap label dilukis, dan kod yang tidak muat menghentikan dry run "
"(kod keluar 4); tanpanya label selepas yang pertama tidak dilukis: lajur dan "
"kodnya disemak, bukan sama ada kod muat."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Exit codes: 0 printed, 1 printer problem or no printer found, 2 wrong "
"arguments, 3 label file cannot be read, still locked by another print or "
"output not written, 4 the label cannot be printed (empty, unknown or "
"unclosed variable, date before the year 1 or after 9999, unknown column, a "
"code a row cannot make), 5 the counter cannot be saved (nothing printed; or "
"printed, but saving failed), 130 interrupted."
msgstr ""
"Kod keluar: 0 dicetak, 1 masalah pencetak atau tiada pencetak ditemui, 2 "
"argumen salah, 3 fail label tidak boleh dibaca, masih dikunci oleh cetakan "
"lain atau output tidak ditulis, 4 label tidak boleh dicetak (kosong, "
"pemboleh ubah tidak diketahui atau tidak ditutup, tarikh sebelum tahun 1 "
"atau selepas 9999, lajur tidak diketahui, kod yang tidak dapat dibuat oleh "
"sesuatu baris), 5 pembilang tidak boleh disimpan (tiada apa dicetak; atau "
"dicetak, tetapi penyimpanan gagal), 130 diganggu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the Flatpak the label file has to be handed over with `--file-"
"forwarding`, a data file too (each between `@@`; the label's own data file "
"is only reached when handed over); write images to standard output:"
msgstr ""
"Dalam Flatpak fail label mesti diserahkan dengan `--file-forwarding`, begitu "
"juga fail data (masing-masing di antara `@@`; fail data label sendiri hanya "
"dicapai apabila diserahkan); tulis imej ke output standard:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flatpak run --file-forwarding xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta print @@ label.tavletta @@\n"
"flatpak run --file-forwarding xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta print @@ label.tavletta @@ --data @@ rows.csv @@\n"
"flatpak run --file-forwarding xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta print --dry-run --output - @@ label.tavletta @@ > preview.png\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A file handed over this way is reached through the document portal. The next "
"counter value is written there like any save, but the portal may not support "
"locking the file: two prints of the same file at the same moment are then "
"not kept apart. If the portal refuses to write, nothing is printed (exit "
"code 5)."
msgstr ""
"Fail yang diserahkan dengan cara ini dicapai melalui document portal. Nilai "
"pembilang seterusnya ditulis di sana seperti simpanan biasa, tetapi portal "
"mungkin tidak menyokong penguncian fail: dua cetakan fail yang sama pada "
"masa yang sama kemudian tidak diasingkan. Jika portal enggan menulis, tiada "
"apa dicetak (kod keluar 5)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Writing the counter back through the document portal has not been tried yet. "
"After the first print from the Flatpak, open the label and check that "
"[[ui:Next number]] went on; if not, give the start with `--counter-start` on "
"every print."
msgstr ""
"Penulisan pembilang kembali melalui document portal belum dicuba. Selepas "
"cetakan pertama daripada Flatpak, buka label dan semak bahawa [[ui:Next "
"number]] diteruskan; jika tidak, berikan permulaan dengan `--counter-start` "
"pada setiap cetakan."
